  <para style="h">Dwɔn</para>
  <para style="toc1">Anwodelɛnli Dwɔn Edwɛkpa Ne</para>
  <para style="toc2">Dwɔn</para>
  <para style="toc3">Dwɔ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Anwodelɛnli Dwɔn Edwɛkpa Ne</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Kɛnlaneɛ ne mɔɔ ta awozinli nu la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1-2" />Mɔlebɛbo ne ɛnee Edwɛkɛ ne wɔ ɛkɛ, na Edwɛkɛ ne nee Nyamenle a wɔ ɛkɛ a, yɛɛ Edwɛkɛ ko ne ala a le Nana Nyamenle. Mɔlebɛbo ne ɛnee ɔ nee Nyamenle a wɔ ɛkɛ a, na debie biala mɔɔ bɛyɛle la, bɛluale ɔ nwo zo a bɛyɛle a. <verse eid="JHN 1:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Yemɔ a ɔbɔle ninyɛne muala a, na debie biala ɛnle ɛkɛ mɔɔ bɛhoatile ye a bɛbɔle a. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Yemɔ a le Damɛnlangoate ngoane a, ngoane ne mɔɔ le kɛnlaneɛ mɔɔ ɔta ɔmaa ewiade amra amuala la. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Yemɔ a le Kɛnlaneɛ ne mɔɔ ɔta awozinli nu mɔɔ awozinli ɛngola ɔ nwo zo keda la.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6-7" />Nyamenle zoanle nrenyia bie mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Dwɔn la kɛ ɔrali Kɛnlaneɛ ne anwo daselɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:6-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Tɛ Dwɔn mumua ne a le Kɛnlaneɛ ne a; na emomu yemɔ ɔralile Kɛnlaneɛ ne anwo daselɛ ala. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Kɛnlaneɛ ɛhye a le nɔhalɛ Kɛnlaneɛ ne mɔɔ ɛlɛba arada aleɛabo amuala a.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Ɔwɔ ewiade, yɛɛ ɔdaye a ɔbɔle ewiade a, noko akee ewiade amra annwu ye. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11-12" />Wɔ ɔdaye ye maanle nu, ɔ nee wɔ ɔdaye ye menli, Dwuuma ne mɔ avinli bɔbɔ, bɛanlie ye bɛando nu. Menli ekyii bie ala a liele ye a. Na bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛliele ye noko la, ɔmaanle bɛ tumi kɛ bɛyɛ Nyamenle amra. Mɔɔ hyianle ala la a le diedi mɔɔ bɛkɛnyia ye wɔ ye ngoanelielɛ tumi ne anu la. <verse eid="JHN 1:11-12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdie ɛhye bɛdi la nyia awolɛ fofolɛ, tɛ nwonane nu awolɛ mɔɔ ɔvi sonla akɔnɔ nu la ɔ, na emomu mɔɔ vi Nyamenle ɛhulolɛdeɛ nu la ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Na Edwɛkɛ ne rayɛle Sonla na ɔ nee yɛ dɛnlanle, nla ɛlolɛ nee nɔhalɛ yile ye tɛkɛɛ. Na yɛ nuhua bie mɔ ɛnwu ye anyunlunyia ne mɔɔ kile kɛ amgba yemɔ a le Selɛ bedevinli ne Ara kotokokye ne la.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dwɔn ɛla ye ali ɛhile Gyisɛse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Dwɔn lile ɔ nwo daselɛ zele kɛ, “Ɛhye a ɛnee melɛka ɔ nwo edwɛkɛ kɛ, ‘Awie bie mɔɔ le kpole tɛla me la ɛlɛba, ɔluakɛ, mɔlebɛbo ne ɛnee ɔwɔ ɛkɛ la.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Na wɔ ye ɛlolɛ totohyia ne anu yɛɛ yɛdayɛ noko yɛnyia bie a. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Mɛla ne yemɔ ɔlua Mosisi anwo zo a yɛ sa hanle ye a, na ɛlolɛ ne nee nɔhalɛ ne ɛdeɛ, yemɔ ɔvi Gyisɛse Kelaese. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Awie biala ɛtɛnwunle Nana Nyamenle ɔ nye zo ɛlɛ, na ɔ Ra kotokokye ne mɔɔ ɔ nee ye wɔ ɛkɛ la yemɔ ɔze ye, na yemɔ a yela ye ali noko yehile yɛ a.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ zoanle bɛ azɛlɛvolɛ nee azɛlɛvolɛ boavolɛma vile Gyɛlusalɛm kɛ bɛhɔbiza Dwɔn kɛ saa yemɔ a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne la a.<verse eid="JHN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Na Dwɔn buale bɛ wienyi kɛ, “Tɛ mame a le Kelaese ne ahaa o.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Na nwane a le wɔ? Wɔmɔ a le Yilaegya anzɛɛ?” Ɔbuale bɛ kɛ, “Kyɛkyɛ.” Eza bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Ɛnee wɔmɔ a le Kapezonli ne anzɛɛ?” Ɔbuale bieko ɔzele kɛ, “Kyɛkyɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Akee bɛzele ye kɛ, “Ɛnee akee nwane a le wɔ? Ka kile yɛ, amaa yɛanwu mɔɔ yɛkaha yɛahile menli mɔɔ zoanle yɛ la. Duzu a ɛlɛ ye ɛka wɔ ɛdawɔ mumua ne ɛ nwo a?”<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Ɔbuale bɛ kɛ, “Mame a le ɛnelɛ ne mɔɔ ɛlɛtea nu wɔ fiemgbole ne azo kɛ, ‘Bɛziezie Awulae adenle ne anu!’ kɛmɔ kapezonli Ayezaya hanle la.”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24-25" />Akee Falasiima ne mɔ mɔɔ wɔ ɛzoavolɛma ne mɔ anu la bizale ye kɛ, “Saa tɛ wɔmɔ a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne anzɛɛ Yilaegya anzɛɛ Kapezonli ne a, ɛnee akee duzu tumi a ɛlɛ kɛ ɛkɛzɔne menli a?”<verse eid="JHN 1:24-25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Dwɔn buale bɛ kɛ, “Mame nzule ala a mefa mesɔne a, na awie bie wɔ menli dɔɔnwo ɛhye anu ɛke kɛkala mɔɔ bɛtɛyiale ye ɛlɛ a, <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />na ɔnrɛhyɛ biala ɔbabɔ ye gyimayɛlɛ ne abo wɔ bɛ nu, na ye mgbɔlaboa ne bɔbɔ mɔɔ ɔwula la, memfɛta kɛ menwɔzanyi ye nyɛma ne bɔbɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Ɛhye zile wɔ Bɛtani mɔɔ le namule bie mɔɔ wɔ Azule Dwɔdan ne anzi, ɛleka mɔɔ ɛnee Dwɔn ɛlɛsɔne menli la.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Aleɛ hyenle la, Dwɔn nwunle Gyisɛse kɛ ɔlɛba ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne, na ɔdeanle nu ɔzele kɛ, “Bɛnlea! Nyamenle Boane Ralɛ ne mɔɔ ye aleɛabo ɛtane la a ɛlɛba la! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Yemɔ yɛɛ menlile ɔ nwo daselɛ kɛ, ‘Sonla bie mɔɔ tɛla me kpole mɔɔ mɔlebɛbo ne ɛnee ɔwɔ ɛkɛ la ɛlɛba la.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Ɛnee medame bɔbɔ menze ye, zɔhane ati melɛfa nzule meazɔne menli amaa ɔlua zo meala ye ali meahile Yizilayɛ maanle ne.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Akee Dwɔn lile daselɛ kɛ, “Menwunle Sunsum ne kɛ ɔvi anwuma maanle ne anu kɛ aabule la yedwu yeradɛnla Gyisɛse ati zo.”<verse eid="JHN 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Eza Dwɔn hanle ye bieko kɛ, “Ɛnee menze kɛ yemɔ ɔ, na mekɛ mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle zoanle me kɛ mengɔnzɔne menli la, ɔzele me kɛ, ‘Saa ɛnwu kɛ Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne ɛlɛdwu awie bie anwo zo a, ɛnee ɛze kɛ mɔɔ ɛ nye la ye adenle ne la ɛne. Yemɔ a le ahenle ne mɔɔ fa Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne yeazɔne la.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Menwunle kɛ ɛhye ɛzi pɛpɛpɛpɛ wɔ nrenyia ɛhye anwo zo, na ɛhye ati noko a melɛdi daselɛ kɛ yemɔ a le Nyamenle Ra ne la a.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse ɛva ɛdoavolɛma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Aleɛ hyenle mɔɔ ɛnee Dwɔn nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ nwiɔ gyi ɛkɛ la, <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />bɛnwunle kɛ Gyisɛse ɛlɛpɛ nu. Dwɔn nleanle ye koonwu na akee ɔdeanle nu ɔzele kɛ, “Bɛnlea! Nana Nyamenle Boane Ralɛ ne ɛne!”<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Dwɔn ɛdoavolɛma nwiɔ ne dele ɛhye la bɛlile Gyisɛse anzi.<verse eid="JHN 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Gyisɛse dole ɔ nye ɔ nzi na ɔnwunle kɛ bɛdoa ye la, ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Duzu a bɛkpondɛ a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Bɛzele ye kɛ, “Kilehilevolɛ, nienwu a ɛde a?”<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛrɛla na bɛranlea.” Ɔti bɛ nee ye hɔle ɛleka mɔɔ ɔde la, na bɛ nee ye dɛnlanle hɔkpulale nɔsolɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Dwɔn ɛdoavolɛma nwiɔ ne mɔɔ ɔvale Gyisɛse ɔhilele bɛ na bɛlile ɔ nzi la anu ko a le Andelu, Saemɔn Pita adiema ne.<verse eid="JHN 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Andelu nwunle ɔ diema Pita la ɔzele ye kɛ, “Yɛnwu Ngoanedievolɛ ne!” <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Akee ɔ nee Pita bɛhɔle Gyisɛse ɛkɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Gyisɛse nleanle Pita koonwu na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Wɔmɔ a le Saemɔn, Dwɔn ara nrenyia ne, noko akee bɛbavɛlɛ wɔ Sifase anzɛɛ Pita, mɔɔ ɔ bo a le kɛ, ‘Bolɛ’ la!”<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Aleɛ hyenle la Gyisɛse yɛle ye adwenle kɛ ɔkɔ Galeli. Na ɔnwunle Felepe na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Badoa me!” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Felepe vi Bɛteseeyeda, mɔɔ le Andelu nee Pita bɛ sua zo.<verse eid="JHN 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Akee Felepe nwunle Natanayɛle na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Yɛnwu Ngoanedievolɛ ne, sonla holɛ ko ne mɔɔ Mosisi nee kapezoma ne mɔ hanle ɔ nwo edwɛkɛ la! Ye duma a le Gyisɛse, Dwosefi ara ne mɔɔ vi Nazalɛte la.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanayɛle deanle nu zele, kɛ, “Nazalɛte! Debie kpalɛ bie bahola avi ɛkɛ ne avinde ɔ?” Felepe buale ye kɛ, “Saa adalɛ a melɛbɔ a, ɛdawɔ bɛla banlea ye ɛ nye zo.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Na mɔɔ bɛkpukele nehane la, Gyisɛse nwunle Natanayɛle kɛ ɔlɛba ɔ nwo ɛkɛ, na ɔzele kɛ, “Bɛnlea, Yizilayɛnli tɛnye tɛnye mɔɔ evinli biala ɛnle ɔ nwo la ɛne.”<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanayɛle deanle nu zele kɛ, “Kɛ ɛsi mɔɔ ɛkola ɛnwu me sonla holɛ ɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Gyisɛse buale kɛ, “Ɛdawɔ mumua ne menumuale menwunle wɔ wɔ mgbɔvonle baka ne abo kolaa na Felepe avɛlɛ wɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Natanayɛle buale kɛ, “Yɛmenle, nɔhalɛ, ɛle Nyamenle Ra, Yizilayɛ Belemgbunli ne!”<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Gyisɛse bizale ye kɛ, “Ɛnee kɛmɔ mese menwunle wɔ wɔ mgbɔvonle baka ne abo lɔ la ati a akee wɔlie wɔli anzɛɛ? Bɔ zo mɔɔ akee ɛbanwu sɛkɛlɛndeɛ mgbole mɔɔ tɛla ɛhye bɔbɔ a. <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Nɔhalɛ nu, nɔhalɛ nu, mese wɔ kɛ, ɛbanwu kɛ anwuma maanle ne ɛbuke wienyi na akee Nana Nyamenle anwumabɔvolɛma ne mɔ ɛlɛdi anwuma nee aze akɔneaba wɔ Sonla Ra ne anwo.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kana atɔfolɛlielɛ ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Ye kenle nsa ne azo ɛnee bɛlɛdie atɔfolɛ bie wɔ Kana mɔɔ wɔ Galeli la. Gyisɛse ɔ nli hɔle ɛkɛ ne bie, <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />yɛɛ bɛdole ɛsalɛ bɛvɛlɛle Gyisɛse nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ noko. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Mɔɔ atɔfolɛ ne abo nza nwanye ne wiele la, Gyisɛse ɔ nli hanle hilele ye kɛ bɛ nwanye ɛwie.<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Gyisɛse zele ɔ nli kɛ; “Ɔmɔ, duzu a ɛkulo kɛ meyɛ a? Me mekɛ ne ɛtɛdwule.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Na ɔ nli zele sonvolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Bɛyɛ mɔɔ ɔkɛze bɛ biala la.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Ɛnee dwora mgbole nsia gyigyi ɛkɛ mɔɔ ko biala kɛli nzule galɔno abulanwiɔ mɔɔ kɔ abulasa a. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7-8" />Akee Gyisɛse maanle azonvolɛ ne mɔ sesale nzule guale nu maanle bɛyiyile tetɛkɛɛ. Ɛhye anzi ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛza bie bɛhɔmaa mɔɔ nea atɔfolɛ ne azo la.” <verse eid="JHN 2:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Mɔɔ atɔfolɛ neazovolɛ ne nlonle nzule ne mɔɔ akee ɛhakyi nza nwanye ne la bie, na ɔnze ɛleka mɔɔ bɛnyianle ye, noko azonvolɛ ne mɔ bɛmɛ bɛze la, ɔvɛlɛle atɔfolɛ nrenyia ne.<verse eid="JHN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />Akee ɔzele ye kɛ, “Na duzu ati a ɛdi wɔ edwɛkɛ zɛhae a? Ɛ gɔnwo mɔ dumua kyɛ nwanye kpalɛ ne, na mɔɔ awie biala kɛbo tindaanwu la, akee yeahyɛ mɔɔ ɛnyɛ fɛ la. Na wɔmɔ akee wɔva nwanye kpalɛ ne emomu a wɔli amozi a.”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Zɛhae nwanwanedeɛ ye mɔɔ zile wɔ Kana mɔɔ wɔ Galeli la a le Gyisɛse ye nwanwanedeɛ mɔɔ ɔlumuale ɔyɛle ye bagua nu a. Na ɛhye noko maanle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ liele ye lile.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Ɛhye anzi ɔ nee ɔ nli, nee ɔ mediema mrenyia ne mɔ, nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ hɔle Kapɛnayɛm bɛhɔlile kenle kɛyɛ nsa wɔ ɛkɛ.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asɔne sua nu ɛnle gualilɛleka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Ɛnee ɔka ekyii bɛdi Dwuuma Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia ne, ɔti Gyisɛse hɔle Gyɛlusalɛm.<verse eid="JHN 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Ɔdwule Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu la, ɔnwunle kɛ guadivoma bie ɛlɛtɔne nlankɛ, mboane, nee nwolɛ mɔlɔnloma mɔɔ bɛfa bɛbɔ azu la, yɛɛ menli mɔɔ senza ezukoa noko la kɛ bɛdabɛ bɛdede bɛ ɛkponle nwo wɔ ɛkɛ. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Gyisɛse hwenle empele bilebilale bɛ na ɔhanle bɛ muala, na ɔvoanle mboane nee nlankɛ ne mɔ, na eza ɔvuandinle bɛ ɛkponle ne mɔ nee bɛ ezukoa ne amuala ɔguale bɛ lɔ. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Akee ɔhɔle bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛtɔnedɔne mɔlɔnloma ne mɔ la ɛkɛ na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛye ɛhye mɔ amuala bɛvi ɛke! Bɛmmafa me Ze Sua nu bɛkakyi gualilɛ ɛleka!”<verse eid="JHN 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Ɛhye maanle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ hakyele kapezo edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ wɔ Ngɛlɛlera ne anu mɔɔ se, “Saa Mekanyia ɛkpɔlɛ a ɛnee ɔvi me ɛhulolɛ kpole mɔɔ melɛ ye wɔ Nana Nyamenle Sua nwo la ati la.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ rabizale ye kɛ, “Duzu tumi a ɛdawɔ ɛlɛ mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ ɛtu bɛ a? Saa ɛlɛ tumi ɛhye vi anwuma Nyamenle ne ɛkɛ ne a, ɛnee kile nwolɛ sɛkɛlɛneɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Wioo, mede. Nwanwanedeɛ mɔɔ melɛ ye memaa bɛ la a le ɛhye: Bɛbubu asɔne sua ɛhye na mebava kenle nsa meazi ye bieko!”<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Na Dwuuma ne deanle nu zele kɛ, “Wio! Asɔne Sua Kpole ɛhye mɔɔ bɛvale ɛvolɛ abulanla nee nsia bɛzile la, yemɔ a wɔmɔ ɛse ɛfa kenle nsa pɛ wɔazi la?” <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Noko ɛnee ɔlɛka ɔdaye ye sonlabaka mumua ne anwo edwɛkɛ. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Nzinlii mɔɔ ɔvi ewule nu ɔdwazole la, ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ hakyele ɛhye mɔ mɔɔ ɔhanle la, na bɛnwunle kɛ mɔɔ ɔhanle ɔvile Ngɛlɛlera ne anu la fale ɔ nwo na amgba noko yepe zolɛ nɔhalɛ nu bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Ɔlua nwanwanendeɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ ɔyɛle wɔ Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia ne abo wɔ Gyɛlusalɛm la ati, menli dɔɔnwo liele lile kɛ amgba yemɔ a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne a. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24-25" />Gyisɛse anva ɔ rɛle anwula bɛ nu, ɔluakɛ, ɔze sonla dasanli deɛholɛ, mɔɔ ɔngyia kɛ awie kɛhakye ye a.<verse eid="JHN 2:24-25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse ɛyia Nekɔdimɛse fealera nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1-2" />Kenle ko nɔɔzo bie Dwuunli kpanyinli ko mɔɔ vi Falasiima eku ne anu mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Nekɔdimɛse la rale Gyisɛse ɛkɛ, kɛ ɔ nee ye bali adwelie. Ɔzele Gyisɛse kɛ, “Yɛmenle, yɛ muala yɛze kɛ ɛle kilehilevolɛ mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle a amgba zoanle wɔ a. Wɔ nwanwane ninyɛne ne mɔ di ɛhye anwo daselɛ bɔkɔɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 3:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Gyisɛse buale ye kɛ, “Mese wɔ nɔhalɛ nu ala kɛ: Saa bɛanwo wɔ fofolɛ a, yemɔ ɛnrɛhola Nana Nyamenle Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu kɔ ɛlɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nekɔdimɛse deanle nu zele kɛ, “Duzu edwɛkɛ a le ɛhye? Kɛ ɔkɛyɛ na sonla mɔɔ ɛnyi la bɛazia bɛawo ye bieko ɛ? Ɔkɛhola ɔkɛzia ɔkɛhɔ ɔ nli akunlu ɔkɛmaa ɔkɛwo ye bieko ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Meka ye nɔhalɛ nu mekile wɔ kɛ: Saa bɛtɛwole sonla fofolɛ wɔ nzule nee Sunsum nu a, ɔnrɛhola Nyamenle Anwuma maanle ne anu kɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Mɔɔ bɛwo ye wɔ nwonane nu la le nwonane, yɛɛ mɔɔ bɛwo ye wɔ Sunsum nu la le sunsum; <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />zɔhane ati mmamaa ɔyɛ wɔ azibɛnwo kɛ mese ɔwɔ kɛ bɛwo wɔ bieko a. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Kɛmɔ ɛte anwoma nganeɛ, noko ɛnze ɛleka mɔɔ ɔvi ɔba anzɛɛ ɛleka mɔɔ ɔlɛkɔ la, zɔhane ala a Sunsum ne noko de a.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nekɔdimɛse zele kɛ, “Kɛ ɔkɛyɛ na ɛhye ahola azi ɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10-11" />Gyisɛse buale ye kɛ, “Ɛse ɛle Yizilayɛ kilehilevolɛ, yɛɛ akee noko ɛnde ɛhye abo a? <verse eid="JHN 3:10-11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Saa meha azɛlɛ ye azo edwɛkɛ mehile wɔ na ɛnlie ɛnli a, ɛnee kɛ ɔkɛzi ɔkɛyɛ na meka anwuma edwɛkɛ mekile wɔ a, ɛnee wɔalie wɔali ɛ? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Awie biala ɛtɛkɔle anwuma maanle ne anu kɛ Nyamenle Ara kotokokye ne ala mɔɔ vi nehane ɛra la. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Na kɛmɔ Mosisi maanle kɔbele ɛwɔlɛ sɛkɛlɛneɛ ne zo wɔ fiemgbole ne azo la, zɔhane ala a bɛbamaa Sonla Ra ne zo a, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />amaa ɔlua zo awie biala mɔɔ kɛlie ye kɛli la yeanyia ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Ɔluakɛ, kɛmɔ Nana Nyamenle hulole ewiade kpole la ati yɛɛ ɔyele ye ɛhulolɛ Ralɛ kotokokye ne ɔmaanle, amaa awie biala mɔɔ kɛlie ye kɛli la angɔ munzule nu na emomu ɔkɛnyia ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ a. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Nana Nyamenle anzoa ɔ Ra ne kɛ ɔrabu ewiade fɔlɛ, na emomu ɔzoanle ye kɛ ɔralie ye ngoane.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />“Awie biala mɔɔ die ye di la ɛnde munzule biala anu. Emomu bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛnlie ye bɛnli noko la, bɛbu bɛ fɔlɛ dɛbadɛba, ɔluakɛ bɛanlie Nana Nyamenle Ara kotokokye ne bɛanli. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Bɛ ndɛnebualɛ ne abo a le kɛ: Wienyi anzɛɛ Kɛnlaneɛ ne vi anwuma maanle ne anu rale ewiade anu, noko akee bɛhulole awozinli ne bɛdɛlale Wienyi anzɛɛ Kɛnlaneɛ ne, ɔlua bɛ ninyɛndane ne ati. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Bɛvale anwuma maanle ne Wienyi anzɛɛ Kɛnlaneɛ ne anwo ɛkpɔlɛ, ɔboalekɛ bɛhulole kɛ bɛkɛvea awozinli nu na bɛkɛyɛ bɛ ninyɛmunli ne. Bɛvile Wienyi anzɛɛ Kɛnlaneɛ ne anwo kɛmɔ bɛsulo kɛ bɛ ninyɛmunli ne kɛla ali na bɛkɛhwe bɛ nzo wɔ nwolɛ la ati. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Na bɛdabɛ noko mɔɔ bɛyɛ kpalɛ la ba Wienyi anzɛɛ Kɛnlaneɛ ne anu amaa awie biala anwu bɛ gyima kpalɛ ne mɔɔ bɛlɛdi, mɔɔ le Nyamenle ɛhulolɛdeɛ ne anwo gyima la.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Nzinlii Gyisɛse nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ vile Gyɛlusalɛm hɔle Dwudiya maanle nu, na bɛhyɛle ɛkɛ ne ekyii bɛzɔnenle menli.<verse eid="JHN 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dwɔn nee Gyisɛse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23-24" />Mekɛ ɛhye anu ɛnee bɛtɛnyianle bɛtɛtole Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne efiade. Ɛnee ɔwɔ Enɔn, mɔɔ zua Salem la ɔlɛsɔne menli, ɔluakɛ, ɛkɛ ne afoa nu a ɛnee nzule dɔɔnwo wɔ a. <verse eid="JHN 3:23-24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Kenle ko awie nee Dwɔn ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ zule kpolera kɛ Gyisɛse ɛzɔnenlɛ nu azubɔlɛ ɛdeɛ ne a le kpalɛ a. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Ɔti bɛrale Dwɔn ɛkɛ na bɛzele ye kɛ, “Yɛmenle, nrenyia ne mɔɔ ɛyiale ye wɔ Azule Dwɔdan ne anzi lɔ, mɔɔ ɛse yemɔ a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne la noko ɛlɛsɔne menli, yɛɛ ɛleka ne mɔɔ ɔwɔ la a menli ne kpokpoti ɛlɛpia bɛ nwo ahɔ a.”<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Dwɔn buale kɛ, “Awie biala nee ye gyima mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle ɛva ɛwula ɔ sa a. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Me gyima ɛdeɛ ne a le kɛ menwɔziezie adenle ne anu menwɔmaa nrenyia zɔhane, amaa awie biala adoa ye. Bɛkɛhakye kɛ menganle ye wienyi mengilele bɛ kɛ tɛ mame a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne a. Me deɛ ne ala a le kɛ membanzieziele adenle ne anu memaanle ye. <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Kɛ ɔkɛyɛ biala la, ye ɛkɛ ne ala a menli dɔɔnwo ne ala bahɔ a. Atɔfolɛ nrenyia ne anwo a atɔfolɛ raalɛ ne kɔ a! Yɛɛ atɔfolɛ nrenyia ne agɔnwo mɔ noko nee ye di nwolɛ fɛlɛko. Mame yɛɛ mele Atɔfolɛ Nrenyia ne agɔnwo ne a, ɔti fɛlɛko ɛyi me tɛkɛɛ wɔ ye anyunluhɔlɛ ne anwo. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Ɔwɔ kɛ ye dibilɛ ne kɔ anwuma anwuma tɛla me.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />“Yemɔ ɔvi anwuma maanle ne anu a yera a, ɔti ɔle kpole ɔtɛla awie biala. Mame mevi azɛlɛ ye azo ɛke ala, ɔti me ndelebɛbo ne noko wɔ aze ɛke ala. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Yemɔ ɔdi mɔɔ ɔdaye mumua ne yenwu ye na yede la anwo daselɛ, noko akee menli ekyii bie ala a die ye di a!<verse eid="JHN 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33-34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33-34" />“Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdie ye bɛdi noko la nwu kɛ Nana Nyamenle le nɔhalɛdivo kpole. Ɔluakɛ, sonla ɛhye mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle ɔdaye mumua ne ɔzoanle ye la ka Nana Nyamenle edwɛkɛ ne komii, kɛmɔ Nana Nyamenle Sunsum ne mɔɔ dwule ɔ nwo zo la le kpole la. <verse eid="JHN 3:33-34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Selɛ ne kulo nrenyia ɛhye edwɛkɛ, ɔluakɛ ɔ Ra a le ye, yɛɛ Nana Nyamenle noko ɛva ninyɛne muala ɛwula ɔ sa. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Na bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdie Nyamenle Ra ne bɛdi la amuala lɛ damɛnlangoate ngoane; bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛnlie ye bɛnli na eza bɛnli ye mɛla zo la ɛnrɛnwu anwuma maanle ne anu ɛlɛ, na munzule totohyia kpalɛ noko baha bɛ dahuu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Raalɛ ne mɔɔ ɔ hu mɔ nnu la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1-2" />Mɔɔ Awulae nwunle kɛ Falasiima mgbanyima ne mɔ ɛde kɛ menli dɔɔnwo ɛlɛba ye ɛzɔnenlɛ ne abo, bɔbɔ tɛ ɔdaye mumua ne a ɔlɛsɔne bɛ a, na ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ angome ala a ɛlɛsɔne adɛla Dwɔn ɛdeɛ ne la, <verse eid="JHN 4:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />ɔvile Dwudiya na ɔziale ɔhɔle Galeli maanzinli ne anu.<verse eid="JHN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Mɔɔ ɔkɔ la ɛnee ɔwɔ kɛ ɔdua Samɛlea, <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5-6" />na kɛyɛ sɛnzɛngyinla yɛɛ ɔdwule Gyekɔbo bula ne mɔɔ wɔ azɛlɛ ne mɔɔ ɔvale ɔmaanle ɔ ra Dwosefi la azo, wɔ mɔɔ ɔka ekyii ɛdwu Saekaa sua ne azo la anwo a; na kɛmɔ ɛnee Gyisɛse ɛvɛ la ati ɔdɛnlanle bula ne anwo.<verse eid="JHN 4:5-6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Yeangyɛ biala Samɛleanli raalɛ bie rale kɛ ɔbaza nzule; Gyisɛse zɛlɛle ye kɛ ɔmaa ye bie ɔnlo. <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Ɛnee yeha ɔ ngomekye ala, ɔluakɛ, ɛnee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ɛhɔ sua zo kadɔ aleɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Ɔzinle raalɛ ne anwo kpole kɛ Dwuunli kɛbiza yemɔ Samɛleanli debie a, ɔluakɛ, bɛ nee bɛ ɛndendɛ mgbane bɔbɔ, na ɔyɛle ɛhye nzonlɛ na ɔhanle ɔhilele Gyisɛse.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Gyisɛse buale ye kɛ, “Saa ɛze nwanwane ahyɛlɛdeɛ mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle ɛlɛfa amaa wɔ, na eza ɛze me sonla holɛ a, anrɛɛ ɛkɛbiza ngoane nzule ɛkɛvi me ɛkɛ!”<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Raalɛ ne zele ye kɛ, “Ɛdawɔ mumua ne ɛlɛ ɛ sa mgbane, ɛnlɛ nyɛma, yɛɛ ɛnlɛ bokiti! Ɛnee nienwu bɔbɔ a ɛbanyia ngoane nzule ɛhye a? Bula ye noko le kuma kpalɛ! <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Anzɛɛ ɛkpondɛ wɔaze me kɛ ɛle sonlakpole ɛtɛla yɛ ze Gyekɔbo ɔ? Kɛ ɔkɛzi ɔkɛyɛ na ɛdawɔ wɔahola wɔamaa yɛ nzule kpalɛ adɛla mɔɔ yɛ ze Gyekɔbo nee ɔ mra nee ye nlankɛ bɛnlonle la ɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Gyisɛse buale kɛ, saa menli no nzule ɛhye bie a ɔngyɛ ɛnee nzuhɔne ɛlɛku bɛ bieko. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Ɔzele kɛ, “Noko akee me nzule ɛdeɛ ne mɔɔ menwɔva menwɔmaa la kakyi azudenle mɔɔ ɔmaa bɛ ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Raalɛ ne akee zele kɛ, “Yɛmenle, mebodo wɔ, maa me nzule zɔhane bie; ammaa ɔlua nzule ti dahuu meandia adenle tendenle ɛhye.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Kɔ kɔvɛlɛ ɛ hu na ɛ nee ye bɛrɛla.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17-18" />Raalɛ ne buale ye kɛ, “Menlɛ me hu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17-18">Gyisɛse buale zele ye kɛ, “Nɔhalɛ, ɛnlɛ ɛ hu amgba! Ɔluakɛ wɔhɔ agyalɛ fane nnu, na nrenyia ne mɔɔ ɛ nee ye veɛvea ɛkɛ ne kɛkala la yemɔ ɔtɛgyale wɔ bɔbɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 4:17-18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Raalɛ ne deanle nu zele kɛ, “Yɛmenle, mekola menwu kɛ ɛle kapezonli bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Emomu kile me deɛmɔti bɛmɛ Dwuuma bɛse Gyɛlusalɛm ala a ɔwɔ kɛ awie biala sonle Nyamenle wɔ la; wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ yɛmɛ Samɛleama noko yɛse wɔ Boka Gɛlaezem ne azo a ɔwɔ kɛ bɛsonle Nyamenle la.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21-24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21-24" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Ɔnrɛhyɛ biala ɛnee ɛhye mɔ biala ɛngyia bieko kɛ yɛkɛzonle Selɛ ne wɔ Gyɛlusalɛm anzɛɛ boka ye azo. Ɔluakɛ tɛ ɛleka mɔɔ yɛsonle ye la a ahyia a, na emomu kɛ yɛsi yɛsonle ye la ɔ. Ɔluakɛ, Nana Nyamenle le Sunsum, ɔti bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsonle ye la ɔwɔ kɛ sonle ye wɔ sunsum nee nɔhalɛ nu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:21-24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Raalɛ ne zele kɛ, “Nɔhalɛ, meze kɛ Ngoanedievolɛ ne, mɔɔ eza bɛfɛlɛ ye Kelaese la bara, na yemɔ yɛɛ saa ɔba a ɔbahile ninyɛne muala anu yeahile yɛ a.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Mame a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne a!”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Na ɛkɛ ne ala yɛɛ akee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne rale a. Ɔzinle bɛ nwo kɛ ɔ nee raalɛ ɛlɛtendɛ a, noko akee bɛ nuhua biala angola nwolɛ edwɛkɛ biza.<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28-29" />Raalɛ ne akee gyakyile ye buakɛ ne wɔ bula ne anwo ɛkɛ, na ɔziale ɔhɔbɔle sua ne azo amra amuala amaneɛ ɔzele kɛ, “Bɛranlea nrenyia bie mɔɔ yeha mɔɔ mɛyɛ la amuala yehile me a! Asoo tɛ ɛhye a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne ɔ?” <verse eid="JHN 4:28-29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Ɛhye ati menli ne mɔ noko dule twi vile namule ne anu rale kɛ bɛbanlea Gyisɛse.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Mekɛ ɛhye amuala ɛnee ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ɛlɛbodo Gyisɛse kɛ ɔli debie. <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Noko ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Kyɛkyɛ.” Ɔvale ɔzɔle zo kɛ, “Melɛ aleɛ bie medi mɔɔ bɛmɛ bɛnze a.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Na ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bizale bɛ nwo ngoko ngoko kɛ, “Ɛnee nwane a ɛrɛlɛ ye aleɛ ne a?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Gyisɛse akee hanle ye wienyi kɛ, “Mame me aleɛ a le kɛ menwɔyɛ Awulae Nyamenle ne mɔɔ zoanle me la gyima ne nee ye ɛhuloledeɛ ne. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Asoo bɛnze kɛ yeha siane nna na aleɛbulɛ mekɛ ne adwu zo ɔ? Nea! Mese bɛ kɛ; bɛmaa bɛ nye zo bɛnlea ɛya ne mɔ kɛ aleɛbulɛ mekɛ ne ɛdwu a. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Menli mɔɔ babu la banyia ahatualɛ kpalɛ, na bɛbava aleɛ dɔɔnwo bɛagua mbonwole ne mɔ azo! Na fɛlɛkolilɛ bedevinli baha duavolɛma ne nee buvolɛma ne mɔ amuala. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Ɔboalekɛ, ɔle nɔhalɛ bɔkɔɔ kɛ bie mɔ dua, yɛɛ bie mɔ noko bu. <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Na menzoanle bɛ wɔ mɔɔ awie mɔ ɛlua ye dɛba la anu; awie mɔ a yɛle gyima ne a, yɛɛ bɛmɛ bɛhɔ bɛhɔbu a.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Ɔlua raalɛ ne daselɛ ne mɔɔ ɔlile ye ɔ nwo mɔɔ se, “Yeha mɔɔ meyɛ ye fealera nu la amuala yehile me” la ati, menli ne mɔɔ vi Samɛlea sua ne azo rale la anu dɔɔnwo liele lile kɛ amgba yemɔ a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne a. <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40-41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40-41" />Na mɔɔ bɛradole Gyisɛse wɔ bula ne azo la, bɛzɛlɛle ye kɛ ɔ nee bɛ ɛdɛnla; na ɔdaye noko ɔkponlenle zolɛ, na ɔ nee bɛ dɛnlanle kenle nwiɔ. Na menli dɔɔnwo dele edwɛkpa ne na bɛliele ye bɛlile. <verse eid="JHN 4:40-41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Bɛzele raalɛ ne kɛ, “Akee tɛ mɔɔ ɛhanle la ala ati a yɛlie yɛli bɔbɔ a; na yɛdayɛ mumua ne yɛdie ye yɛdi, na yɛnwu ye kofee kɛ amgba yemɔ a le Kelaese, aleɛabo Ngoanedievolɛ ne a.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43-44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43-44" />Na kenle nwiɔ, ne anzi, ɔhɔle Galeli. Gyisɛse mumua ne ɛlumua ɛha kɛ, “Kapezonli biala ɛnlɛ anyunlunyia wɔ ɔdaye ye sua zo.” <verse eid="JHN 4:43-44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Zɔhane ati, ɔdwule Galeli la, bɛliele ye bɛdole nu ɔluakɛ, bɛnwunle ye nwanwane ninyɛne ne mɔɔ ɔyɛle wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ bɛhɔle Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia ne abo wɔ Gyɛlusalɛm la.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kelaese ɛdondo sogya kpanyinli ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46-47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46-47" />Mɔɔ ɔpɛ nu wɔ Galeli la, ɔravindele Kana, sua ne mɔɔ ɔhakyile nzule ne nwanye wɔ zo la azo la azo. Na ɔwɔ ɛkɛ ne la, Arane gyima nu kpanyinli bie mɔɔ vi Kapɛnayɛm na ɔ ra nrenyia anwo ɛdo ye ɛsesebɛ la dele kɛ Gyisɛse vi Dwudiya ɛlɛpɛ nu wɔ Galeli. Nrenyia ɛhye zile nu too ɔhɔle Kana ɔhɔkpondɛle Gyisɛse na ɔzɛlɛle ye kɛ ɔralie ɔ ra ne mɔɔ asɛɛ ɛwu la ngoane.<verse eid="JHN 4:46-47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Gyisɛse bizale ye kɛ, “Ɔti bɛ nuhua biala ɛnrɛlie me ɛnrɛli kyesɛ meyɛ nwanwanedeɛ na mekile sɛkɛlɛneɛ molozo kolaa anzɛɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Na nrenyia ne zele ye kɛ, “Yɛmenle, saa wɔammaa ɛ nwo anyɛ ndɛ wɔamba a me ra ne bawu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Gyisɛse akee zele ye kɛ, “Sia kɔ sua nu. Ɛ ra ne ɛde kpɔkɛ!” Nrenyia ne noko liele Gyisɛse lile na ɔzile nu kɛ ɔkɔ sua nu. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Mɔɔ ɔlua adenle zo la, ye azonvolɛ ne mɔ bie yiale ye na bɛbɔle ye amaneɛ kɛ, ɔ ra ne ɛde kpɔkɛ bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Ɛnee mekɛ ne boni a ɔbɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔte kpɔkɛ a?” Na bɛbuale ye kɛ, “Anoma ewiazo kɛyɛ dɔne ko yɛɛ ye ebunlu ne dule arɛlevilɛ nu a!” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Na selɛ ne nwunle kɛ mekɛ ne mɔɔ Gyisɛse hanle edwɛkɛ ne la anu ala ɔ. Akee ɔ nee ye aako nu amra amuala liele lile kɛ amgba Gyisɛse a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne a.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Ɛhye yɛɛ ale Gyisɛse nwanwanedeɛ mɔɔ tɔ zo nwiɔ mɔɔ ɔvi Dwudiya ɔrale Galeli la ɔyɛle a.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Mgbanyima ɛdendɛ ɛtia ayileyɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Mɔɔ Dwuuma ɛvoyia bie dwule zo la, Gyisɛse ziale rale Gyɛlusalɛm, <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Na nzulebula bie wɔ sua ne azo ɛleka ne mɔɔ bikye gua ne mɔɔ bɛtɔne mboane wɔ ɛkɛ la. Zɛhae nzulebula ne duma a le Bɛtezata, mɔɔ bɛhye mbane nnu wɔ nwolɛ a. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Wuliravolɛma dɔɔnwo, abuburavoma, anyezinliravolɛma, nee menli mɔɔ bɛ sa anzɛɛ bɛ gyakɛ ɛdwudwe la amuala, deda ɛkɛ ne kendɛ nzule ne mgbakabɔlɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Ɔluakɛ, ɔyɛ a Awulae anwumabɔvolɛ bakpoto nzule ne, na sonla mɔɔ kɛlumua kɛdɔ nu la ɛnee ɔ nwo ɛza bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="JHN 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Ɛnee nrenyia ko wɔ bɛ nu mɔɔ yebubu yegua ɛleka ko too ɛvolɛ abulasa nee mɔtwɛ a. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Mekɛ mɔɔ Gyisɛse nwunle ye na ɔnwunle kɛ ɔsi mɔɔ yela anwonyane nu yehyɛ la, ɔbizale ye kɛ, “Ɛkulo kɛ ɛkɛde kpɔkɛ ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Nrenyia ne buale kɛ, “Menlɛ awie ɛmboa me, ɔti saa dahuu bɛbɔ nzule ne mgbaka na mekɔ nu a ɛnee awie ɛlumua me nyunlu.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Na Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Dwazo, foa! Bubu wɔ ɛkpa ne, na kɔ sua nu!”<verse eid="JHN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Ɛkɛ ne ala, nrenyia ne dele kpɔkɛ. Ɔbubule ye ɛkpa ne na ɔbɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔtia. Ɛhye zile wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Ɔti Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ angulo ye fee zɛ. Bɛzele nrenyia ne mɔɔ anwo ɛza la kɛ, “Ɛnɛ le Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle; ɔtia mɛla kɛ awie kɛyɛ gyima! Ɔti mɛla ɛmmaa adenle kɛ ɛkɛzoa wɔ ɛkpa ne!”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Nrenyia ne buale bɛ kɛ, “Ahenle ne mɔɔ yɛle me ayile la a se menzoa a.”<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Ɛnee nwane bɔbɔ a le zɔhane sonla ne?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Ɛnee nrenyia ne ɛnze sonla holɛ ko ne, yɛɛ Gyisɛse noko ɛhɔfonla menli dɔɔnwo ne anu. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Nzinlii, Gyisɛse nwunle ye wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu, na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Akee wɔde kpɔkɛ; mmakɔyɛ ɛtane bieko kɛmɔ ɛyɛle ye dɛba ne la, yemɔ anrɛɛ wɔannea a mɔɔ kɛzi ɛ nwo zo la badɛla dɛba ne.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Nrenyia ne akee hɔkpondɛle Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ na ɔzele bɛ kɛ Gyisɛse a yɛle ye ayile a.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Ɔti bɛbɔle ɔ bo kɛ bɛgyegye Gyisɛse wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ mɛla ne mɔɔ yedo la ati. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Egya yɛ gyima dahuu, na zɔhane noko ala a medame noko meyɛ a.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Ɛhye maanle Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ anye bolole kpalɛ kpalɛ kɛ bɛku ye. Ɔluakɛ saa ɛtu Ɛnwomenlelielɛ mɛla ne mɔɔ yedo la ɛsie ahanle a, eza ɔse Nana Nyamenle le ɔ Ze, mɔɔ kile kɛ ɔ nee Ye le ko bɔbɔ a.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Gyisɛse buale kɛ, “Ralɛ ne ɛngola ɛnyɛ ɛhwee wɔ ye tumi nu. Mɔɔ ɔ ze yɛ la yɛɛ ɔdaye ɔnea zo ɔyɛ bie a. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Ɔluakɛ, Selɛ ne kulo Ralɛ ne edwɛkɛ, na eza ɔka debie biala mɔɔ ɔyɛ la amuala ɔkile ye; ɛhye ati Ralɛ ne bayɛ mɔɔ yɛ nwanwane tɛla mɔɔ yeyɛ yemaa nrenyia ɛhye bɔbɔ la. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Na kɛmɔ Selɛ ne tunwue mɔwuamra na ɔmaa bɛ ngoane la, zɔhane ala noko yɛɛ Ralɛ ne fa ngoane maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkulo la a. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Eza noko Selɛ ne ɛmbua awie biala ndɛne, ɔluakɛ yeva ndɛnebualɛ kosooti yewula Ralɛ ne asa, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />amaa awie biala awula Ralɛ ne anyunlunyia kɛmɔ bɛwula Selɛ ne ala la pɛ. Emomu saa bɛkpo kɛ bɛkɛwula Nyamenle Ra ne mɔɔ yezoa ye bɛ nwo la anyunlunyia a, ɛnee ɔkile kɛ Selɛ mumua ne a bɛambu ye bie a.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Memaa bɛade bɛ nwo ɔ bo nɔhalɛ wienyi kɛ, awie biala mɔɔ kɛdie me edwɛkɛ na ɔkɛlie Nyamenle ne mɔɔ zoanle me la ɔkɛli la, ɔlɛ ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ a; bɛnrɛdua ye ɛtane nwo kakɛ biala, ɔluakɛ ɛnee yevi ewule nu yera ngoane nu dɛbadɛba. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Eza memaa bɛade bɛ nwo ɔ bo kɛ mekɛ bie ɛlɛba, asɛɛ bɔbɔ yera, mɔɔ mɔwuamra bade me ne a, ɛnelɛ ne mɔɔ le Nana Nyamenle Ara ne deɛ la, na bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛbadie la badɛnla ngoane nu. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Kɛmɔ Selɛ ne lɛ ngoane wɔ ɔdaye mumua ne ye nu la, zɔhane noko ala a yeva ngoane yewula ɔ ra ne nu a; <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />na eza noko yemaa ye tumi kɛ ɔbua aleɛabo amra amuala ndɛne, ɔluakɛ yemɔ a le Sonla Ra ne a. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Bɛmmamaa ɔyɛ bɛ azibɛnwo! Nɔhalɛ, mekɛ ne ɛlɛba mɔɔ mɔwuamra amuala bade Nyamenle Ra ne ane wɔ bɛ nla ne mɔ anu a, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />na bɛbadwazo bieko nuhua ne mɔ mɔɔ yɛle kpalɛ la bahɔ ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la anu; yɛɛ nuhua ne mɔɔ anli bɛ ɛtane nwo nyane la bɛbabua bɛ fɔlɛ.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />“Mengoati Egya membua ndɛne biala. Mɔɔ menwɔde la yɛɛ mebua a. Yɛɛ me ndɛnebualɛ ne noko di munli na eza ɔle pɛpɛ bɔkɔɔ, ɔluakɛ menva medame me adenle zo, na emomu Nana Nyamenle mɔɔ zoanle me la ɛhulolɛ adenle zo a mepe a.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />“Medi medame me nwo daselɛ mekile bɛ a ɔnrɛyɛ boɛ, <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32-33" />na awie bie wɔ ɛkɛ, mɔɔ yemɔ a le Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne. Yemɔ a di me nwo daselɛ a, na mɔɔ ɔka ye wɔ me nwo noko la le nɔhalɛ bɔkɔɔ! <verse eid="JHN 5:32-33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Ɔngyia bɔbɔ kɛ dasanli kɛli me nwo daselɛ, emomu ɔlua ɛhye noko ati mehakye bɛ wɔ Dwɔn ɛdeɛ ne anwo amaa bɛalie me bɛali na bɛanyia ngoane. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Dwɔn yɛle kɛ kɛnlaneɛ ɔdale wienyi mekɛ ekyii bie ala, na ɔyɛle nvasoɛ ɔmaanle bɛ na eza noko bɛlile nwolɛ fɛlɛko, <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />na emomu melɛ dasevolɛ kpole mɔɔ di munli tɛla Dwɔn a. Na yemɔ a le nwanwane ninyɛne ne mɔ mɔɔ meyɛ bɛ dahuu la. Egya ne a vale bɛ wulale me sa nu a, na bɛmɛ a bɛdi daselɛ kɛ amgba Selɛ ne a zoanle me a. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Saa bɔbɔ bɛtɛnwunle ye bɛ nye zo anzɛɛ bɛtɛtele ɔ ne ɛlɛ a, Selɛ mumua ne ɛli ɔ nwo daselɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />Bɛnlie me bɛnli; noko mame a yezoa me kɛ menva Nyamenle edwɛkɛ ne membɛlɛ bɛ a.<verse eid="JHN 5:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />“Dahuu bɛfedevede Ngɛlɛlera ne anu, ɔluakɛ bɛdwenle kɛ yemɔ yɛɛ maa bɛ ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ a. Na mame noko a Ngɛlɛlera ne ka me nwo edwɛkɛ a! <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Noko akee bɛnrɛra medame mumua ne me nwo ɛkɛ ne na ɔlua zo a meamaa bɛ zɛhae ngoane ne mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la!<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41-42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41-42" />“Ɔnvale me nwo! Ɔluakɛ me anyunlunyia ne ɛnvi menli lɔ, yɛɛ meze ye wienyi noko kɛ Nyamenle nwo ɛhulolɛ biala ɛnle bɛ nu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41-42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Saa ɔnle zɔ a, anrɛɛ bɛnrɛkpo Mame mɔɔ Selɛ ne ɛzoa me la na bɛnrɛlie mɔɔ ɔdaye yebɔ ɔ ti anwo a yera la bɛnrɛdo nu! <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Ɔnyɛ azibɛnwo biala kɛ bɛnlie bɛnli a! Ɔluakɛ bɛ ngome bɛ nwo anyunlunyia mɔɔ bɛwula la hyia bɛ tɛla mɔɔ Nyamenle kokye ne fa maa la!<verse eid="JHN 5:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />“Bɛmmadwenle kɛ mame a mebadoa bɛ meahile Egya a, na emomu Mosisi mɔɔ bɛva bɛ rɛle bɛwula ye nu la ɔ! <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Saa amgba ɔle nɔhalɛ kɛ bɛdie Mosisi bɛdi a ɛnee ɔwɔ kɛ bɛdie medame noko bɛdi, ɔboalekɛ mɔɔ Mosisi hɛlɛle la kpokpoti fale me nwo. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Na suzuamgba ala mɔɔ bɛnlie mɔɔ ɔhɛlɛle la bɛnli la, ɛnee kɛ ɔkɛyɛ na bɛalie me edwɛkɛ ɛdeɛ ne bɛali ɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse ɛmaa menli apenle nnu aleɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Ɛhye anzi, Gyisɛse pɛle Galeli Nyevile ne, mɔɔ ye duma bieko a le Taebilease Nyevile la. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2-5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2-5" />Na menli pemgbenlamgbe ne ala, mɔɔ bɛ nuhua bie mɔ dɔɔnwo mɔɔ ɛnee ɛlɛkɔ Gyɛlusalɛm bɛahɔli Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia ne bie la doale Gyisɛse wɔ ɛleka biala mɔɔ ɔkɛva la kɛ bɛkanlea kɛ ɔsi ɔyɛ wuliravolɛma ayile a. Ɛhye ati mekɛ mɔɔ Gyisɛse vole hɔdɛnlanle boka ne azo, na ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bɔle yiale ye la, yeangyɛ biala yɛɛ ɔnwunle kɛ menli pemgbenlamgbe bie ɛlɛfo boka ne bɛakpondɛ ye a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 6:2-5">Ɔhakyile ɔ nye ɔnleanle Felepe na ɔbizale ye kɛ, “Felepe, nienwu a yɛkɛnyia aleɛ yɛkɛdɔ yɛkɛmaa menli dɔɔnwo ɛhye mɔ a?” <verse eid="JHN 6:2-5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Ɛnee ɔlɛsɔ Felepe yeanlea ala, ɔluakɛ ɛnee ɔze deɛ mɔɔ ɔbayɛ la ɔsie.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Felepe buale kɛ, “Kyesɛ menli ɛya nwiɔ kenle ko ahatualɛ na ahola ayɛ ɛhye!”<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8-9" />Akee Saemɔn Pita adiema, Andelu, zele bɛ kɛ, “Kakula bie wɔ ɛke mɔɔ ɔlɛ kpanwo dɔlɔfo nnu ɔ nee fɛlɛ nwiɔ a! Noko akee duzu bɔbɔ a ɛhye kɛhola kɛyɛ kɛmaa menli ɛwolaa ɛhye a?”<verse eid="JHN 6:8-9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛmaa awie biala ɛdɛnla aze.” Na bɛ muala, mɔɔ bɛ dodo le kɛyɛ apenle nnu la, bɛdɛnlɛdɛnlanle aze wɔ ndile ne azo. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Akee Gyisɛse vale kpanwo dolɔfo ne mɔ na ɔyilale zolɛ, ɔyɛle Nana Nyamenle mo na ɔvale ɔmaanle bɛ. Eza ɔyilale fɛlɛ ne noko azo ɔmaanle bɛ muala bɛlile, na awie biala ako yile tɛkɛɛ!<verse eid="JHN 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Bɛwiele aleɛ ne di la, Gyisɛse zele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Bɛsesa ɔ bo zo mgbokpoleka ne ammaa biala anyɛ gyɛne.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Bɛsesale la bɛnyianle ahɛndɛne tetɛkɛɛ bulu nee nwiɔ!<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Mekɛ mɔɔ menli ne mɔ nwunle nwanwanedeɛ ɛhye la, ɔyɛle bɛ azibɛnwo totohyia, ɔti bɛdeanle nu bɛzele kɛ, “Amgba, kapezonli ne mɔɔ yɛ nye la ye ade la a ɛra la!”<verse eid="JHN 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Gyisɛse nwunle kɛ bɛyɛ anwomoalɛ kɛ bɛkye ye bɛazie ye bɛ belemgbunli, ɔti ɔ ngome ɔvole ɔhɔle awoka ne mɔ azo.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Nɔsolɛ ko ne ala, ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ lumuale ɛnweazo lɔ kɛ bɛkahendɛ ye. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Mɔɔ aleɛ dwole na Gyisɛse ɛmba la, bɛvole ɛlɛne nu kɛ bɛpɛ azule tandane ne bɛahɔ Kapɛnayɛm. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18-19" />Yeangyɛ biala yɛɛ ahumu kpole bie bɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔtu a, ɔti ɛhye maanle nyevile ne yɛle begyebegye zɛhae. Ɛnee noko bɛhɔ kuma nu kɛyɛ mayɛle nsa anzɛɛ nna bɔbɔ. Arɛlevilɛ nu ala bɛnwunle kɛ Gyisɛse ɛletiedia azule ne anye ara ɛlɛne ne anwo! Bɛ ahonle dule kpole kpalɛ, <verse eid="JHN 6:18-19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />na yemɔ ɔdeanle nu ɔvɛlɛle bɛ ɔzele bɛ kɛ bɛmmasulo. <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Akee anyelielɛ nu ala, bɛmaanle ye adenle bɛmaanle ɔravole ɛlɛne ne anu, na ɛkɛ ne ala bɛnwunle kɛ bɛdwu file zo wɔ ɛleka mɔɔ bɛkɔ la.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22-23" />Aleɛ hyenle nwonlomɔ la, menli ekpunli ekpunli dɔɔnwo bie rayiale ɛnwea ne anloa kɛ bɛbakpondɛ Gyisɛse. Ɔluakɛ ɛnee bɛze kɛ ɔ nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ a rale a, na ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ noko gyakyile ye ɛkɛ ne a hɔle a: na yemɔ yeanvo ɛlɛne ne anu bie. Ɛnee noko nlɛne ngyikyi ngyikyi dɔɔnwo mɔɔ vi Taebilease la wɔ ɛvoleɛ ne, <verse eid="JHN 6:22-23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />ɔti mekɛ mɔɔ menli ne mɔ nwunle kɛ Gyisɛse anzɛɛ ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ɛnle ɛkɛ la, bɛfofole nlɛne ne mɔ anu bɛpɛle azule ne bɛhɔle Kapɛnayɛm kɛ bɛkakpondɛ ye.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Mekɛ mɔɔ bɛdwule aze na bɛhɔnwunle ye la, bɛzele kɛ, “Kilehilevolɛ, kɛ ɛzile ɛdwule ɛke ɛ?” <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Gyisɛse buale kɛ, “Memaa bɛade bɛ nwo ɔ bo wienyi kɛ aleɛ ne mɔɔ memaanle bɛ la ati a bɛdoa me a, na tɛ kɛ bɛdie me bɛdi la ati ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Emomu ɔnle kɛ bɛfonla bɛ nwo wɔ aleɛ ne mɔɔ ɛngyɛ na yeazɛkye la anwo. Ɔti bɛva bɛ anwosesebɛ ne bɛkpondɛ ngoane ne mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ, mɔɔ Mame Ngoanedievolɛ ne mevi anwuma maanle ne anu mera kɛ mefa mearɛlɛ bɛ la. Ɔluakɛ ɛhye ala ati a Nyamenle Selɛ ne zoanle me a.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Bɛzele ye kɛ, “Duzu a yɛyɛ a ɛnee ɔkɛzɔ Nyamenle Selɛ ne anye a?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Mɔɔ Selɛ ne kpondɛ ala la a le kɛ bɛkɛlie sonla ne mɔɔ yezoa ye la bɛkɛli.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30-31" />Ɛhye anwo bɛbuale ye kɛ, “Saa ɛkulo kɛ yɛdie wɔ yɛdi kɛ wɔmɔ a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne a, ɛnee yɛ nwanwane debie maa yɛnlea. Maa yɛ aleɛ dahuu, kɛmɔ egya mɔ nyianle ye wɔ fiemgbole ne azo la! Kɛmɔ Ngɛlɛlera ne se la, ‘Mosisi maanle bɛ “manna” anzɛɛ aleɛ mɔɔ vi anwuma.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:30-31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Tɛ Mosisi a vale maanle bɛ a. Egya a maanle bɛ a. Na yemɔ noko a eza ɔlɛmaa bɛ nɔhalɛ Kpanwo ne mɔɔ vi anwuma maanle ne anu la kɛkala a. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Nɔhalɛ Kpanwo ne a le Sonla ne mɔɔ yezoa ye yemaa yevi anwuma maanle ne anu yera la, yɛɛ yemɔ a maa ewiade ngoane a.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Akee bɛzele ye kɛ, “Awulae, maa yɛ zɛhae kpanwo ne bie dahuu!”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Gyisɛse buale kɛ, “Mame a mele Ngoane Kpanwo ne a. Awie biala mɔɔ kɛdoa me bo zo la ɛhɔne ɛnrɛhu ye bieko ɛlɛ. Bɛdabɛ noko mɔɔ bɛdie me bɛdi la nzuhɔne ɛnrɛhu bɛ ɛlɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Emomu mɔɔ yɛ nyane la a le kɛ, bɛnwu me, noko akee bɛnlie bɛnli. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Noko meze kɛ nuhua ne mɔ mɔɔ Egya ɛye bɛ ɛmaa me la bara me ɛkɛ ne, na menrɛkpo bɛ noko ɛlɛ kenlebie maanle nu. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Ɔluakɛ, Egya ne ɛhulolɛdeɛ ti a mevi anwuma maanle ne anu membale kɛ mebayɛ a, na tɛ medame me ti anwo ɛlilɛ ti a membale a. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Egya ne ɛhulolɛdeɛ ne noko a le kɛ, ɔnle kɛ memaa mɔɔ yeva yemaa me la anu kokye bɔbɔ minli, emomu ɔwɔ kɛ memaa bɛ zo mekɔ damɛnlangoate ngoane nu wɔ Kenle ne mɔɔ li amozi ne la anu. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Ɔluakɛ, Egya ne ɛhulolɛdeɛ a le kɛ, awie biala mɔɔ kɛnwu Sonla Ra ne na ɔkɛlie ye ɔkɛli la banyia ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ a. Mebadwazo ye wɔ Ewuledwazolɛ Kenle ne anu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Ɛhye maanle Dwuuma ne mɔ bɔle ɔ bo kɛ bɛtendɛ bɛ nzo abo bɛatia ye, ɔboalekɛ ɔyɛle ɔ nwo kɛ ɔdaye mumua ne a ɔle Kpanwo ne mɔɔ vi anwuma maanle ne anu la. <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Na bɛdeanle nu bɛzele kɛ, “Wio! Anzɛɛ tɛ ɛhye a Gyisɛse, Dwosefi ara ne mɔɔ yɛze ɔ ze nee ɔ nli la ɔ? Na kɛ ɔsi mɔɔ akee ɛnɛ ɔse yɛ kɛ ɔvi anwuma a ɔrale ɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Gyisɛse zele kɛ “Bɛmmatendɛ bɛ nzo abo wɔ ɛhye mɔɔ meha la ati. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Ɔluakɛ awie biala ɛnrɛhola ɛnrɛdoa me kyesɛ Selɛ ne mɔɔ zoanle me la twe ye bɛlɛ me, na dodo biala noko mɔɔ ɔkɛhwe bɛ ɔkɛmaa me la, mebadwazo bɛ meara ngoane nu bieko wɔ Ewudwazo Kenle ne. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Kɛmɔ bɛhɛlɛ ye wɔ Ngɛlɛlera ne anu la, ‘Nana Nyamenle bahilehile bɛ muala!’ Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ Selɛ ne kɛdendɛ kɛhile bɛ mɔɔ bɛkɛnwu nɔhalɛ ne la, bɛbara me ɛkɛ ne. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Ɛhye ɛngile kɛ awie ɛnwu Selɛ ne ɔdaye ɔ nye zo, kyesɛ medame me ngomekye.<verse eid="JHN 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />“Mese bɛ nɔhalɛ nu kɛ, awie biala mɔɔ die me di la ɛnyia ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ dɛbadɛba! <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48-51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48-51" />Ɛhɛe, mame a le Ngoane Kpanwo ne a! Kpanwo ne mɔɔ vi anwuma rale, mɔɔ bɛ ze mɔ lile ye wɔ fiemgbole ne azo la ɛmmaa ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ, yemɔti mɔɔ bɛlile la bɛ muala bɛwuwule. Na Kpanwo ne mɔɔ vi anwuma maanle ne anu la yemɔ a maa awie biala mɔɔ kɛli bie la ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ a. Mame a le zɔhane Ngoane Kpanwo ne mɔɔ vi anwuma maanle nu rale na ɔde aze dahuu la. Awie biala mɔɔ ɔkɛli zɛhae Kpanwo ne la ɔbadɛnla ngoane nu dahuu; me nwonane ne a le zɛhae Kpanwo anzɛɛ aleɛ ne mɔɔ bakpɔne ewiade a.”<verse eid="JHN 6:48-51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Akee Dwuuma ne mɔ bɔle ɔ bo kɛ bɛsu ɛhye anwo kpolera. Bɛbizale kɛ, “Kɛ ɔkɛyɛ na nrenyia ɛhye ahola ava ɔ nwo nane amaa yɛali ɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Gyisɛse zile zo bieko kɛ, “Memaa bɛade bɛ nwo ɔ bo wienyi kɛ: Saa bɛanli Sonla Ra ne anwo nane ne na eza bɛanno ye mogya ne a, bɛnrɛhola bɛnrɛnyia ngoane ne mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la ɛlɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Na awie biala mɔɔ ɔkɛli me nwonane ne na eza ɔkɛnlo me mogya ne la lɛ ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ a, ɔti mebadwazo ye wɔ Ewudwazo Kenle ne anu. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Ɔluakɛ me nwonane ne le nɔhalɛ aleɛ kpalɛ ne bɔkɔɔ, yɛɛ me mogya ne noko a le nzule kpalɛ ne a. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Awie biala mɔɔ ɔdi me nwonane ne na eza ɔno me mogya ne la, ɔde me nu, yɛɛ medame noko mede ye nu. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Tease Nyamenle ne mɔɔ zoanle me la tumi nu a mede a: zɔhane noko ala yɛɛ ɔlua me tumi nu awie biala mɔɔ kɛli me nwonane ne bie la badɛnla ngoane nu a! <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Mame a le Ngoane Kpanwo nɔhalɛ ne mɔɔ vi anwuma maanle nu rale la; na awie biala mɔɔ ɔkɛli zɛhae Kpanwo ne bie la ɔbadɛnla ngoane nu kɔkpula melɛ mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ, na ɔnrɛwu kɛmɔ bɛ ze mɔ lile bɛ anwuma kpanwo ɛdeɛ ne na bɛwule la.” <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Ɔhanle edwɛkpa ɛhye wɔ Kapɛnayɛm ayia sua ne anu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Ye ɛdoavolɛma ne dɔɔnwo bɔbɔ ande ɔ bo, ɔti bɛzele kɛ, “Edwɛkɛ ɛhye yɛ se somaa kɛ yɛkɛde ɔ bo. Nwane bɔbɔ a kɛde ɛhye abo a?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Gyisɛse nwunle kɛ mɔɔ ɔhanle la kye ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ adwenle; ɔti ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Bɛnde ɛhye abo ɔ? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Ɛnee akee saa bɛnwu kɛ Mame Sonla Ra ne melɛsia meahɔ anwuma maanle ne anu bieko a yemɔ duzu a bɛkɛdwenle a? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne angomekye ala a maa ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ a. Nwonane yemɔ ɔle debie gyɛne; yemɔti bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛtɛwole bɛ fofolɛ wɔ Sunsum nu la asa ɛnrɛha ahyɛlɛdeɛ ɛhye ɛlɛ. Na kɛkala mɔ, mehile bɛ adenle mɔɔ saa bɛfa zo a bɛbanyia ngoane ɛhye mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ ɛlɛ la. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Noko bie mɔ wɔ bɛ nu mɔɔ bɛnlie ɛhye bɛnli a.” Ɔluakɛ mɔlebɛbo ne ala ɛnee Gyisɛse ze mɔɔ ɛnlie ɛnli nee mɔɔ baye ye amaa la amuala.<verse eid="JHN 6:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Akee ɔzile bɛ zo bieko kɛ, “Ɛhye ati a menganle mengilele bɛ kɛ, awie biala ɛnrɛhola ɛnrɛdoa me kyesɛ Selɛ ne twe ye maa me la.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Ɛhye maanle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ dɔɔnwo kpole kɛ bɛkɛli ɔ nzi bieko.<verse eid="JHN 6:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Gyisɛse bizale Bulu Nee Nwiɔ ne kɛ, “Anzɛɛ bɛdabɛ noko bɛkulo kɛ bɛgyakyi me bo zo ɛdoalɛ ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Saemɔn Pita buale kɛ, “Awulae, nwane anwo a yɛbahɔ a? Ɛ ngomekye ala a ɛlɛ edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ maa ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la a, <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />yɛɛ yɛdie yɛdi, na eza yɛze noko kɛ amgba Wɔmɔ a ɛle Nana Nyamenle Ara Nwuanzanwuanza ne a.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Menyele bɛ bulu nee nwiɔ, noko ko wɔ bɛ nu mɔɔ ɔle abɔnsam a.” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Ɛnee Dwudase Yesekaleɔto mɔɔ le Saemɔn Yesekaleɔto ara la a ɔlɛdi ye edwɛkɛ a. Ɔluakɛ ɛnee ɔboka Bulu Nee Nwiɔ ne anwo, na yemɔ noko yɛɛ ɔbaye ye yeamaa a.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse anwo kpolerazulɛ ɛdwu ye kpɔmgbɔse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Ɛhye anzi, Gyisɛse hɔle Galeli namunamu ne mɔ azo; na ɔlua kɛ ɛnee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ ɛlɛfa ɔ nwo akpame kɛ ɔkɛyɛ na bɛ sa aha ye bɛahu ye la ati, yeangulo kɛ ɔkɛdɛnla Dwudiya ɛkɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Yeangyɛ biala yɛɛ Dwuuma ɛvoyia mgbole ne mɔ ko mɔɔ bɛdi ye wɔ Ebuo bo la dwule zo a; <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />ɛhye ati Gyisɛse amediema ne mɔ zele ye kɛ ɔhɔ ɛvoyialilɛ ne abo bie wɔ Dwudiya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:3">Bɛzuzule bɛhilele ye bɛzele kɛ, “Ɛvi ɛke kɔ Dwudiya, amaa wɔ ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anwu wɔ nwanwane gyima ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛlɛdi la. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Ɔluakɛ awie ko biala ɛnyɛ nwanwanedeɛ wɔ fealera nu wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔkpondɛ kɛ ɔdie duma la. Saa amgba noko ɛle sonlakpole a ɛnee ye ɛ nwo kile ewiade amra!” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Ɔluakɛ ɛnee ɔ mediema ne mɔ bɔbɔ ɛnlie ye ɛnli.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Gyisɛse buale kɛ, “Bɛmɛ bɛ mekɛ ne wɔ ɛkɛ ne maa bɛ dahuu biala, na mame, me mekɛ ɛdeɛ ne ɛtɛdwule mɔɔ mefa mekɔ a, <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />ɔluakɛ ewiade amra ɛmkpɔ bɛ; emomu mame a bɛkpɔ me a, ɔboalekɛ metendɛ metia bɛ ninyɛndane ne mɔ. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Bɛmɛ bɛlumua wɔ ɛvoyia ne abo, na mame menrɛhɔ ɛkɛ ne kɛkala ɔluakɛ me mekɛ mɔɔ mefa mekɔ la ɛtɛdwule.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Ɔti ɔhale Galeli.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Na mɔɔ ɔ mediema ne mɔ hɔle ɛvoyia ne abo la, akee ɔdaye ɔveale ɔ nwo ɔhɔle ɛkɛ ne bie. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Ɛnee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ ɛlɛkpondɛ ye, ɔti ɛnee bɛlɛbizebiza wɔ ɛvoyia ne abo kɛ saa ngyengyenenu biala awie ɛnwu ye a. Bɛbizale kɛ, “Ɔwɔ nienwu?” <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Ɛnee menli ekpunli ekpunli dɔɔnwo ne ɛlɛsu ɔ nwo kpolera kpalɛ. Bie mɔ zele kɛ, “Ɔ nwo yɛ ɛzulolɛ kpalɛ,” yɛɛ bie mɔ noko zele kɛ, “Kyɛkyɛ, koasea a ɔlɛyɛ menli a.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Awie biala angola ɔ nwo daselɛ di wɔ bagua nu, ɔluakɛ ɛnee bɛsulo Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Mekɛ mɔɔ ɛvoyia ne gyinlanle nu kpole kpalɛ la, akee Gyisɛse hɔle Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu na ɔhanle edwɛkpa ne wɔ bagua nu. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Ɛhye zinle Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ anwo, ɔti bɛzele kɛ, “Kɛ ɔsi mɔɔ ɔze nwoma totohyia zɛhae wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔtɛkɔle sukulu ɛlɛ la ɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Tɛ medame me adwenle a melɛfa meahilehile bɛ a, na emomu mɔɔ Egya vale zoanle me la ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Awie biala mɔɔ nɔhalɛ nu ɔlɛyɛ Nyamenle ɛhulolɛdeɛ la banwu ye wienyi kɛ saa mɔɔ mekilehile la vi Nana Nyamenle ɛkɛ, anzɛɛ medame me tumi a melɛfa meahilehile bɛ a. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Awie biala mɔɔ kpondɛ ɔdaye ye anyunlunyia la fa ye tumi a tendɛ a, na awie biala mɔɔ kpondɛ ahenle mɔɔ zoanle me la anyunlunyia la le nɔhalɛdivo, ɔmbɔ adalɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Tɛ bɛmɛ a Mosisi vale mɛla ne maanle bɛ la ɔ? Noko akee bɛ nuhua biala ɛnli mɛla ne azo. Duzu ati a akee bɛkpondɛ kɛ bɛku mame wɔ ɛhye ati ɛ?” <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Menli dɔɔnwo ne buale ye kɛ, “Ɛdawɔ mumua ne ɛlɛ sunsum ɛtane wɔ wɔ nu! Nwane a kpondɛ kɛ ɔku wɔ a?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21-23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21-23" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Menyɛle gyima wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne, wɔ nrenyia wuliravolɛ bie mɔɔ menyɛle ye ayile la ati, na ɛhye yɛle bɛ nwanwane. Na bɛdabɛ noko, bɛyɛ gyima wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne, wɔ mekɛ biala mɔɔ bɛkɛli Mosisi ye mrenyiazopɛlɛ mɛla ne, mɔɔ le tete amaamuo kpanyinli ɔtɛla ɔdaye mumua ne la azo la; ɔluakɛ saa mekɛ kpalɛ ne mɔɔ bɛfa bɛpɛ bɛ mra mrenyia zo la dwu, na ɔle Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle a, bɛkɔ zo bɛyɛ kɛmɔ ɔse la. Saa ye zɔhane a, ɛnee akee kɛmɔti a saa mame medie awie ngoane wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne a, ɛnee bɛse me kɛ mebɔ munzule ɛ? <verse eid="JHN 7:21-23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Bɛmmanea sonla nyunlu bɛbua ndɛne, na emomu bɛva nɔhalɛ fɔɔnwo adenle ne azo bɛbua.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Gyɛlusalɛm ezuavolɛ ne bie mɔ zele kɛ, “Tɛ nrenyia ɛhye a bɛkpondɛ ye bɛahu ye la ɔ? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Noko akee ɔgyi bagua nu ɔlɛkilehile mɔɔ bɛnyɛ ye ɛhwee a. Anzɛɛ akee mgbanyima ne ɛlie ɛdo nu kɛ yemɔ a le Sonla Ra ne ɔ? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Asoo ɛhye kola yɛ zɔ ɔ? Ɔluakɛ yɛze ɔ bo; na saa Kelaese ne yemɔ ɔba a, ɔbavinde arɛlevilɛ nu wɔ melɛ mɔɔ awie biala ɛnrɛnwu ɛleka bɔbɔ mɔɔ ɔbavi yeara la.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Ɔti Gyisɛse hanle edwɛkpa ne wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Ɛhɛe! Ɔle zɔ kɛ bɛze me bo, na asoo bɛze ɛleka holɛ ko mɔɔ mevi a? Tɛ medame me tumi a menvale membale a. Awie a zoanle me a, na mɔɔ zoanle me noko la a le Nɔhalɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Mame meze ye, ɔluakɛ me nee ye a wɔ ɛkɛ a, yɛɛ yemɔ noko a zoanle me wɔ bɛ nwo a.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Ɔ nloa dɔle la Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ hulole kɛ bɛkɛhye ye; noko awie biala angola anva ɔ sa anga ye, ɔluakɛ ɛnee Awulae mekɛ ne ɛtɛdwule.<verse eid="JHN 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Menli ekpunli ne mɔɔ wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu la dɔɔnwo liele ye lile, na bɛzele kɛ, “Duzu nwanwanendeɛ bɔbɔ a saa Sonla Ra ne ba a ɔkɛyɛ mɔɔ nrenyia ɛhye ɛtɛyɛle a?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Mɔɔ Falasiima ne mɔ dele ɛhye la, bɛmɛ nee azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ zoanle menli kɛ bɛhɔ bɛhɔhye Gyisɛse.<verse eid="JHN 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Na Gyisɛse noko zele bɛ kɛ “Ɔnrɛhyɛ biala mebazia meahɔ mɔɔ zoanle me la ɛkɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Bɛbakpondɛ me, noko akee bɛnrɛnwu me, ɔboalekɛ ɛleka mɔɔ mebahɔ la bɛnrɛhola ɛkɛ ne ba!”<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Edwɛkɛ ɛhye zinle Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ anwo totohyia, na bɛbizebizale bɛ nwo kɛ, “Ɛnee nienwu bɔbɔ a ɔbahɔ mɔɔ yɛnrɛnwu ye a? Ɛnee ɔkpondɛ yeadoa Dwuuma mɔɔ wɔ ngameɛ ngameɛ la yeahɔha Nyamedwɛkɛ ne yeahile ewiade amra mɔɔ ɛnle Dwuuma fee la ɔ? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Saa ɔka kɛ ‘Bɛnrɛhola ɛleka mɔɔ mewɔ la ba’ yɛɛ ‘Bɛbakpondɛ me na bɛnrɛnwu me’ a, ɛnee duzu a ɔkpondɛ yeahile a?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Kenle ne mɔɔ li awieleɛ wɔ ɛvoyia ne anu, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɛnee ɛvoyia ne ɛlo kɛ foanlɛ la, Gyisɛse vale ɛnelɛ kpole bie deanle nu zele menli dɔɔnwo ne kɛ, “Awie biala mɔɔ nzuhɔne ku ye la ɔrɛla me nwo. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Ɔluakɛ Ngɛlɛlera ne se kɛ awie biala mɔɔ die me di la ngoane nzule bavi ye nu adenrɛ kɛ azudenle la.”<verse eid="JHN 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Ɛhye mɔɔ ɔhanle la fale Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne mɔɔ menli mɔɔ die ye di la banyia ye na ɔtɛbale awie biala anwo zo la anwo; ɔluakɛ ɛnee bɛtɛwulale Gyisɛse anyunlunyia wɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Mɔɔ menli ɛwolaa ne dele kɛ ɔlɛka ɛhye la, bɛ nuhua bie mɔ deanle nu zele kɛ, “Nɔhalɛ nu, nrenyia ɛhye a le kapezonli ne mɔɔ lumua Ngoanedievolɛ ne anyunlu la.” <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41-42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41-42" />Bie mɔ noko zele kɛ, “Ɔdaye mumua ne a ɔle Ngoanedievolɛ ne a.” Eza bie mɔ noko hɔle zo zele kɛ, “Tɛ ye ɔ! Kɛ ɔsi mɔɔ Ngoanedievolɛ ne kola fi Galeli ɛ? Bɛnze kɛ Ngɛlɛlera mumua ne ka ye wienyi kɛ bɛbawo Ngoanedievolɛ ne wɔ Devidi abusua nu wɔ Bɛtelɛhɛm, ɛleka mɔɔ bɛwole belemgbunli Devidi mumua ne la ɔ?” <verse eid="JHN 7:41-42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Ɔti menli ɛwolaa ne anloa anzɛ wɔ ɔ nwo. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Bɛ nuhua bie mɔ hulole kɛ bɛkɛhye ye, noko awie biala anva ɔ sa anga ye.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Mɔɔ menli mɔɔ rale ye ɛhyelɛ la ziale hɔle azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli ne nee Falasiima ne mɔ anwo lɔ la, bɛbizale bɛ kɛ, “Duzu ati a bɛ nee ye amba a?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Bɛbuale bɛ kɛ, “Awie biala ɛnle ɛkɛ ne mɔɔ ɔtendɛ ɔkile ye a ye adwenle ɛnrɛla fɔɔnwo a!”<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Falasiima ne mɔ noko zile ɛzoavolɛma ne amgbu zele kɛ, “Ɔti bɛmaa yebɛlɛbɛla bɛdabɛ noko ɔ? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Ɔti yɛ eku ye anu bie mɔ noko ɛlie ye ɛli kɛ yemɔ a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne ɔ? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Saa menli ekpunli ekpunli ahoasea ɛhye mɔ ala na alie ye ali; na duzu bɔbɔ a bɛze ye wɔ nwolɛ a? Abule kpalɛ a ɛbu bɛ a!”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Akee Nekɔdimɛse, Falasiima ne mɔ anu ko, mɔɔ mekɛ bie ɔhɔle Gyisɛse anwo nɔɔzo la dwazole dendɛle. <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />Ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Asoo ɔfa mɛla nu kɛ bɛkɛbua awie ndɛne wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ bɛtɛdile ye edwɛkɛ la ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Bɛbuale ye kɛ, “Ɛdawɔ noko ɛle Galelinli ɔ? Ɛdawɔ kpondɛ ye wɔ Ngɛlɛlera ne anu na ɛbanwu kɛ kapezoma biala ɛnrɛvi Galeli ɛnrɛvinde ɛlɛ!” <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Akee ayiama ne bɔle asande na awie biala hɔle ye sua nu.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Wɔ ɛzonletovoma ne mɔ wɔ nienwu?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Gyisɛse ziale hɔle Boka Ɔlivi ne azo, <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />na aleɛ hyenle bieko la, ye nwonlomɔ mangyee ne ala, eza ɔrale Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu bieko. Yeangyɛ biala yɛɛ menli dɔɔnwo ne rayiale bieko a. Ɔti ɔdɛnlanle aze na ɔhilehilele bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Mɔɔ ɔ nloa wɔ zo ɔtendɛ la, Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ nee Falasiima ne mɔ nee raalɛ bie mɔɔ yehɔbɔ huhunli ɛbɛla ɛmaa bɛhye ye la rale menli dɔɔnwo ne avinli.<verse eid="JHN 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Bɛzele Gyisɛse kɛ, “Kilehilevolɛ, yɛhyele raalɛ ɛhye wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔgua zo ɔlɛbɔ huhunli ɛbɛla la. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Mosisi mɛla ne kile kɛ raalɛ biala mɔɔ kɛbɔ zɛhae ɛbɛla la ɔwɔ kɛ bɛsi ye awolɛ bɛku ye. Na kɛ ɛse ɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Ɛnee bɛkpondɛ kɛ ɔka edwɛkɛ bie mɔɔ ɔlua zo a bɛ sa kɛha ye bɛkɛhye ye a, na Gyisɛse noko anga ɛhwee. Ɔbutule na ɔvale ɔ sa ɔhɛlɛhɛlɛle aze. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Mɔɔ bɛgua ɔ nwo zo kɛ ɔye bɛ edwɛkɛ ne anloa la, ɔdwazole ɔgyinlanle bieko na ɔhanle kɛ, “Bɛzi ye awolɛ kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ ɔkɛwu a. Na emomu mɔɔ ɛtɛyɛle ɛtane ɛlɛ la yɛɛ ɛlumua ɛdo ye bolɛ ne a!”<verse eid="JHN 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Ɔbutule bieko na eza ɔhɛlɛhɛlɛle azɛlɛ ne anwo bieko. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Akee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ hwenle bɛ nwo nyaa hɔle ngoko ngoko, na bɛ kpanyinli ne bɔbɔ yɛɛ alumuale a. Ɔti nzinlii ɔhale Gyisɛse nee raalɛ ne angomekye ala wɔ ɛkɛ ne.<verse eid="JHN 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Gyisɛse dwazole bieko na ɔbizale raalɛ ne kɛ, “Na menli mɔɔ donle wɔ ɛzonle ne la wɔ nienwu? Anzɛɛ bɛ nuhua ko bɔbɔ ambu wɔ fɔlɛ ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Raalɛ ne zele ye kɛ, “Awulae, Kyɛkyɛ.” Gyisɛse noko zele ye kɛ, “Ɛnee medame noko membu wɔ fɔlɛ biala. Kɔ, na mmakɔyɛ ɛtane bieko.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Nzinlii mɔɔ eza Gyisɛse tendɛ ahile bɛ bieko la, ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Mame a le ewiade kɛnlaneɛ ne a. Ɔti mɔɔ kɛli me nzi la awozinli ɛnrɛmaa ɔ gyakɛ ɛnrɛkpula ɛlɛ, ɔluakɛ me kɛnlaneɛ ne bamaa ye wienyi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Falasiima ne mɔ buale ye kɛ, “Ɛtu ɛ nwo somaa; eza ɛle adalɛ!”<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Saa bɔbɔ melɛdi me nwo daselɛ a ɔle nɔhalɛ. Ɔluakɛ meze ɛleka mɔɔ mevi membale a, yɛɛ meze ɛleka noko mɔɔ melɛkɔ a, na bɛmɛ bɛnze. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Bɛmɛ bɛnea sonla nyunlu a bɛbua ndɛne a, na mame noko membua awie biala ndɛne, <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />yɛɛ saa mebua ndɛne bɔbɔ a, me ndɛnebualɛ ne le nɔhalɛ bɔkɔɔ; ɔluakɛ tɛ me ngomekye a mebua ndɛne ne a, me nee Egya ne mɔɔ zoanle me la a yɛbua a. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Ɔwɔ bɛ mɛla ne anu kɛ saa dasevolɛma nwiɔ anloa yɛ ko wɔ edwɛkɛ nwo a ɛnee bɛ daselɛlilɛ ne le nɔhalɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Saa ɔle zɔ ɛdeɛ a ɛnee noko medi me nwo daselɛ, yɛɛ Egya ne mɔɔ zoanle me la noko di me nwo daselɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Ɛ Ze ne wɔ nienwu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Bɛnze me sonla holɛ, yemɔti a bɛnze Egya ne noko la. Saa bɛze me a, anrɛɛ bɛkɛnwu Egya ne noko.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bie mɔ ɛlie ɛli, bie mɔ ɛzu kpolera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Gyisɛse hanle edwɛkɛ ɛhye mɔ wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu ɛleka ne mɔɔ bɛfa ezukoa bɛsie la. Noko awie biala angye ye, ɔluakɛ ɛnee ye mekɛ ne ɛtɛdwule.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Nzinlii, eza ɔzele bɛ bieko kɛ, “Melɛkɔ; bɛbakpondɛ me, na bɛnrɛnwu me, ɔluakɛ ɛleka mɔɔ melɛkɔ la bɛnrɛhola ɛkɛ ne ba. Yemɔti bɛbawu wɔ bɛ ɛtane ne mɔ anu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Dwuuma ne mɔ bizebizale bɛ nwo kɛ, “Ɛnee ɔkabɔ ɔ nwo akɔnvo ɔ? Saa ɔka ye kɛ, ‘Bɛnrɛhola bɛnrɛra ɛleka mɔɔ melɛkɔ’ la a ɛnee duzu a ɔkpondɛ yeahile a?”<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Akee ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛmɛ bɛvi azɛlɛ ye azo; mame noko mevi anwuma. Bɛmɛ bɛvi ewiade ɛhye anu; mame noko menvi nu. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Ɛhye ati a mese bɛbawu wɔ bɛ ɛtane ne mɔ anu la; ɔluakɛ saa bɛanlie bɛanli kɛ mame a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne ɔ nee Sonla Ra ne a, bɛbawu wɔ bɛ ɛtane ne mɔ anu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Bɛzele ye kɛ, “Na wɔmɔ ɛle duzu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Yemɔ ɔla a meka ye dahuu la. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Mebahola meabua bɛ ndɛne na eza meahilehile bɛ ninyɛne dɔɔnwo mɔɔ mekulo a, noko akee menyɛ ye zɔ, ɔluakɛ mɔɔ zoanle me la ɛdeɛ ne ala a meka a; na yemɔ a le Nɔhalɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Eza bɛangola bɛande ɔ bo kɛ Nana Nyamenle Selɛ bedevinli ne anwo edwɛkɛ a ɔlɛka la.<verse eid="JHN 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Ɔti Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Mekɛ mɔɔ bɛkɛbɔ me meanubaka nu la, yɛɛ akee bɛbanwu kɛ amuanrɛɛ mame a le Sonla Ra ne a. Eza noko bɛbanwu ye kɛ nɔhalɛ ne mɔɔ Egya hilele me la a menganle mengilele bɛ la. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Na mɔɔ zoanle me noko la nee me lua, ɔtɛkpole me, ɔluakɛ dahuu meyɛ ye ɛhulolɛdeɛ ne.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30-31" />Akee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ dɔɔnwo mɔɔ dele ye edwɛkɛ ne la liele ye lile kɛ amgba yemɔ a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:30-31">Na Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Saa bɛdi mɔɔ meka la azo a, ɛnee bɛle me ɛdoavolɛma bɔkɔɔ; <verse eid="JHN 8:30-31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />bɛbanwu nɔhalɛ ne, na nɔhalɛ ne noko bamaa bɛ fanwodi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Na bɛzele kɛ, “Yɛle Ebileham abo zo amra, yɛɛ yɛtɛyɛle ngɛkɛlɛ ɛlɛ! Na duzu ati a akee ɛse ‘yɛbanyia fanwodi’ ɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Gyisɛse buale kɛ, “Ɛtanevolɛ biala le ɛtane akɛlɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Yɛɛ akɛlɛ biala noko ɛnlɛ fanwodi, kyesɛ Ralɛ ne angomekye ala! <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Zɔhane ati saa Ralɛ ne maa bɛ fanwodi a, ɛnee bɔ zo mɔɔ bɛ nwo ɛdɔ bɛ a. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Meze kɛ bɛle Ebileham abo zo amra ɛdeɛ, noko akee bɛ bie mɔ ɛlɛbɔ me nwo tokule kɛ bɛku me, ɔluakɛ me edwɛkɛ ne angɔ bɛ ahonle ne mɔ anu. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Mɔɔ meze ye wɔ Egya anwo la yɛɛ meka meahile bɛ a. Na bɛmɛ noko mɔɔ bɛ ze zele bɛ la yɛɛ bɛlɛyɛ a.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Bɛdeanle nu bɛzele kɛ, “Yɛ ze a le Ebileham!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Saa amgba ala bɛle Ebileham amra a ɛnee bɛyɛ mɔɔ Ebileham yɛle la bie. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Me ɛtane mɔɔ meyɛ mɔɔ ɔti bɛkpondɛ me bɛahu me la a le kɛ meha nɔhalɛ ne mɔɔ vi Nana Nyamenle nehane la mehile bɛ. Tɛ ɛbɛla mɔɔ Ebileham bɔle la ɛne! <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Mɔɔ bɛ ze yɛ la bie a bɛlɛyɛ la.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Bɛbuale kɛ, “Bɛanwo yɛ wɔ huhunli nyɛleɛ nu, yɛɛ yɛnle mbelazinli mralɛ: yɛ Ze kpalɛ ne a le Nyamenle Bedevinli mumua ne.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Saa bɛ ze a le Nana Nyamenle a, anrɛɛ bɛkɛnyia me nwo ɛlɔlɛ, ɔluakɛ mevi Nana Nyamenle ɛkɛ ne a membale a. Meanva me tumi a membale a, emomu yemɔ a zoanle me a. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Duzu ati a bɛngola bɛnde mɔɔ melɛka la abo a? Ɔboalekɛ bɛdu bɛ gye kɛ bɛnrɛdie me edwɛkɛ la ati ɔ! <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Bɛ ze a le Abɔnsam, ɔti ninyɛndane ne mɔɔ ɔyɛ la bie ala a bɛdabɛ noko bɛyɛ a. Mɔlebɛbo ne ɔle kodiawu, ɔnli nɔhalɛ, ɔluakɛ nɔhalɛ ekyii zɛhae bɔbɔ ɛnle ye nu. Ɔbɔ adalɛ a ɔfɛta ye; ɔboalekɛ yemɔ a le adalɛmenle ne a. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Ɛhye ati noko yɛɛ bɛdabɛ bɛkyi nɔhalɛ ne mɔɔ meka mekile bɛ la, na bɛnlie bɛnli la!<verse eid="JHN 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />“Bɛ nuhua ne boni bɔbɔ a kɛhola kɛbu me ɛtane kokye anwo fɔlɛ a? Na saa nɔhalɛ ne a melɛka meahile bɛ la a; ɛnee duzu ati a bɛnlie me bɛnli ɛ? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Nyamenle ara biala tie ye edwɛkɛ. Sumunli kenle ala mɔɔ bɛmɛ bɛndie Nyamenle edwɛkɛ la, ɛnee ɔkile kɛ bɛnle Nyamenle amra.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Dwuuma mgbanyima ne deɛdeanle nu guale ɔ nwo zo kɛ, “Wɔmɔ Samɛleanli! Munzuvolɛ mɔɔ sunsum ɛtane ɛdwu ɛ nwo zo a! Ɔti a sumunli kɛ de la yɛka ye kɛ sunsum ɛtane ɛdwu ɛ nwo zo la.”<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Gyisɛse zele kɛ, “Kyɛkyɛ, sunsum ɛtane biala ɛnle me nu. Nɔhalɛ ne a le kɛ, Medi me ze eni, na bɛmɛ bɛnli me eni. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Tɛ kɛ asɛɛ mewula me nwo anyunlunyia ɔ, na awie ko wɔ ɛkɛ mɔɔ me anyunlunyia ɛwulalɛ ne wɔ ɔ sa nu a, na yemɔ noko a lɛ zolɛ tumi a. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Nɔhalɛ nu, nɔhalɛ nu, mese bɛ kɛ, ‘Awie biala mɔɔ kɛli me edwɛkɛ zo la, ɔnrɛwu ɛlɛ!’ ”<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ zele kɛ, “Akee wɔmaa yela ali kɛ sunsum ɛtane wɔ wɔ nu. Ebileham nee kapezoma mgbole mgbole ne mɔ bɔbɔ ɛwu ɛhɔ; noko akee wɔmɔ ɛse saa awie tie wɔ a ɔnrɛwu ɛlɛ! <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Ɛdawɔ mumua ne kɛ ɛbu ɛ nwo ɛ? Ɛnea a ɛle kpole ɛtɛla yɛ ze Ebileham nee kapezoma ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛwu la ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Akee Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Saa mewula me nwo anyunlunyia a me anyunlunyia ne le gyɛne. Egya ne a wula me anyunlunyia a, na yemɔ noko a bɛmɛ bɛfɛlɛ ye bɛ Nyamenle ne la. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Bɛnze ye bɔbɔ. Mame ala a meze ye a. Ɔti saa mese kɛ menze ye a ɛnee mebɔ adalɛ kɛ bɛdabɛ ala la pɛ! Nɔhalɛ nu, meze ye bɔkɔɔ. Yɛɛ eza noko medi ye mɛla zo. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Bɛ ze Ebileham lile fɛlɛko kɛ ɔkɛnwu me maleɛ ne. Ɔnwunle ye noko na ɔlile nwolɛ fɛlɛko kpole.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ zele ye kɛ, “Ɛdawɔ mumua ne ɛtɛdile ɛvolɛ abulanlu, na kɛ ɔyɛle mɔɔ ɛholale ɛnwunle Ebileham ɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Gyisɛse buale kɛ, “Nɔhalɛ wienyi ne a le kɛ, mɔɔ ɛnee bɛtɛwole Ebileham bɔbɔ la, ɛnee mede aze dɛbadɛba!”<verse eid="JHN 8:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Ɛhye maanle Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ akee sesale awolɛ kɛ bɛtoto bɛabɔ ye bɛahu ye. Noko Gyisɛse minliminlinle bɛ nye zo minlimɛnla na ɔvale bɛ sa abo nyaa ɔvi Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu ɔhɔle.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse ɛyɛ anyezinliravolɛ ayile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Na mɔɔ ɔlua adenle nu ɔkɔ la, ɔnwunle nrenyia bie mɔɔ bɛwole ye anyezinliravolɛ la.<verse eid="JHN 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bizale ye kɛ, “Kilehilevolɛ, duzu ati a bɛwole nrenyia ɛhye anyezinliravolɛ a? Ɛnee ɔlua ɔdaye mumua ne ye ɛtane ti anzɛɛ ye awovolɛma ɛtane ti ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Kyɛkyɛ, tɛ bɛ nuhua biala ɛtane ti ɔ. Na emomu, kɛ ɔkɛyɛ na Awulae Nyamenle tumi ne ala ali la ati ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Ɔwɔ kɛ yɛ muala yɛyɛ Nana Nyamenle gyima ne ndɛndɛ, ɔluakɛ ɔnrɛhyɛ biala ɛnee aledwolɛ ɛra mɔɔ awie biala ɛngola gyima yɛ a. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Wɔ melɛ ala mɔɔ mewɔ ewiade anu la, mele ewiade ne kɛnlaneɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Akee ɔdole nyɛlɛ aze na ɔvale nyɛlɛ ne ɔfɔtɔle ndɛtɛlɛ na ɔvale ɔbetanle nrenyia ne anye zo, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Kɔ kɔnrinzi ɛ nyunlu wɔ Saelowam Nzulebula ne anu.” “Saelowam” ne abo a le kɛ “Bɛzoa me”. Ɔti nrenyia ne hɔle ɛleka mɔɔ bɛzoanle ye la, na ɔhɔnrinzinle ɔ nyunlu; akee ɔziale ɔ nzi ɔrale mɔɔ ɛnee ɔ nye ɛbuke a.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Mɔɔ ɔ gɔnwo mɔ nee menli gyɛne mɔɔ ze ye la nwunle ye la, bɛbizale bɛ nwo kɛ, “Asoo tɛ nrenyia ne mɔɔ tɛnla adehanle sɛlɛzɛlɛ ninyɛne ne la a le ɛhye ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Bɛzule bɛ nwo kpolera, bie mɔ zele kɛ ɔdaye ɔ, yɛɛ bie mɔ noko zele kɛ tɛ ye ɔ, na ɛzɔhonlɛ ala a ɔzɔho ye a!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Na nrenyia mumua ne zele bɛ kɛ, “Medame ɔ!”<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Akee bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Duzu edwɛkɛ a zile mɔɔ maanle ɛ nye bukele a?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Ɔbuale bɛ kɛ, “Nrenyia ne mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Gyisɛse la a fɔtɔle ndɛtɛlɛ betanle me nye, na ɔmaanle mengɔnwowole ye wɔ Saelowam Nzulebula ne anu a. Menyɛle ala pɛ yɛɛ me nye bukele a!”<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Nienwu a ɔwɔ ye kɛkala a?” Ɔbuale bɛ kɛ, “Menze.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Akee be nee nrenyia ne hɔle Mɛla eku anzɛɛ Falasiima ne mɔ anyunlu. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Na ɛhye amuala noko zile wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Akee Falasiima ne mɔ bizale ye nwolɛ edwɛkɛ. Yemɔti ɔdaye noko ɔzɔle zo ɔhanle kɛ ɔzile mɔɔ Gyisɛse fɔtɔle ndɛtɛlɛ ne betanle ɔ nye na ɔhɔwowole na ɔnwunle debie la amuala ɔhilele bɛ.<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Bɛ nuhua bie mɔ zele kɛ, “Ɛnee noko zɛhae Gyisɛse ye ɛnvi Nyamenle ɛkɛ, ɔboalekɛ ɔyɛ gyima wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Bɛ nuhua bie mɔ bizale kɛ, “Kɛ ɔsi mɔɔ ɛtanevolɛ gyɛne biala kɛhola kɛyɛ nwanwanedeɛ ɛhye ɛ?” Ɔti bɛ nloa anzɛ bɛ nwo.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Akee Falasiima ne mɔ hɔle nrenyia ne mɔɔ anrɛɛ le anyezinliravolɛ la anwo zo bieko, na bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Ɛnea a nwane a le nrenyia ɛhye mɔɔ bukele ɛ nye ne la?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Ɔbuale bɛ kɛ, “Medie medi kɛ ɔle Nana Nyamenle kapezonli bie mɔɔ yezoa ye a.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ anlie anli kɛ nrenyia ɛhye a ɛnee le anyezinliravolɛ ne a. Ɔti bɛvɛlɛle ye awovolɛma, <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />na bɛbizale bɛ kɛ, “Asoo bɛ ra ye a le ɛhye ɔ? Asoo bɛwole ye la ɛnee ɔ nye ɛzi ɔ? Saa ɔle zɔhane ɛdeɛ a, ɛnee duzu ati a akee yenwu debie ɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Ye awovolɛma ne buale kɛ, “Yɛze kɛ yɛ ra ɛne, yɛɛ yɛze noko kɛ bɛwole ye anyezinliravolɛ, <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />na emomu kɛ ɔzile mɔɔ akee ɔnwunle debie, ɔ nee ahenle mɔɔ yɛle ye ayile la ɛdeɛ, yemɔ yɛnze. Ɔdaye ɔle ɔ ti anwo kpanyinli mɔɔ ɔkola ɔka ɔ nloa anu edwɛkɛ a. Ɔti bɛbiza ye.”<verse eid="JHN 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22-23" />Bɛhanle ɛhye, ɔluakɛ ɛnee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ ɛbɔ bɛ kɔkɔ kɛ dasanli biala mɔɔ kɛha kɛ Gyisɛse a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne la bɛnrɛmaa ye adenle bɛnrɛmaa ɔnrɛhɔ bɛ ayiasua ne anu bieko. Ɔti ɛnee bɛsulo.<verse eid="JHN 9:22-23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Ɔti eza Falasiima ne mɔ vɛlɛle nrenyia ne, mɔɔ anrɛɛ le anyezinliravolɛ la bieko, na bɛzele ye kɛ, “Fa anyunlunyia ne maa Nana Nyamenle; mmafa ɛmaa Gyisɛse, ɔluakɛ yɛze ye wienyi kɛ Gyisɛse le ɛtanevolɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Nrenyia ne buale bɛ kɛ, “Saa ɔle ɛtanevolɛ o, saa ɔle tenlenenli o, mame menze. Mɔɔ meze la ala a le kɛ: Anrɛɛ mele anyezinliravolɛ, na kɛkala mɔ menwu debie bɔkɔɔ!”<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Na duzu a ɔyɛle a? Kɛ ɔzile ɔyɛle wɔ ayile ɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Nrenyia ne deanle nu zele kɛ, “Ayi mɔ, meha ye ko mehile bɛ bɛandie! Na duzu ati a akee bɛmmaa mennyia me nwo adenle noko ɛ? Anzɛɛ bɛdabɛ noko bɛkpondɛ kɛ bɛyɛ ye ɛdoavolɛma ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Bɛbɔle ye aholoba na bɛzele ye kɛ, “Wɔmɔ a ɛle ye ɛdoavolɛ a, na yɛmɛ yɛle Mosisi ɛdoavolɛma. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Yɛze kɛ Nana Nyamenle dendɛle hilele Mosisi, na zɛhae sonla ye yɛmɛ yɛnze ɔ nwo edwɛkɛ biala.”<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Nrenyia ne buale bɛ kɛ, “Wio! Bɛ edwɛkɛ ye yɛ me azibɛnwo kpole! Bɛ nye dua kɛ ɔkola ɔbuke anyezinliravolɛma anye, noko akee bɛse bɛnze ɔ nwo edwɛkɛ hweledede! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Bɛze kɛ Nana Nyamenle noko ɛndie ɛtanevolɛma nzɛlɛlɛ, emomu menli mɔɔ sonle ye na eza bɛyɛ ye ahunludwolɛdeɛ la a ɔtie bɛ nzɛlɛlɛ a. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Sumunli kɛ bɛbɔle ewiade too mɔɔ bakpula ɛnɛ la, awie biala ɛtɛkolale ɛtɛbukele sonla mɔɔ bɛwole ye anyezinliravolɛ la anye ɛlɛ. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Saa nrenyia ɛhye ɛnvi Nana Nyamenle lɔ a, anrɛɛ ɔnrɛholɛ ɛhye yɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Bɛdeanle ye nu bɛzele kɛ, “Hɛe! Ɛtanevolɛ mɔɔ le kɛ ɛdawɔ. Wɔmɔ a ɛbahile yɛ debie anzɛɛ?” Ɔti bɛwɔle ɔ kɔme anzi kpulo kɛ ɔhɔ.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse dele mɔɔ ɛzi la, ɔkpondɛle nrenyia ne na ɔbizale ye kɛ, “Ɛdie Sonla Ra ne ɛdi ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Nrenyia ne noko bizale ye kɛ, “Na yemɔ a le nwane; mɛsɛlɛ wɔ, kile me, amaa mealie ye meali.”<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Wɔnwu ye, na yemɔ a ɛlɛtendɛ ahile wɔ la!”<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Nrenyia ne zele kɛ, “Wioo, Awulae, akee melie meli!” Akee ɔhotole na ɔyeyɛle Gyisɛse.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Gyisɛse akee zele ye kɛ, “Mera ewiade anu kɛ mebabuke menli mɔɔ anye ɛzi wɔ sunsum nu la anye, na meamaa menli mɔɔ bɛdwenle kɛ bɛnwu debie la anwu kɛ amuanrɛɛ bɛle anyezinliravolɛma.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Falasiima mɔɔ gyigyi ɛkɛ ne la bizale ye kɛ, “Ɛnee ɛkpondɛ wɔaze yɛ kɛ yɛle anyezinliravolɛma ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Saa bɛze kɛ bɛle anyezinliravolɛma a; anrɛɛ bɛnli fɔlɛ; na kɛmɔ bɛse bɛze mɔɔ bɛyɛ anzɛɛ bɛnwu debie la ati a bɛ fɔlɛlilɛ ne noko tɛbɔ bɛ nwo a.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Boaneneavolɛ kpalɛ ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Mekɛ ne anu Gyisɛse zele kɛ, “Nɔhalɛ nu, nɔhalɛ nu, mese bɛ kɛ awie biala mɔɔ ɛnva mboane tunli anlenkɛ kpole ne anu na ɔpe ɛleka gyɛne kolaa na yeahɔ nuhua la le awule, eza ɔle kodiawu! <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Ɔluakɛ boaneneavolɛ biala pe anlenkɛ wienyi ne anu a kɔ ye mboane tunli nu a. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Saa ɔdwu tunli ne anloa a anlenkɛ sinzavolɛ ne buke ye, na kɛ mboane ne mɔ noko te ɔ ne la ɛnee bɛra; akee ɔfɛlɛ ye mboane deɛ ne mɔɔ wɔ nu la ɔbobɔ bɛ anluma ngoko ngoko na ɔ nee bɛ finde kɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Ɔdi bɛ nyunlu; yɛɛ bɛdabɛ noko bɛtoa ye, ɔluakɛ bɛze ɔ ne. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Saa ahenle le ɛyɛvolɛ a bɛndoa ye, emomu bɛnriandi bɛfi ɔ nwo ɛkɛ, ɔluakɛ bɛnze ɔ ne.”<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Menli mɔɔ dele Gyisɛse ɛrɛlɛbulɛ ɛhye la ande ɔ bo, <verse eid="JHN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />ɔti ɔhilele ɔ bo ɔhilele bɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 10:7">Ɔzele kɛ: “Mame a le mboane ne mɔ bɛ Anlenkɛ Kpole ne a. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛlumuale me nyunlu la amuala le nwule. Ɔti mboane ne mɔ biala andie bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Nɔhalɛ nu, mame a le Anlenkɛ Kpole ne a. Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛfa Anlenkɛ Kpole ne anu bɛba tunli ne anu la banyia ngoane, na bɛbawolo nu, bɛavinde na bɛanyia ndile dɔɔnwo noko bɛali. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Awule biala bodane mɔɔ gyi ɔ nyunlu la a le kɛ ɔkɛwua, anzɛɛ ɔkɛhu bɛ na ɔkɛzɛkye bɛ. Mame noko me bodane mɔɔ gyi me nyunlu la a le kɛ menwɔmaa bɛ ngoane wɔ adenle biala mɔɔ ɔfɛta la anu.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />“Mame a le Boaneneavolɛ Kpalɛ ne a. Boaneneavolɛ Kpalɛ ne fa ye ngoane bɔ azu maa ye mboane ne. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Ɛkpavo ne mɔ yemɔ mboane ne mɔ ala a ɔnea zo a; saa ɔnwu kɛ bɛdi ɛlɛba a ɔnriandi ɔgyakyi mboane ne mɔ ɛkɛ ne, ɔluakɛ tɛ ye deɛ ɔ. Ɔti bɛdi ne wulu tɔ bɛ nu na ɔbɔ mboane ekpunli ne asande. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Deɛmɔti ɛkpavo ne nriandi la a le kɛ, ɔrale ɔbali ye ɛkpa ala, na tɛ mboane ne mɔ anwo mɔɔ hyia ye la ati ɔ.<verse eid="JHN 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />“Mame a le Boaneneavolɛ Kpalɛ ne mɔɔ meze me mboane, na me mboane ne mɔ noko ze me a. <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />Kɛmɔ Egya ne ze me, na medame noko meze ye la, zɔhane ala yɛɛ mefa me ngoane noko meto ye aze memaa me mboane ne mɔ a. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Melɛ mboane bie mɔɔ bɛnle ekpunli ye anu a, ɔti ɔwɔ kɛ mefa bɛdabɛ noko meba na bɛbatie me ne; amaa mboane ekpunli ne ayɛ ko wɔ Boaneneavolɛ ko abo.<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />“Selɛ ne kulo me edwɛkɛ, ɔboalekɛ meto me ngoane ne aze na ɔyɛ a eza meava ye bieko. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Awie biala ɛnrɛhola ɛnrɛhu me wɔ melɛ mɔɔ metɛmaanle ye adenle la. Meto me ngoane aze wɔ medame me ɛhulolɛ nu. Ɔluakɛ melɛ tumi kɛ meto ye aze yɛɛ eza melɛ tumi kɛ mefa ye bieko; ɛhye kile kɛ Egya a ɛva tumi ɛhye ɛmaa me a.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Mɔɔ ɔhanle edwɛkɛ ɛhye la, Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ anloa anzɛ bɛ nwo wɔ nwolɛ bieko. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Bie mɔ zele kɛ, “Saa tɛ sunsum ɛtane a ɛdwu ɔ nwo zo a, ɛnee noko ɔ ti a ɛha ɔ nwo a. Asoo sonla mɔɔ bɛtie ye edwɛkɛ la ɛne?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Bie mɔ noko zele kɛ, “Tɛ sunsum ɛtane edwɛkɛ a le ɛhye. Kɛ ɔsi mɔɔ sonla mɔɔ sunsum ɛtane wɔ ye nu la kola buke anyezinliravolɛ nye ɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ka ye wienyi kile yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22-23" />Ɛnee ɔle ɛyɛlɛ mekɛ, na Gyisɛse wɔ Gyɛlusalɛm Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anwo Munzule Ɛkpalɛ Ɛvoyia ne abo. Ɔhɔle Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu, ɔhɔwolole ɛleka ne mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Sɔlɔmɔn Asalo la. <verse eid="JHN 10:22-23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Na Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ bɔle yiale ye na bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Kenle nzu a ɛkɛye ɛ nwo ɛkɛhile yɛ a? Saa wɔmɔ a le Kelaese ne a, ɛnee ka ye nɔhalɛ wienyi kile yɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Meha mehile bɛ dɛbadɛba, noko bɛanlie bɛanli. Nwanwane ninyɛne ne mɔ mɔɔ medua Egya duma nu meyɛ la a le nwolɛ daselɛlilɛ a. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Noko bɛnlie me bɛnli, ɔboalekɛ bɛmboka me mboane ekpunli deɛ ne anwo. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Me mboane ne mɔ ze me, yɛɛ medame noko meze bɛ, ɔti bɛtoa me noko. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Bɛnwu ɛlɛ, ɔluakɛ memaa bɛ ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ, yɛɛ awie biala noko ɛnrɛhola ɛnrɛlie bɛ ɛnrɛvi me sa nu. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Egya a vale bɛ maanle me a, na yemɔ noko ɔlɛ tumi ɔtɛla awie biala, zɔhane ati awie biala ɛnrɛwua bɛ ɛnrɛvi Egya asa anu. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Me nee Egya ne le ko.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Eza Dwuuma ne mɔ sesale awolɛ bieko kɛ bɛtoto bɛabɔ ye bɛahu ye.<verse eid="JHN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Ɔlua Nana Nyamenle ɔdaye ye tumi zo, meyɛ nwanwane gyima dɔɔnwo meva meboa menli; na akee nuhua ne boni ati a ɔlua zo bɛku me a?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Bɛbuale ye kɛ, “Tɛ gyima kpalɛ ne mɔɔ wɔyɛ la ati a amaa yɛku wɔ a, na wɔ munzudwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ ɛka ye wɔ Nyamenle anwo la ati ɔ. Ɛle sonla ala, noko ɛse ɛle Nyamenle.” <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34-36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34-36" />Ɔbuale bɛ kɛ, “Na bɛtɛkɛlɛle ye wɔ bɛ Mɛla ne anu kɛ, mevɛlɛ bɛ muala awozonle ɔ? Ɔti saa Ngɛlɛlera ne mɔɔ ɛngakyi ɛlɛ la se kɛ menli mɔɔ Nyamenle edwɛkɛ ne rale bɛ ɛkɛ la le nyamenle anzɛɛ awozonle a, ɛnee akee fane nyɛ yɛɛ saa ahenle ne mɔɔ Selɛ ne ɛde ɔ nwo na yezoa ye wɔ ewiade anu la se kɛ, ‘Mele Nyamenle Ra’ a, ɛnee bɛse yebɔ munzule ɛ? <verse eid="JHN 10:34-36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Saa tɛ Egya gyima ne a melɛyɛ la a, ɛnee ɔngyia bɔbɔ kɛ bɛkɛlie me bɛkɛli. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Na saa yemɔ a melɛyɛ la a, ɛnee yemɔ saa bɛkpo kɛ bɛnrɛlie me bɛnrɛli bɔbɔ a, ɛnee bɛlie nwanwanedeɛ ne mɔɔ meyɛ la bɛli na bɛbanwu ye nɔhalɛ kɛ, Egya de me nu, yɛɛ medame noko mede ye nu.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Eza bɛbɔle ɔ bo kɛ bɛpe adenle bie anu bɛahye ye bieko, na ɔwolole bɛ sa abo ɔhɔle <verse eid="JHN 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Azule Dwɔdan ne anzi lɔ ɔhɔdɛnlanle ɛleka mɔɔ mekɛ ne anu Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne dɛnlanle zɔnenle menli la. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Na menli dɔɔnwo doale ye wɔ ɛkɛ ne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 10:41">Bɛzele bɛ nwo ngoko ngoko kɛ, “Dwɔn anyɛ nwanwanendeɛ biala, noko mɔɔ ɔhanle ye wɔ nrenyia ɛhye anwo la amuala le nɔhalɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Ɔti akee dɔɔnwo ne ala liele lile kɛ yemɔ a amgba ɔle Sonla Ra ne a.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Lazalɛse ɛwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1-2" />Wɔ Bɛtani, ɛnee nrenyia bie mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Lazalɛse la ɛnde kpɔkɛ. Ɔ mediema mraalɛ a le Male, mɔɔ mekɛ bie ɔwolale anatele evuanlɛ ɔguale Gyisɛse agyakɛ anwo na ɔvale ɔ ti enrinli ɔkyikyile la, ɔ nee Maata. <verse eid="JHN 11:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Ɔti mediema mraalɛ nwiɔ ne dole Gyisɛse nrɛlaleɛ kɛ, “Awulae, wɔ kulovolɛ ne ɛnde kpɔkɛ fee zɛhae.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Na mɔɔ Gyisɛse dele nrɛlaleɛ ne la, ɔzele kɛ, “Tɛ anwonyane ɛhye a bahu ye a, na ɔlua Nana Nyamenle anyunlunyia ti ɔ. Ɔlua ɛhye azo a mame, Sonla Ra ne mebanyia anyunlunyia a.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Gyisɛse lɛ Maata, Male, ɔ nee Lazalɛse anwo ɛhulolɛ totohyia ɛdeɛ, noko ɔdele Lazalɛse anwonyane ne la, <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />ɔlile kenle nwiɔ bieko, kolaa na yeadu ɔ bo kɛ ɔkɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Mɔɔ kenle nwiɔ ne pɛle nu la, ɔzele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Bɛmaa yɛhɔ Dwudiya bieko.”<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ zele ye kɛ, “Kilehilevolɛ, ɔtɛkyɛle biala yɛɛ Dwuuma mgbanyima mɔɔ wɔ Dwudiya la vale ɛ nwo akpame kɛ bɛku wɔ a. Na eza ɛkɔ ɛkɛ ne bieko ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Asoo tɛ dɔnehwele bulu nee nwiɔ a wɔ alehyenlɛ ko biala anu ɔ? Saa ɔle zɔhane ɛdeɛ a ɛnee yemɔ awie biala ɛnle ɛkɛ ne mɔɔ ɔtia alehyenlɛ nu a, ɔ gyakɛ bakpula a, ɔluakɛ alehyenlɛ le wienyi. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Na saa aledwolɛ ba na sonla tia a ɔkpula, ɔluakɛ maanle nu le awozinli.”<verse eid="JHN 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Akee ɔzele kɛ, “Nafelɛ ɛva yɛ gɔnwo Lazalɛse, ɔti mebahɔ meahɔdunwue ye!”<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12-13" />Ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ dwenlenle kɛ nafelɛ ala a ɛva ye a; ɔti bɛzele kɛ, “Awulae, saa yela ɛdeɛ a ɛnee ɔbadwazo.” Noko ɛnee ye ewule edwɛkɛ a Gyisɛse ɛlɛka a, na bɛmɛ bɛdwenlenle kɛ nafelɛ ala a yelafe a.<verse eid="JHN 11:12-13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Akee ɔhanle ye nɔhalɛ wienyi ɔhilele bɛ kɛ, “Lazalɛse ɛwu. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Na ɔlua bɛmɛ ti ɔye me fɛ kɛ ɛnee menle ɛkɛ a, ɔluakɛ ɛhye bamaa bɛalie me bɛali bieko wɔ mɔɔ bazi la anwo. Bɛrɛla, bɛraze bɛmaa yɛhɔ ɔ nwo lɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Akee Tɔmase, mɔɔ eza noko bɛfɛlɛ ye “Daedimɔso,” anzɛɛ “Ndabia” la zele ɔ gɔnwo mɔ ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Bɛmaa yɛ muala yɛ nee ye ɛhɔ yɛhɔwu ɛ!”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Mɔɔ bɛdwule Bɛtani la, Gyisɛse nwunle kɛ bɛzie Lazalɛse yeli kenle nna kpalɛ wɔ ye nla nu. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Ɔvi Bɛtani mɔɔ kɔ Gyɛlusalɛm la le kɛyɛ mayɛlɛ nwiɔ ala. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Ɔti ɛnee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ dɔɔnwo ɛhɔ ɛkɛ kɛ, bɛkayɛ ye ɛzɛne na eza bɛayɛ Maata nee Male noko gyakɔ, wɔ bɛ diema ne mɔɔ ɛvi nu la anwo.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Mɔɔ Maata dele kɛ Gyisɛse ɛlɛba la, ɔhɔle kɛ ɔkayia ye adenle. Na Male yemɔ ɔhale sua nu.<verse eid="JHN 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Maata zele Gyisɛse kɛ, “Awulae, saa ɛwɔ ɛke a, anrɛɛ me diema nrenyia ne anwu; <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />yɛɛ kɛkala bɔbɔ meze kɛ ɔtɛkpale nwo, ɔluakɛ melɛ diedi kɛ, saa ɛsɛlɛ Nana Nyamenle ye moalɛ a, ɔbadwazo me diema ne yeara ngoane nu bieko.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Ɛ diema nrenyia ne bara ngoane nu bieko.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Maata buale ye kɛ, “Ɛhɛe, meze kɛ wɔ Ewuledwazolɛ Kenle ne ɔdaye noko ɔbadwazo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Mame a le Ewuledwazolɛ nee ngoane ne a. Awie biala mɔɔ die me di la, saa bɔbɔ yewu a ɔbadɛnla aze. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Na awie biala noko mɔɔ de aze na ɔdie me ɔdi la ɔnrɛwu ɛlɛ. Asoo ɛdie ɛhye ɛdi ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Maata buale ye kɛ, “Ɛhɛe, Awulae, medie medi kɛ wɔmɔ a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne, Nyamenle Ra ne mɔɔ yɛhendɛ ye dedee la a.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Akee Maata gyakyile ye ɔhɔle Male anwo lɔ ɔhɔdule ye azukue kɛ, “Kilehilevolɛ ne ɛra, na ɔkpondɛ wɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Ɛkɛ ne ala, Male dwazole foa kɛ ɔkanwu ye.<verse eid="JHN 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse ɛdwazo Lazalɛse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Ɛnee Gyisɛse tɛbɔ sua ti lɔ wɔ ɛleka mɔɔ Maata yiale ye la. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Mekɛ mɔɔ Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛlɛkyekye Male arɛle la nwunle kɛ yedwazo ɔlɛkɔ arɛlevilɛ nu la, bɛdwenlenle kɛ ɔkɔ Lazalɛse sɛka ne azo yeahɔzu; ɔti bɛdoale ye.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Mɔɔ Male dwule ɛleka mɔɔ Gyisɛse wɔ la, ɔhotole ɔ gyakɛ abo, na ɔzele kɛ, “Awulae, saa mekɛ ne anu ɛnee ɛwɔ ɛke a, anrɛɛ me diema nrenyia ne anwu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Na mɔɔ Gyisɛse nwunle kɛ ɔlesu na Dwuuma ne noko ɛlɛsu abodo ye la, alɔbɔlɛ hanle ye totohyia. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Nienwu a bɛziele ye a?” Bɛzele ye kɛ, “Awulae, bɛla na banlea.” <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Na Gyisɛse zunle.<verse eid="JHN 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Dwuuma ne mɔ zele kɛ, “Bɛ agɔnwole ne anu mia kpalɛ o! Nea kɛ ɔsi mɔɔ ɔlɛdi nyane bie a!”<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37-38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37-38" />Bie mɔ noko zele kɛ, “Nrenyia ɛhye yɛle anyezinliravolɛ ayile, na duzu ati a yeangola yeanlie Lazalɛse noko ngoane ɛ?” Eza alɔbɔlɛ kpole hanle Gyisɛse bieko. Akee bɛrale funli kuma ne anwo; bɛpɛ ye wɔ bolɛ nu na bɛva bolɛ kpole ko bɛnyi ɔ nloa.<verse eid="JHN 11:37-38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛhundo bolɛ ne bɛdo ye ahanle.” Na Maata, mɔɔ ɔ diema nrenyia a ɛwu la zele ye kɛ, “Awulae, kɛkala mɔ yezɛkye bɔkɔɔ; yɛnrɛhola ɛke gyinla, ɔluakɛ ɔwule la ɛnɛ le kenle nna.”<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Meanze wɔ kɛ saa ɛdie ɛdi a ɛbanwu Nana Nyamenle nwanwane tumi ne ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Ɔti akee bɛzuhunle bolɛ ne bɛdole ye ahanle. Akee Gyisɛse dole ɔ nye anwomanyunlu na ɔzele kɛ, “Egya, meyɛ wɔ mo kɛ wɔdie me a. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Meze kɛ ɛtie me dahuu, na ɔlua menli mɔɔ ɛbɔ ɛyia ɛke la ati a maanle menganle bɔbɔ a, amaa ɔlua zo bɛalie bɛali kɛ amgba wɔmɔ a ɛzoanle me a.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Akee ɔdeanle nu ɔzele kɛ, “Lazalɛse, dwazo!”<verse eid="JHN 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Amgba noko Lazalɛse dwazole. Ɛnee ɔtɛwula ye funli tɛladeɛ ne na ɛdanlɛ heda ɔ nyunlu amuala. Akee Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛyeye ɔ nwo azieleɛ ninyɛne ne mɔ na bɛmaa ɔhɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Ɔlua ɛhye azo akee Dwuuma dɔɔnwo mɔɔ nee Male hɔle ɛkɛ, na bɛnwunle mɔɔ ɛzi la nzinlii liele ye lile. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Na bɛ nuhua bie mɔ noko hɔle hɔhanle hilele Falasiima ne mɔ.<verse eid="JHN 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Akee azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ nee Falasiima ne mɔ hɔle agyinla kɛ bɛkazuzu deɛ mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ bɛfa bɛyɛ ye la anwo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:47">Bɛbizebizale bɛ nwo ngoko ngoko kɛ, “Duzu a yɛkɛyɛ a? Nrenyia ye ɛlɛyɛ nwanwanendeɛ molozo somaa. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Saa yɛgyakyi ye a maanle ye anu amra amuala badoa ye. Na ɔba ye zɔhane noko a, Wulomu Arane ne nee ye azogya bara na bɛarahu yɛ bɛazɛkye yɛ maanle ne.”<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Na bɛ nuhua ko, mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Kayafase, mɔɔ yemɔ a le Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli wɔ mekɛ zɔhane anu la, zele kɛ, “Ɔyɛ me kɛ bɛngola bɛnnwu ninyɛne mɔɔ ɛlɛkɔ zo la fee zɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Anzɛɛ bɛnlie bɛnli kɛ ɔle kpalɛ kɛ sonla kokye kɛwu kɛlie menli dɔɔnwo ngoane tɛla kɛ maanle totohyia ko kɛbɔ tɔɔ ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 11:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Kapezo edwɛkɛ ɛhye mɔɔ Kayafase hanle kɛ, ɔwɔ kɛ Gyisɛse wu maa maanle ne amuala la, le edwɛkɛ mɔɔ yeanga ye gyɛne a, ɔlua ye Sɛlɛvolɛ kpanyinli gyinlabelɛ ne mɔɔ ɛnee ɔlɛ ye mekɛ ne anu la ati a maanle ɔbɔle zɔhane munzule ne a. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Ɔle yekile mɔɔ fale Gyisɛse ewule ne mɔɔ ɔbawu yealie Nyamenle amra mɔɔ ɛkponde aleɛabo amuala na yeaha bɛ yeabɔ nu la anwo a. Ɔkile kɛ Gyisɛse anwu ammaa Yizilayɛma angomekye. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Ɔti ɔvi zɔhane mekɛ ne Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ bɔle ɔ bo kɛ bɛfa Gyisɛse ɛhunlɛ nwo akpame.<verse eid="JHN 11:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Ɔvi mekɛ ɛhye anu, akee Gyisɛse gyakyile ye bagua nu gyimayɛlɛ ne na ɔvile Gyɛlusalɛm; ɔhɔle ɛsɛlɛ ne ati lɔ wɔ Yifelaem namule ne azo, na ɛkɛ ne a ɔ nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bɛdɛnlanle a.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Ɛnee Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia ne ɛbikye, ɔti menli dɔɔnwo vi namunamu ne mɔ anu rale Gyɛlusalɛm ndɛndɛ zo, kɛ bɛbakpa bɛ nwo munzule kolaa na Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia ne abɔ ɔ bo. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Ɛnee biala kulo kɛ ɔnwu Gyisɛse. Ɔti mɔɔ bɛwɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu la, ɛnee bɛlɛbizebiza bɛ nwo kɛ, “Kɛ ɔde ɛ? Asoo ɔbara yearali Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia ne bie ɔ?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Zɛhae mekɛ ye, ɛnee azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ nee Falasiima ne mɔ ɛbɔ ye nolo kɛ, awie biala mɔɔ kɛnwu Gyisɛse la, ɔmaa bɛ nzo ɛde ye ndɛndɛ amaa bɛahye ye.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Me nee bɛ ɛnrɛdɛnla ɛnrɛhyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Ɔhale kenle nsia na bɛabɔ Akpabɛnwo Ɛvoyialilɛ ne abo la, Gyisɛse hɔle Bɛtani; ɛkɛ ne a ɔdwazole Lazalɛse mɔɔ wule la ɔvile ewule nu a. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Na bɛdole ɛkponle bɛmaanle Gyisɛse. Maata a hyɛle aleɛ ne a, yɛɛ Lazalɛse noko nee ye a kpulale bɛ sa a. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Akee Male vale anatele evuanlɛ bie mɔɔ bɛtɛtule zo la ɔradule ɔ muala ɔguale Gyisɛse agyakɛ azo na ɔvale ɔ ti enrinli ɔkyikyile ye bɔkɔɔ. Ɛhye maanle sua ne anu bɔnle evuanlɛ mukuu zɛhae.<verse eid="JHN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Na Dwudase Yesekaleɔto, ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ko, nuhua ne mɔɔ baye ye amaa la, zele kɛ, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Duzu ati a bɛandɔne anatele evuanlɛ ɛhye bɛanlie menli ɛya nsa kenle ko ahatualɛ na bɛanva bɛammaa ehyiavolɛma a?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Tɛ mɔɔ asɛɛ ehyiavolɛma anwo hyia ye la ati a maa ɔhanle ɛhye a; na ɔle awule; yemɔ yɛɛ ɔnea ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ezukoa zo a, na mekɛ dɔɔnwo ne ala ɔwua bie ɔyɛ ɔ nwo boɛ.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Gyisɛse buale ye kɛ, “Bɛgyakyi ye, ɔluakɛ yeyɛ ɛhye yezie me azieleɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Bɛkola bɛboa ehyiavolɛma melɛ biala, na mame noko me nee bɛ ɛnde dahuu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Mɔɔ Gyɛlusalɛm amra ne dele kɛ yera la, bɛdule twi bɛrale kɛ bɛbanlea ye, na eza noko bɛanlea Lazalɛse, nrenyia ne mɔɔ ɔdwazole ye ɔvile ewule nu la. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ yɛle bɛ adwenle kɛ bɛku Lazalɛse ɔdaye noko, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />ɔluakɛ, ɔlua yemɔ ɔ nwo zo a ɛmaa Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ dɔɔnwo liele Gyisɛse lile kɛ yemɔ a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne la.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛyɛ Gyisɛse akoaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Aleɛ hyenle la, Gyisɛse Gyɛlusalɛm ɛhɔlɛ ne anwo adawu zandele sua ne azo amuala, <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />na nyɛvolɛ dɔɔnwo mɔɔ rale Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia ne abo la vale arɛlɛ mrɛlakɛ hɔyiale ye, na bɛvale fɛlɛko bɛdeɛdeanle nu bɛbɔle osee-yie bɛzele kɛ: “Nyilalɛ ɛha mɔɔ ɔlua Awulae duma nu ɔlɛba la.”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Ɛnee ɛkpɔnwɔ ralɛ nwo zo a Gyisɛse de a, amaa kapezo edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ se: <verse eid="JHN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Yizilayɛma, bɛmmasulo, ɔluakɛ bɛ Belemgbunli ne le mɛlɛbɛnwoaze sonla mɔɔ ɛkpɔnwɔ ralɛ ala a ɔde zo a” la ali munli.<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ande ɛhye abo alumua ne, na nzinlii mɔɔ bɛwulale Gyisɛse anyunlunyia la, yɛɛ akee bɛhakyele kɛ bɛhɛlɛle ɛhye mɔ wɔ ɔ nwo na bɛyɛ bɛmaa ye a.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ ɛnee bɛwɔ ɛkɛ ne, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔdunwuele Lazalɛse ɔvile ewule nu la, hanle nwolɛ edwɛkɛ hilele bɛ gɔnwo mɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Na ɛhye ala ati noko a menli dɔɔnwo ne ala hɔle hɔyiale ye a, ɔluakɛ ɛnee zɛhae nwanwanedeɛ ne anwo edwɛkɛ ɛkpudwu totohyia.<verse eid="JHN 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Akee Falasiima ne mɔ zele bɛ nwo ngoko ngoko kɛ, “Ayi mɔ, bɛnlea kɛ yɛvɛ mgbane a; akee yɛngola yɛnyɛ ɛhwee bieko. Ewiade amuala ɛdu ɛdoa ye!”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Bie mɔ noko mɔɔ ɛnee bɛra Gyɛlusalɛm kɛ bɛbali Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia ne bie la, <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />hɔle Felepe mɔɔ vi Bɛteseeyeda la anwo ɛkɛ, na bɛzele ye kɛ, “Yɛmenle, yɛkulo kɛ yɛkɛnwu Gyisɛse.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Felepe noko bɔle Andelu amaneɛ, na akee bɛ mu nwiɔ bɛhɔhanle bɛhilele Gyisɛse.<verse eid="JHN 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23-24" />Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Mekɛ ne mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ Sonla Ra ne kɔ ye anyunlunyia nu wɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu la akee ɛdwu zo.” Eza ɔvale ɔzɔle zo kɛ, “Kɛmɔ abɛlɛ ma ko tɔ aze a yɛɛ ɔso la, zɔhane ala yɛɛ ɔwɔ kɛ metɔ aze a. Na ɔlua me ɛwulɛ ne azo yɛɛ ndwoba dɔɔnwo akee bara ɛya ne anu a.<verse eid="JHN 12:23-24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />“Mɔɔ kpondɛ ye ngoane wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo la baminli ye; na mɔɔ kɛminli ye ngoane wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo la, yemɔ a banyia ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ a.<verse eid="JHN 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />“Saa awie biala kulo kɛ ɔyɛ me ɛdoavolɛ a, ɛleka biala mɔɔ mewɔ la ɔbali me nzi, ɔluakɛ ɛleka mɔɔ mewɔ la, ɛkɛ ne a ɔwɔ kɛ me ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ noko boa a. Na saa bɛtoa me noko a yemɔ Selɛ ne bawula bɛ anyunlunyia. <verse eid="JHN 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />Kɛkala mɔ akee me ɛkɛla ɛlɛdi nyane kpole. Duzu edwɛkɛ a menga a? ‘Egya, die me fi munzule mɔɔ ɛlɛba me nwo zo la anu.’ Na ɔlua ɛhye noko ati a membale a. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Egya, kile wɔ tumi ɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Akee ɛnelɛ bie vi anwuma maanle ne anu zele kɛ, “Meye ɛhye dɛbadɛba, eza noko mebaye ye bieko.” <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Mɔɔ menli ɛwolaa ne dele ɛnelɛ ne la, bɛ nuhua bie mɔ dwenlenle kɛ ezule ɛhululɛ ɔ, yɛɛ bie mɔ noko zele kɛ anwumabɔvolɛ a dendɛle hilele ye a. <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Akee Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Ɔlua bɛ ti a ɛnelɛ ye rale a, na tɛ mame ti ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Mekɛ mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ bɛfa bɛbua ewiade amra ndɛne la ɛdwu, na mekɛ ɛhye anu yɛɛ bɛbalie Abɔnsam mɔɔ le ewiade anu belemgbunli ne la tumi bɛavi ɔ sa nu a. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Na mame mɔ saa bɛbɔ me meanubaka nu a, mebahwe ewiade amra amuala meabeta me nwo.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Ɔhanle ɛhye ɔvale ɔhilele ewule holɛ ko mɔɔ ɔbawu la.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Menli dɔɔnwo ne bizale ye kɛ, “Yɛmɛ yɛde yɛvi mɛla ne anu kɛ Sonla Ra ne ɛnrɛwu ɛlɛ. Kɛ ɔsi mɔɔ akee ɛse bɛbabɔ ye meanubaka nu ɛ? Ɛnee Ngoanedievolɛ ne boni a wɔmɔ ɛlɛka ye edwɛkɛ a?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Gyisɛse buale kɛ, “Mekɛ ekyii bie ala yɛ ɛha mɔɔ bɛbanwu wienyi ne a. Kɛkala mɔɔ kɛnlaneɛ ne wɔ ɛkɛ la, bɛva bɛdia, ammaa awozinli anva bɛ aze. Ɔluakɛ awozinli ne ba a bɛnrɛnwu aze bieko. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Bɛlua wienyi ne anu wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔlɛta la, na bɛlie wienyi ne bɛli amaa bɛayɛ wienyi ne anu amra.” Gyisɛse hanle ɛhye mɔ wiele la, ɔvile ɛkɛ ɔhɔle, na bɛannwu ye bieko.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Wɔ ye nwanwanendeɛ ɛyɛlɛ ɛhye mɔ amuala anzi bɔbɔ, menli ne dɔɔnwo ne ala anlie ye anli kɛ yemɔ a le Sonla Ra ne a. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Ɛhye noko a le nɔhalɛ ne mɔɔ kapezonli Ayezaya hanle la, kɛ: “Awulae, nwane a balie ye ali a? Nwane a bali Nana Nyamenle nwanwanendeɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ yeyɛ la anwo daselɛ a?” <verse eid="JHN 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Noko akee bɛanlie bɛanli, kɛmɔ amgba Ayezaya edwɛkɛ ne ka ye bieko la. Ɔse: <verse eid="JHN 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Nana Nyamenle ɛzi bɛ nye na eza yeyɛ bɛ anyetelema ammaa bɛannwu debie, na eza bɛannyia ndelebɛbo ammaa bɛanzia bɛamba ɔ nwo kɛ ɔyɛ bɛ ayile.” <verse eid="JHN 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Gyisɛse anwo edwɛkɛ a ɛnee Ayezaya ɛlɛka la, ɔluakɛ ɛnee yenwu Sonla Ra ne anyunlunyia wɔ yekile nu.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ dɔɔnwo bɔbɔ liele ye lile ɛdeɛ kɛ, amgba yemɔ a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne a, noko bɛangulo kɛ bɛkɛha, ɔlua ɛzulolɛ mɔɔ bɛsulo kɛ Falasiima ne mɔ kɛye bɛ ali wɔ ayiasua ne anu la ati; <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />ɔboalekɛ bɛkulo menli nganvolɛ ɛdeɛ ne bɛtɛla Nana Nyamenle ɛdeɛ ne.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Gyisɛse deanle nu zele menli dɔɔnwo ne kɛ, “Mɔɔ die me di la ɛnlie me ngome ala ɛnli, na ɔdie Egya ne mɔɔ zoanle me la ɔdi. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Ɔluakɛ awie ko biala mɔɔ kɛnwu me la, ɛnee yenwu ahenle ne mɔɔ zoanle me la. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Mera ewiade anu kɛ Kɛnlaneɛ la, amaa awie biala mɔɔ kɛlie me kɛli la yeanga awozinli nu. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Saa awie biala tie me edwɛkɛ na yeanli zo a, membua ye ndɛne, ɔluakɛ meamba kɛ mebabua ewiade amra ndɛne, membale kɛ mebalie bɛ ngoane. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Emomu bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkpo me nee me edwɛkɛ ne la lɛ bɛ nwo zo ndɛnebuavolɛ; edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ meha mehile bɛ la a bayɛ bɛ ndɛnebuavolɛ wɔ Awieleɛ Kenle ne anu a. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Ɔluakɛ tɛ medame me tumi a menvale menganle edwɛkɛ ne a, na Egya ne mɔɔ zoanle me la mumua ne yɛɛ ahilele me mɔɔ menga ɔ nee mɔɔ menyɛ la a. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Eza meze kɛ ye edwɛkɛ ne maa ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ; ɔti mɔɔ ɔkɛze me biala la meka!”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse wowole ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ agyakɛ anwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1-3" />Wɔ Akpabɛnwo Kenle ne nɔsolɛ nu, Gyisɛse nwunle kɛ ye melɛ ɛdwu mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ ɔfa ɔkɔ ɔ Ze anwo a. Mɔɔ bɛdi aleɛ la ɛnee Abɔnsam ɛmaa Saemɔn ara, Dwudase Yesekaleɔto adwenle kɛ kenle ko ne nɔe ne a ɔwɔ kɛ ɔye Gyisɛse ɔmaa a. Ɛnee Gyisɛse noko ze kɛ Selɛ ne ɛva ninyɛne muala ɛwula ɔdaye Gyisɛse ɔ sa nu, yɛɛ ɔvi Nana Nyamenle ɛkɛ a ɔrale a, na Nana Nyamenle anwo lɔ noko a eza ɔbazia yeahɔ a. <verse eid="JHN 13:1-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Ɔti ɔvi aleɛ ɛkponle ne anwo ɔdwazole, na ɔyele ye tɛladeɛ ne mɔɔ gua zolɛ la, ɔvale tohulu ɔpɛle ɔ bo. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Akee ɔwolale nzule ɔguale kyɛnze kpole bie anu, na ɔbɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔwowo ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ agyakɛ anwo, na ɔfa ye tohulu ne mɔɔ pɛ ɔ bo la ɔkyikyi nwolɛ.<verse eid="JHN 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Ɔdwule Saemɔn Pita anwo zo la, Pita zele ye kɛ, “Awulae, ɔnle kɛ wɔmɔ a ɛwowo yɛ gyakɛ anwo a.”<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Gyisɛse buale kɛ, “Ɛnrɛde deɛmɔti melɛyɛ ɛhye la abo kɛkala, na kenlebie ɛbade ɔ bo.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Pita kpole ɛhye na ɔzele kɛ, “Kyɛkyɛ, mame mɔ, menwɔmaa ɛnrɛwowo me gyakɛ anwo ɛlɛ!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Gyisɛse noko buale ye kɛ, “Na saa wɔammaa meanwowo noko a, ɛnee ɔkile kɛ ɛnrɛhola ɛnrɛyɛ me ɛdoavolɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Saemɔn Pita deanle nu zele kɛ, “Saa zɔhane ɛdeɛ a, ɛnee wowo me sa anwo nee me ti zo, na tɛ me gyakɛ anwo angome ɔ!”<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Gyisɛse buale kɛ, “Sonla mɔɔ ɛbia la yemɔ ɔ gyakɛ anwo ala a ɔhyia kɛ bɛkɛwowo a. Kɛkala yemɔ bɛ nwo le bɔkɔbɔkɔ, na emomu tɛ bɛ muala ɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Ɔluakɛ ɛnee Gyisɛse ze mɔɔ baye ye amaa a. Zɔhane ati a ɔzele kɛ, “Tɛ bɛ muala a bɛ nwo te bɔkɔɔ a” la.<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Ɔwowole bɛ gyakɛ anwo ɔwiele la, ɔwulale ye anwuma tɛladeɛ ne ɔguale zo, na mɔɔ ɔdɛnlanle aze la, ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Asoo bɛte ɛhye mɔɔ menyɛle la abo ɔ? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Bɛmɛ bɛfɛlɛ me ‘Yɛmenle’ nee ‘Awulae,’ na ɔle zɔ noko. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Saa mame mɔɔ mele Awulae nee Kilehilevolɛ la mewowo bɛ gyakɛ anwo a, ɛnee ɔwɔ kɛ bɛ nuhua ko biala kola wowo ɔ gɔnwo agyakɛ anwo. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Meyɛ ɛhye meva meyɛ ndonwo memaa bɛ; ɔti bɛyɛ kɛmɔ meyɛ memaa bɛ la. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Akɛlɛ biala ɛndɛla ɔ menle. Yɛɛ soavolɛ noko ɛndɛla ahenle ne mɔɔ zoanle ye la. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Bɛze zɛhae ninyɛne ne mɔ, ɛhye ati bɛyɛ; ɔluakɛ ɛhye a le nyilalɛ adenle ne a.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Tɛ bɛ muala a melɛka ɛhye meahile bɛ a; meze bɛ nuhua ko biala ati anu. Ngɛlɛlera ne se kɛ, ‘Ahenle ne mɔɔ me nee ye to ɛsalɛ ɛyɛba ko anu la, yemɔ a baye me amaa a,’ na ɛhye ɛnrɛhyɛ biala na ayɛ nɔhalɛ noko. <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Meka meahile bɛ kɛkala amaa saa ɔdwu zo a bɛalie me bɛ ali.<verse eid="JHN 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />“Nɔhalɛ nu kɛ, awie biala mɔɔ kɛlie me noko la ɛnee yelie Selɛ ne mɔɔ zoanle me la.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛ nuhua ko baye me amaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Ɛnee akee Gyisɛse ɛlɛdi nyane kpole wɔ ye ahonle nu; ɔti ɔdeanle nu ɔzele kɛ, “Nɔhalɛ nu, bɛ nuhua ɛko baye me amaa!” <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Ɛhye zinle ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anwo, na ɔmaanle bɛnleɛnleanle bɛ nyunlu ngoko ngoko bɛzele kɛ, “Ɛnee ahenle a le nwane?” <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Yemɔti Saemɔn Pita zele ɛdoavolɛma ne anu mɔɔ Gyisɛse kulo ye na ɔde ɔ nwo ɛkɛ la kɛ, <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />“Kile yɛ ahenle ne mɔɔ ɔlɛka ɔ nwo edwɛkɛ la.”<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Ɔti ahenle ne mɔɔ de bikye Gyisɛse la bizale ye kɛ, “Awulae, ɛnee nwane ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Gyisɛse zele kɛ, “Ahenle ne mɔɔ mebava aleɛ ne meamaa ye la, ɛnee yemɔ ɔ.” Zɔhane ati ɔvale ɔmaanle Dwudase, mɔɔ le Saemɔn Yesekaleɔto ara ne la.<verse eid="JHN 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Dwudase lile aleɛ ne wiele ala pɛ, yɛɛ Abɔnsam rawolole ye nu a. Akee Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Mɔɔ ɛkpondɛ kɛ ɛyɛ la, yɛ ye ndɛndɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ mɔɔ gua ɛkponle ne anwo la biala ande mɔɔ Gyisɛse hanle la abo. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Na kɛmɔ Dwudase a asie bɛ ezukoa ne la ati, bɛdwenlenle kɛ bie a ɛnee Gyisɛse ɛlese ye kɛ, ɔhɔdua aleɛ ne kakɛ anzɛɛ ɔva bie ɔhɔhyɛ ehyiavolɛma. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Zɔhane ati ɔvindele ndɛndɛ ne ala ɔhɔle alie nwo; na ɛnee aleɛ ɛdwo.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Mɔɔ Dwudase vile sua ne anu la, Gyisɛse hanle kɛ, “Akee Sonla Ra ne anyunlunyia ne ɛla ali; na ɔlua ɔ nwo zo yɛɛ Nyamenle anyunlunyia kpole ne noko ɛla ali a. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Na ɔnrɛhyɛ biala, Nana Nyamenle bava ɔdaye ye anyunlunyia ne yeamaa me. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Me mra, yeha mekɛ ekyii bie ɛnee mevi bɛ nu! Na emomu, mɔɔ menzele Dwuuma ne mɔ la a mese bɛdabɛ noko a, bɛbakpondɛ me, noko bɛnrɛhola ɛleka mɔɔ mewɔ la ba.<verse eid="JHN 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />“Ɛhye ati memaa bɛ mɛla fofolɛ. Bɛhulo bɛ nwo ngoko ngoko kɛmɔ mehulo bɛ la. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Ɛhye a bamaa ewiade amra anwu kɛ bɛle me ɛdoavolɛma a.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Saemɔn Pita bizale ye kɛ, “Awulae, ɛnee nienwu a ɛbahɔ a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Gyisɛse buale ye kɛ, “Ɛnrɛhola ɛ nee me ɛnrɛhɔ kɛkala; na amozi ye yɛɛ ɛbadoa me a.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Pita bizale ye kɛ, “Na duzu ati a menrɛhola wɔ toa kɛkala ɛ? Meboa me nwo kɛ menwɔva me ngoane menwɔdo ɛkɛ menwɔmaa wɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Gyisɛse buale zele kɛ, “Asoo ɛkɛhola ɛkɛva wɔ ngoane ɛkɛdo ɛkɛ ɛkɛmaa me ɔ? Kyɛkyɛ, nɔhalɛ, too mɔɔ akɔlɛ kabɔ la ɛnee wɔkpo me fane nsa kɛ ɛnze me fee!”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />“Bɛmmamaa bɛ ahonle tu. Kɛmɔ bɛdie Nana Nyamenle bɛdi la, zɔhane ala yɛɛ bɛlie medame noko bɛli a. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2-3" />Egya sua zo, tɛnlabelɛ dɔɔnwo wɔ ɛkɛ, na saa ɔnle zɔ a, anrɛɛ meha mehile bɛ. Mekɔ meahɔziezie ɛleka meamaa bɛ. Saa mewie a mebara bieko na mearava bɛ, amaa bɛaradɛnla ɛleka mɔɔ mewɔ la. <verse eid="JHN 14:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Bɛze ɛleka mɔɔ melɛkɔ, nee adenle ne mɔɔ bɛdua nu bɛkɔ ɛkɛ ne la noko.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tɔmase zele ye kɛ, “Kyɛkyɛ, Awulae, yɛnze ɛleka mɔɔ ɛlɛkɔ a, na kɛ ɔkɛyɛ na yɛanwu ye adenle ne ɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Nɔhalɛ nu, mame a le Adenle ne, nee Nɔhalɛ ne nee Ngoane ne a. Awie biala ɛngola ɛngoati me ɛngɔ Egya anwo lɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Saa bɛze me ɛdeɛ a, ɛnee noko bɛze Egya. Ɔvi ɛnɛ mɔɔ kɔ la bɛze ye, yɛɛ eza noko bɛnwu ye!”<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Felepe zele kɛ, “Awulae, wɔmɔ kile yɛ Egya ne ala, na yɛ kunlu kɛdwo.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Gyisɛse buale kɛ, “Felepe, ɔti me nee bɛ de ɛke mekɛ tendenle ɛhye amuala anzi ye, ɛtɛnwunle me sonla holɛ? Awie biala mɔɔ ɛnwu me la ɛnwu Egya noko. Na duzu ati a akee ɛse mengile wɔ Egya ne a? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Anzɛɛ ɛnlie ɛnli kɛ mede Egya ne nu, yɛɛ Egya ne noko de me nu ɔ? Tɛ me ti anwo tumi a mefa meka edwɛkɛ a, na Egya ne mɔɔ de me nu la tumi ɔ. Mame noko yɛɛ ɔdua me nwo zo ɔyɛ ye gyima ne a. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Ɛhye ati bɛlie me bɛli kɛ mede ye nu, yɛɛ ɔdaye noko Ɔde me nu. Na saa tɛ ye zɔhane bɔbɔ a, ɛnee bɛva bɛ nye bɛdo nwanwane ninyɛne mgbole ne mɔɔ bɛnwu kɛ meyɛ la na bɛlie me bɛli.<verse eid="JHN 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12-13" />“Nɔhalɛ nu meka meahile bɛ kɛ, awie biala mɔɔ kɛlie me kɛli la ɔbayɛ nwanwane gyima ne mɔɔ meyɛ la bie, na ɔbayɛ mɔɔ yɛ nwanwane tɛla bɛ bɔbɔ a, ɔluakɛ melɛkɔ Egya ne anwo lɔ. Debie biala mɔɔ bɛkɛbiza ye wɔ me duma nu la, mebayɛ meamaa bɛ, ɔluakɛ ɛhye bawula Egya ne anyunlunyia wɔ deɛ mɔɔ mame, Sonla Ra ne mebayɛ meamaa bɛ la ati. <verse eid="JHN 14:12-13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Bɛlua me duma nu bɛbiza, na mebayɛ meamaa bɛ!<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne maleɛ ɛwɔkɛbɔlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15-16" />“Saa bɛkulo me a, ɛnee bɛli me mɛla ne mɔ azo; na mebazɛlɛ Egya amaa yeamaa bɛ Arɛlekyekyevolɛ fofolɛ, mɔɔ yemɔ ɔnrɛgyakyi bɛ ngome ɛlɛ a. <verse eid="JHN 14:15-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Yemɔ a le nɔhalɛ Sunsum ne mɔɔ ewiade ne ɛnrɛhola nee ye ɛnrɛdɛnla la, ɔluakɛ ɔngola ɔnnwu ye yɛɛ ɔnze ye, na bɛmɛ bɛze ye, ɔboalekɛ ɔ nee bɛ a de a, yɛɛ ɔde bɛ nu noko. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Menrɛgyakyi bɛ nrisa ɛlɛ. Mebazia meara bɛ nwo ɛkɛ ne bieko. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Yeha ekyii ɛnee ewiade ɛnnwu me bieko, na bɛmɛ bɛbanwu me dahuu. Kɛmɔ mede ngoane nu la ati, bɛdabɛ noko bɛbadɛnla ngoane nu. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Kenle ko zɔhane bɛbade ɔ bo kɛ, mede Egya nu yɛɛ bɛdabɛ noko bɛde me nu, yɛɛ medame noko mede bɛ nu. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Mɔɔ die me mɛla ne, na ɔdi zolɛ la a kulo me a, na kɛmɔ ɔkulo me noko la ati, me Ze bahulo ye; na medame noko meahulo ye, na meala me nwo ali meahile ye.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Dwudase, (tɛ Dwudase Yesekaleɔto ɔ), zele ye kɛ, “Awulae, ɛhye mɔ amuala abo a le duzu, mɔɔ ɔti ɛbala ɛ nwo ali wɔahile yɛ ngomekye na wɔagyakyi ewiade a?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Gyisɛse buale ye kɛ, “Awie biala mɔɔ ɔkulo me la ɔbali me mɛla ne azo, na Egya bahulo ye; na yɛbara yɛ nee ye aradɛnla. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛngulo me la ɛnli me mɛla ne mɔ azo. Na mɛla ne noko ɛnle me deɛ, na Egya ne mɔɔ zoanle me la deɛ ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Melɛka ɛhye mɔ meahile bɛ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ me nee bɛ tɛbɔ ɛke la. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Na saa Selɛ ne soa Arɛlekyekyevolɛ ne mɔɔ tɛ yemɔ a le me, mekile Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne mɔɔ barali me gyakɛ anu la a, ɔbahilehile bɛ ninyɛne dɔɔnwo, na eza noko yeahakyehakye bɛ wɔ mɔɔ medame meha mehile bɛ la anwo.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />“Anzondwolɛ a mefa meagyakyi bɛ a; medame me anzondwolɛ a mefa meamaa bɛ a; tɛ anzondwolɛ ne mɔɔ ewiade fa maa la a mefa meamaa bɛ a. Bɛmmamaa bɛ ahonle tu, eza noko mmamaa bɛsulo. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Bɛhakye mɔɔ menganle mengilele bɛ la: Melɛkɔ, noko eza mebara bɛ nwo ɛke bieko. Na saa bɛkulo me amgba a, ɛnee bɛbali fɛlɛko wɔ me nwo, ɔluakɛ kɛkala akee mekɔ Selɛ ne mɔɔ le kpole tɛla me la anwo lɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Melumua meha ɛhye mɔ mehile bɛ kolaa na bɛazi, amaa saa bɛsi a, bɛanwu nɔhalɛ ne na bɛalie me bɛali.<verse eid="JHN 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />“Menlɛ melɛ dɔɔnwo me nee bɛ ɛndendɛ bieko, ɔluakɛ ewiade ɛhye anu abɔnsam tumivolɛ ne ɛbikye. Ɔnlɛ tumi biala wɔ me nwo zo, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />noko kɛ ɔkɛyɛ na ewiade anwu kɛ amgba mekulo Selɛ ne la ati, mebayeye me ahonle nu meayɛ mɔɔ Selɛ ne kpondɛ kɛ meyɛ la. Bɛdwazo, bɛraze bɛmaa yɛhɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Nɔhalɛ nwanye tola ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Mame a le nɔhalɛ Nwanye Tola ne a, yɛɛ Egya noko a le Ɛyasovo ne a. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Ngane biala mɔɔ ɛnzo ma la ɔpepɛ bɛ ɔgua, na nuhua ne mɔɔ so ma noko la yemɔ ɔyeye nwolɛ amaa bɛazo dɔɔnwo kpalɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Yeyeye bɛ nwo dɛbadɛba yemaa bɛ anwosesebɛ ɔlua mɛla ne mɔɔ menvale memaanle bɛ la ati. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Bɛdɛnla me nu, na medame noko mendɛnla bɛ nu. Ɔluakɛ ngane biala te ɔ nwo fi baka ne anwo a, ɔngola ɔnzo, kyesɛ ɔbeta nwanye baka ne anwo. Zɔhane ala noko yɛɛ saa bɛkoati me a, bɛnrɛhola ma biala so a.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />“Nɔhalɛ nu, mame a le Nwanye Tola ne a; yɛɛ bɛmɛ noko a bɛle ye ngane ne mɔ a. Awie ko biala mɔɔ kɛdɛnla me nu, na medame noko menwɔdɛnla ye nu la ɔbazo ma dɔɔnwo. Ɔluakɛ saa bɛkoati me a bɛnrɛhola ɛhwee biala yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Awie biala mɔɔ kɛde ɔ nwo kɛvi me nwo la bɛpɛ ye bɛto, na ɔyɛ ɛyɛne bɛfa ye bɛkua senle. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Na saa bɛtɛnla me nu na bɛdi me mɛla zo a, yemɔ debie biala mɔɔ bɛkɛbiza me la, menwɔyɛ menwɔmaa bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Ɛdoavolɛ biala mɔɔ nɔhalɛ nu le me deɛ la so ma dɔɔnwo. Na ɛhye noko fa anyunlunyia kpole bɛlɛ Egya.<verse eid="JHN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />“Kɛmɔ Selɛ ne kulo me la, zɔhane ala a medame noko mekulo bɛ a; ɔti bɛdɛnla me ɛhulolɛ nu. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Saa bɛdi me mɛla zo a mebanyia bɛ nwo ɛhulolɛ dahuu, kɛmɔ medi Egya mɛla zo na ɔlɛme nwo ɛhulolɛ la. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Meha ɛhye mɔ mehile bɛ, amaa bɛali fɛlɛko ne mɔɔ melɛdi la bie, amaa bɛ fɛlɛkolilɛ ne ali munli. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Me mɛla ne ɛne: bɛhulo bɛ nwo ngoko ngoko kɛmɔ mehulo bɛ la. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Ɛhulolɛ biala ɛndɛla kɛ sonla kɛva ye ngoane kɛdo ɛkɛ kɛmaa ɔ gɔnwo mɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Na saa bɛdi me mɛla zo noko a, ɛnee bɛle me gɔnwo mɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Bɛnle me ngɛkɛlɛ bieko, ɔluakɛ menlelɛ ɛnga ɔ ti anu edwɛkɛ ɛngile ye ngɛkɛlɛ. Ɔti saa meha mɔɔ Egya hanle hilele me la amuala mehile bɛ ɛdeɛ a, ɛnee ɔkile kɛ bɛle me gɔnwo mɔ.<verse eid="JHN 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />“Tɛ bɛmɛ a bɛyele me a; na emomu mame a menyele bɛ a. Menyele bɛ amaa bɛazo ma kpalɛ dahuu, amaa saa bɛdua me duma nu bɛbiza Selɛ ne debie biala a yeava yeamaa bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Me mɛla mɔɔ mefa meamaa bɛ la ɛne. Bɛhulo bɛ nwo ngoko ngoko. <verse eid="JHN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />Bɛhakye kɛ saa ewiade kpɔ bɛ a, ɛnee bɛmmamaa ɔyɛ bɛ ɛzulolɛ, ɔluakɛ ɔlumuale ɔkpɔle me dɛba kolaa na yeakpɔ bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Saa bɛle ewiade amra a anrɛɛ ewiade bahulo bɛ edwɛkɛ, na ɔluakɛ meye bɛ mevi ewiade, na bɛnle ye deɛ bieko la ati, yemɔ a le bɛ anwubɛnyunlu. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Asoo bɛkakye mɔɔ menganle mengilele bɛ la ɔ? ‘Akɛlɛ ɛndɛla ɔ menle dibilɛ!’ Ɔti saa bɛhwi mame bɔbɔ me nyunlu a, ɛnee bɛnwu ye wienyi kɛ bɛbahwi bɛdabɛ noko bɛ nyunlu. Yɛɛ saa bɛdiele me noko a, anrɛɛ bɛbadie bɛdabɛ noko. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Aleɛabo amra bagyegye bɛ kɛmɔ bɛle me deɛ la ati, ɔluakɛ bɛnze ahenle ne mɔɔ zoanle me la.<verse eid="JHN 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />“Saa meamba meammanga edwɛkɛ ne meangile bɛ a, anrɛɛ bɛnli fɔlɛ. Na kɛkala ɛdeɛ, bɛngola bɛnza bɛ ne wɔ bɛ ɛtane ne mɔ anwo. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Awie biala mɔɔ kpɔ me la ɛnee ɔkpɔ Egya noko. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Saa meanyɛ nwanwane ninyɛne zɔhane mɔɔ awie biala ɛtɛyɛle bie ɛlɛ la wɔ bɛ nye zo a, anrɛɛ bɛnli fɔlɛ. Na kɛkala mɔ, yeamba ye zɔhane; ɔboalekɛ bɛnwu nwanwane gyima ne, noko akee bɛbu zo na bɛkpɔ me nee Egya ne. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Ɛhye noko ɛmaa mɔɔ ngapezoma ne mɔ hanle wɔ Sonla Ra ne anwo kɛ: ‘Bɛkpɔle me ɛkpɔlɛ gyɛne’ la ɛyɛ nɔhalɛ bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Na saa Arɛlekyekyevolɛ ne, mɔɔ le Nɔhalɛ Sunsum ne mɔɔ vi Egya nu mɔɔ mebazoa ye meavi Egya ne lɔ la ba a, ɔbali me nwo daselɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Bɛdabɛ noko bɛle me alasevolɛ, ɔluakɛ bɛ nee me a bɔle me gyimayɛlɛ ne abo a.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="s1">Nyane nee fɛlɛko tɛbɔ amozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Meha ɛhye mɔ amuala mehile bɛ, amaa bɛ diedi ne agyinla kpundii. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Ɔluakɛ bɛbaye bɛ bɛavi ayialeka ne mɔ; na nɔhalɛ nu, melɛ bie bara mɔɔ bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛbahye bɛ bɛahu bɛ la badwenle kɛ bɛlɛyɛ gyima kpalɛ bɛamaa Nana Nyamenle a. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Bɛbayɛ ɛhye, ɔboalekɛ, bɛnze Egya ne, yɛɛ bɛnze medame noko. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Bɛnlea, melɛka ɛhye mɔ meahile bɛ kɛkala, amaa saa mekɛ ne dwu zo a, bɛahakye kɛ mebɔ bɛ kɔkɔ dɛba. Deɛmɔti meanga ye alumua ne meangile bɛ la a le kɛ, ɛnee me nee bɛ de.<verse eid="JHN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />“Kɛkala yemɔ melɛkɔ mɔɔ zoanle me la anwo lɔ; noko akee bɛ nuhua ko biala ɛtɛkolale ɛtɛbizale me ɛleka mɔɔ mebahɔ a. <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Emomu ɛhye mɔɔ meha mehile bɛ la ɛmaa bɛlɛdi nyane wɔ bɛ ahonle nu. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Nɔhalɛ ne a le kɛ, ɔlua bɛ boɛyɛlɛ ti a melɛkɔ a, ɔluakɛ saa meangɔ a, Arɛlekyekyevolɛ ne ɛnrɛra. Kyesɛ mekɔ na meazoa ye wɔ bɛ nwo.<verse eid="JHN 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />“Na saa ɔba a, ɔbamaa ewiade amra anwu ngakyile mɔɔ wɔ ɛtaneyɛlɛ, tenleneyɛlɛ, ɔ nee ndɛnebualɛ avinli a. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Ewiade ɛtane ne a le kɛ yeanlie me yeanli; <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />mɔɔ fale tenleneyɛlɛ nwo la, ɔluakɛ melɛkɔ Egya ne anwo lɔ, na bɛnrɛnwu me bieko; <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />mɔɔ fale ndɛnebualɛ nwo noko la a le kɛ, bɛbua Sonla Ra ne ndɛne dɛbadɛba.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Melɛ edwɛkɛ dɔɔnwo meka mekile bɛ, noko akee saa meka mekile bɛ kɛkala a, ɔbayɛ adesoa kpole yeamaa bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Saa nɔhalɛ Sunsum ne ba a ɔbahilehile bɛ nɔhalɛ ne; ɔluakɛ ɔnrɛva ɔdaye ɔ ti anwo tumi ɔnrɛdendɛ, na emomu mɔɔ ɔbade la yɛɛ ɔbaha a; na eza noko yeaha mɔɔ bazi la amuala yeahile bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Ɔbawula me anyunlunyia, ɔluakɛ ɔnrɛhoati edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ meha mehile bɛ dɛbadɛba la ɔnrɛha fofolɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Egya agyapadeɛ biala le me deɛ, zɔhane ati a ɔnrɛhoati edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ meha mehile bɛ dɛba la na ɔnrɛha fofolɛ a. <verse eid="JHN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />Ɔnrɛhyɛ biala bɛnrɛnwu me; eza ɔnrɛhyɛ biala, bɛbanwu me bieko!”<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17-18" />Ye ɛdoavolɛma ne bie mɔ bizebizale bɛ nwo ngoko ngoko kɛ, “Duzu edwɛkɛ a ɔkpondɛ yeaha a, ‘Ɔnrɛhyɛ biala bɛnrɛnwu me, eza ɔnrɛhyɛ biala bɛbanwu me, ɔluakɛ mebahɔ Egya anwo lɔ? Ɔnrɛhyɛ biala ne abo a le duzu? Yɛnde mɔɔ ɔka la abo.’”<verse eid="JHN 16:17-18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Gyisɛse nwunle kɛ bɛkpondɛ kɛ bɛbiza ye ɛhye anwo edwɛkɛ la ati, ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Ɛnee mɔɔ menganle kɛ, Ɔnrɛhyɛ biala bɛnrɛnwu me; eza ɔnrɛhyɛ biala bɛbanwu me bieko la ati a bɛlɛbizebiza bɛ nwo edwɛkɛ ɛhye anzɛɛ? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Nɔhalɛ nu meka meahile bɛ kɛ, bɛmɛ bɛbazu, na eza bɛaye awolɛ, na ewiade amra anye balie; bɛmɛ mɔ bɛbali nyane, na bɛ nyanelilɛ ne bahakyi fɛlɛkolilɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Saa raalɛ fo awolɛ zo a, ɔnwu nyane, ɔluakɛ ye awolɛ mekɛ ɛdwu; na saa ɔwo ɔwie a, ɔ rɛle fi ye nyanelilɛ ne, na ɔdi fɛlɛko kɛ yewo sonla yedo ewiade anu. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Zɔhane ala yɛɛ kɛkala bɛlɛdi nyane a, noko mebanwu bɛ bieko na akee bɛ nye alie, yɛɛ awie biala noko ɛnrɛhola zɛhae fɛlɛkolilɛ ne die fi bɛ sa nu ɛlɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Zɔhane mekɛ ne anu, bɛnrɛbiza me debie biala. Nɔhalɛ nu meka meahile bɛ kɛ, debie biala mɔɔ bɛkɛbiza bɛkɛvi Egya ne lɔ wɔ me duma nu la, ɔbava yeamaa bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Sumunli kɛ de la, bɛtɛbizale debie biala wɔ me duma nu; bɛbiza na bɛ sa kɛha ye, amaa bɛ fɛlɛkolilɛ ne ali munli.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Medendɛ mehile bɛ wɔ mrɛlɛbulɛ nu dɛba, na mekɛ ne ɛlɛba aradwu mɔɔ menrɛdendɛ menrɛhile bɛ wɔ mrɛlɛ nu a, na mebaha Egya anwo edwɛkɛ ne wienyi meahile bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Mekɛ ne anu, bɛbalua me duma nu bɛabiza, mɔɔ ɔnrɛhyia kɛ menwɔbɔ bɛ ti menwɔzɛlɛ Egya ne menwɔmaa bɛ a, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />ɔluakɛ Egya ne ɔdaye mumua ne ɔkulo bɛ, ɔlua ɛhulolɛ ne mɔɔ bɛlɛ ye wɔ me nwo la ati, na eza bɛdie bɛdi kɛ mevi Egya ne ɛkɛ ne a membale a. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Nɔhalɛ nu, mevi Selɛ ne lɔ a membale ewiade anu a, yɛɛ eza mebagyakyi ewiade ne na meazia meahɔ ɔ nwo lɔ bieko.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ zele ye kɛ, “Bɔ zo mɔɔ akee ɛtendɛ nɔhalɛ bɔkɔɔ, na ɛmbu mrɛlɛ bieko a. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Kɛkala mɔ, akee yɛde ɔ bo kɛ amgba ɛze debie biala, na ɔngyia kɛ awie bɔbɔ nee wɔ kɛdwudwu. Ɔlua ɛhye azo yɛdie yɛdi kɛ amgba ɛvi Nana Nyamenle lɔ a ɛrale a.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Gyisɛse bizale bɛ kɛ, “Akee bɛdie bɛdi ɔ? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Melɛ ne ɛlɛba, yɛɛ yera yewie bɔbɔ, mɔɔ bɛbabɔ asande, na bɛ nuhua ko biala anriandi ahɔ ye sua nu agyakyi me ngome a. Noko akee ɔnrɛha me ngome ala, ɔluakɛ Egya ne nee me a wɔ ɛkɛ a. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Meha ɛhye mɔ amuala mehile bɛ, amaa bɛanyia anzondwolɛ wɔ bɛ ahonle nee bɛ adwenle nu. Bɛbanwu amaneɛ nee alɔbɔlɛ dɔɔnwo wɔ ewiade ɛhye anu; noko bɛgyinla kpundii, ɔluakɛ mehomo ewiade anwo zo bɔkɔɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse zɛlɛle maanle ye menli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Gyisɛse dendɛle wiele la, ɔmaanle ɔ nye zo anwuma na ɔzele kɛ, “Egya, mekɛ ne ɛdwu. Wula ɛ Ra ne anyunlunyia maa ɔlua zo ɔla wɔ anyunlunyia ne ali. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Ɔboalekɛ, wɔmaa ye tumi wɔ mrenyia nee mraalɛ mɔɔ wɔ ewiade la amuala anwo zo. Yemɔ a maa awie biala mɔɔ wɔva wɔmaa ye la ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la a. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Na adenle mɔɔ bɛfa zo bɛnyia zɛhae damɛnlangoate ngoane ne la a le kɛ bɛkɛnwu wɔ, kɛ wɔmɔ a ɛle nɔhalɛ Nyamenle kotokokye ne a, na eza bɛkɛnwu kɛ ɛdawɔ a ɛzoanle Gyisɛse Kelaese wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo a. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Memaanle wɔ anyunlunyia wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo, ɔluakɛ menyɛle debie biala mɔɔ ɛzele me kɛ menyɛ la. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Egya, akee wula me anyunlunyia kɛkala wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ megyi ɛ nyunlu ɛke la, anyunlunyia ne mɔɔ ewiade mɔlebɛbo ne ɛnee yɛ mu nwiɔ, yɛlɛ la.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Mela wɔ duma ne ali mehile menli mɔɔ ɛyele bɛ wɔ ewiade anu ɛmaanle me la. Nɔhalɛ nu, ɛnee bɛle wɔ deɛ dahuu, yɛɛ ɛvale bɛ ɛmaanle me a; yɛɛ bɛli wɔ mɛla ne azo noko. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Kɛkala noko bɛnwu kɛ, debie biala mɔɔ melɛ ye la le ahyɛlɛdeɛ mɔɔ vi wɔ ɛkɛ ne a. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Ɔluakɛ mɛla ne mɔɔ ɛvale ɛmaanle me la, medame noko meva bɛ muala memaa bɛ, yɛɛ bɛdabɛ noko bɛzɔ nu dwaa, na bɛnwu kɛ amgba mevi wɔ lɔ a membale azɛlɛ ye azo a, na eza bɛlie bɛli kɛ ɛdawɔ a ɛzoanle me a.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />“Menzɛlɛ memmaa ewiade amra amuala, mesɛlɛ memaa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ wɔva bɛ wɔmaa me la, ɔluakɛ bɛmɛ bɛle wɔ deɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Kɛmɔ bɛ muala noko bɛle me deɛ la ati, bɛle wɔ deɛ; na ɛdawɔ a wɔva bɛ wɔboka wɔ ninyɛne muala anwo wɔwula me sa nu a, ɛhye ati bɛle me anyunlunyia! <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Kɛkala mɔ melɛgyakyi bɛ wɔ ewiade anu meara ɛ nwo lɔ. Ɛhye ati Egya Nwuanzanwuanza, fa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ wɔva bɛ wɔmaa me la amuala sie, ammaa biala amminli, na emomu bɛabɔ nu bɛaye ko, kɛmɔ yɛdayɛ yɛle ko la. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Mekɛ mɔɔ mewɔ azɛlɛ ye azo la, meneanle ɛhye mɔ mɔɔ ɛvale ɛmaanle me la amuala anwo zo, ɔti biala amminli, kyesɛ abɔnsam ralɛ ne, kɛmɔ Ngɛlɛlera ne hanle dole ɛkɛ ne la.<verse eid="JHN 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />“Kɛkala mɔ, meleba ɛ nwo lɔ. Meha ninyɛne dɔɔnwo mehile bɛ wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɛnee me nee bɛ de la, amaa me fɛlɛko ayi bɛ tɛkɛɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Meva wɔ edwɛkɛ ne memaa bɛ, ɔlua zo ewiade kpɔ bɛ, kɛmɔ bɛnvi ewiade na medame noko menvi ewiade la. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Tɛ mɔɔ asɛɛ mesɛlɛ wɔ amaa wɔaye bɛ wɔavi ewiade anu ɔ, na amomu amaa wɔabɔ bɛ nwo bane wɔavi Abɔnsam asa anu. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Kɛmɔ memboka ewiade anwo la, zɔhane ala a bɛdabɛ noko bɛmboka ewiade ne anwo a. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Te bɛ nwo wɔ nɔhalɛ nu, na kilehile bɛ amaa bɛ nwo ade ayɛ nwuanzanwuanza. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Kɛmɔ ɛzoanle me wɔ ewiade anu la, zɔhane ala a melɛsoa bɛdabɛ noko wɔ ewiade anu a. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Na amaa bɛanyi wɔ nɔhalɛ nee nwuanzanwuanzayɛlɛ nu la ati, dahuu mete me nwo mefi ɛtane nwo.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Tɛ ɛhye mɔ angome a mesɛlɛ meamaa bɛ a, na emomu awie biala noko mɔɔ kɛlua bɛ daselɛlilɛ ne azo kɛra me ɛkɛ la boka nwo, <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />amaa bɛ muala bɛabɔ nu bɛayɛ ko; kɛmɔ ɛdawɔ Egya ne ɛde me nu, na medame noko mede wɔ nu la, amaa bɛdabɛ noko bɛadɛnla yɛ nu, na ewiade alie ali kɛ wɔmɔ a ɛzoanle me a.<verse eid="JHN 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />“Meva koyɛlɛ anyunlunyia ne mɔɔ ɛvale ɛmaanle me la memaa bɛ, <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />amaa meadɛnla bɛ nu, na ɛdawɔ noko wɔadɛnla me nu, na yɛ muala yɛayɛ ko ɔlua zo ewiade anwu kɛ ɛdawɔ a ɛzoanle me a, na eza bɛade ɔ bo kɛ ɛkulo bɛ, kɛmɔ ɛkulo me la. <verse eid="JHN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />Egya, mekulo kɛ mɔɔ wɔva bɛ wɔmaa me la nee me tɛnla, amaa bɛanwu me anyunlunyia ne mɔɔ ɔlua ɛhulolɛ zo ɛvale ɛmaanle me kolaa na ewiade abɔ ɔ bo la.<verse eid="JHN 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />“O Egya tenlenenli, ewiade ɛnze wɔ, noko mame meze wɔ; yɛɛ ɛdoavolɛma ɛhye mɔ noko ze kɛ ɛdawɔ a ɛzoanle me a. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Mela wɔ ali mehile bɛ, na mebahɔ zo meala wɔ ali meahile bɛ noko, amaa ɛhulolɛ bedivinli ne mɔɔ ɛlɛ ye wɔ me nwo la adɛnla bɛ nu, na medame noko meadɛnla bɛ nu.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Bɛhye Gyisɛse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Gyisɛse anloa dɔle la, ɔ nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ pɛle nu wɔ Kedelɔn bɔnza ne anwo na bɛhɔle “ɔlivi” tola bie anu. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Na Dwudase, mɔɔ yele ye maanle la noko ze zɛhae ɛleka ne, ɔluakɛ Gyisɛse ta kɛ ɔ nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɔ ɛkɛ.<verse eid="JHN 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Na azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ, nee Falasiima ne mɔ dule azogya nee agbolisi, mɔɔ dedɛ tɛkɛ nee ngɛnlaneɛ nee ahoholombaka la guale Dwudase anwo zo, na ɔ nee bɛ hɔle tola ne anu. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4-5" />Ɛnee Gyisɛse ze mɔɔ bazi ɔ nwo zo la amuala. Ɔti ɔrale ɔ nyunlu na ɔbizale bɛ kɛ,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:4-5">“Nwane a bɛkpondɛ ye a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:4-5">Bɛbuale ye kɛ, “Gyisɛse, mɔɔ vi Nazalɛte la ɔ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:4-5">Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Mame ɛne.” <verse eid="JHN 18:4-5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Mɔɔ ɔhanle kɛ “Mame ɛne” la, bɛbɔle nguku bɛhɔle bɛ nzi na bɛdele bɛguale aze.<verse eid="JHN 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Na eza ɔbizale bɛ bieko kɛ, “Nwane a bɛkpondɛ ye a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Bɛbuale ye bieko kɛ, “Gyisɛse, mɔɔ vi Nazalɛte la ɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Meha mehile bɛ kɛ, ‘Mame ɛne.’ Ɔti saa mame a bɛkpondɛ me ɛdeɛ a, ɛnee bɛmaa menli ɛhye mɔ ɛhɔ.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Ɔyɛle ɛhye amaa ye kapezo edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ se, “Metɛminlinle mɔɔ ɛvale ɛmaanle me la anu ko bɔbɔ” la ali munli.<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Akee Saemɔn Pita noko hwenle dadeɛ wɔ ye boa ne anu, na ɔpɛle Malekɛse, mɔɔ le Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli ne sonvolɛ la anzo fema ne.<verse eid="JHN 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Gyisɛse zele Pita kɛ, “Fa wɔ dadeɛ ne wula ye boa ne anu. Ɛnze kɛ ɔwɔ kɛ meno dwora (kɔpo) ne mɔɔ Egya ɛva ɛmaa me la ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Ɔti Dwuuma agbolisi ne mɔ nee azogya ne mɔ nee bɛ mgbanyinli ne mɔ hyele Gyisɛse na bɛkyekyele ye. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Bɛlumuale bɛ nee ye hɔle Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli Kayafase, mɔɔ le Anase azebia la sua nu. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Zɛhae Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli ye, yemɔ a maanle Dwuuma ne mɔ adwenle na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Ɔle kpalɛ kɛ sonla ko kɛwu kɛlie menli dɔɔnwo ngoane la.” <verse eid="JHN 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Saemɔn Pita lile bɛ nzi, yɛɛ ɛdoavolɛ ko bie mɔɔ Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli ne ze ye la noko boka nwo. Ɔti bɛmaanle zɔhane ɛdoavolɛ ne adenle bɛmaanle ɔ nee Gyisɛse hɔle Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli ne aako ne anu, <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />na Pita yemɔ ɔgyinlanle anlenkɛ ne anzi wɔ alie nwo lɔ. Akee ɛdoavolɛ ne mɔɔ Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli ne ze ye la, vindele alie nwo na ɔzɛlɛle bɛlɛra ne mɔɔ sinza anlenkɛ kpole ne la adenle, na ɔ nee Pita wolole aako ne anu. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Bɛlɛra ne bizale Pita kɛ, “Ɛnle Gyisɛse ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anu ko ɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Ɔbuale ye kɛ, “Kyɛkyɛ, memboka bɛ nwo.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Kɛmɔ ɛnee ɔle ɛyɛlɛ mekɛ la ati, agbolisi ne mɔ nee azonvolɛ mɔɔ wɔ sua ne anu ɛkɛ ne la ɛnee ɛwuda senle na bɛlɛte. Na Pita noko hɔgyinlanle bɛ nwo ɛkɛ ne ɔdele senle ne bie.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli ne bizebizale Gyisɛse, ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ɔ nee ye ngilehile ne mɔ anwo edwɛkɛ.<verse eid="JHN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Gyisɛse buale ye kɛ, “Awie biala ze deɛ mɔɔ mekilehile la, ɔluakɛ meha Nyamedwɛkɛ ne dahuu wɔ ayiasua ne mɔ anu, ɔ nee Asɔne Sua Kpole ne noko anu; yɛɛ Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ noko ɛde mɔɔ mekilehile la amuala, ɔluakɛ mengile debie gyɛne biala memboka mɔɔ meka ye wɔ bagua nu la anwo. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Duzu ati a bɛlɛbiza me kpuyia ɛhye a? Bɛbiza bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdiele me la ɛ! Bie mɔ a gyigyi ɛke la, yɛɛ bɛze mɔɔ menganle noko a.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Azogya ne mɔ mɔɔ gyigyi ɛkɛ ne la anu ko hwenle ɔ sa pɛle Gyisɛse anye zo na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Asoo ɛdawɔ kɛ ɛbua Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli edwɛkɛ la ɛne?”<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Gyisɛse buale ye kɛ, “Sa meyɛ ɛtane a ɛnee ka kile me, na saa metɛyɛle ɛtane a, ɛnee duzu ati a akee wɔbɔ me a?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Akee Anase maanle bɛvale Gyisɛse mɔɔ ɛnee bɛkyekye ye la, bɛhɔmaanle Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli Kayafase.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Zɛhae mekɛ ye, ɛnee Saemɔn Pita tɛgyi senle ne anwo, ɔti bɛbizale ye bieko kɛ, “Asoo ɛnle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne anu ko ɔ?” Ɔbuale ɔzele kɛ, “Kyɛkyɛ, memboka bɛ nwo.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Na Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli ne ye azonvolɛ ne mɔ ko, mɔɔ ye busuanli a Pita pɛle ɔ nzo wɔ tola ne anu la, bizale ye kɛ, “Anzɛɛ meannwu wɔ nee ye wɔ tola ne anu ɔ? Tɛ wɔmɔ a ɛnee ɛboka Gyisɛse wɔ ɛkɛ ne la ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Eza Pita zale ɔ ne bieko; na ɛkɛ ne ala akɔlɛ bɔle.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse wɔ Paelɛte anyunlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse ndɛnebualɛ ne wiele wɔ Kayafase anyunlu la, ɛnee aleɛ ɛlɛba arahye. Ɔti bɛvi ɛkɛ ne la, bɛvale ye bɛhɔle Wulomu Amɛnlado ne sua nu. Dwuuma ne mɔ anwolo ɛkɛ ne bie, ɔluakɛ ɛhye kɛgua bɛ nwo evinli, mɔɔ ɔlua zo bɛdi Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia ne bie a ɔnrɛyɛ boɛ a. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Ɔti Paelɛte, mɔɔ le Amɛnlado ne, vindele rale bɛ nwo ɛkɛ na ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Duzu edwɛkɛ a bɛlɛ ye bɛtia nrenyia ɛhye a? Duzu ɛtane a yeyɛ mɔɔ ɔlua zo bɛlɛto ye ɛzonle a?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Bɛdabɛ noko bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Na asoo ɔtɛyɛle debie ɛtane a anrɛɛ yɛ nee ye kɛra ɛ nyunlu ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Paelɛte zele bɛ kɛ, “Ɛnee bɛva ye bɛhɔ na bɛhɔli ye edwɛkɛ kɛmɔ bɛdabɛ bɛ mɛla ne se la.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Bɛbuale kɛ, “Yɛnlɛ mɛla biala mɔɔ yɛdua zo yɛbɔ sonla meanubaka nu a, ɛhye ati yɛkpondɛ tumi yɛavi wɔ ɛkɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Ɛhye maanle Gyisɛse kapezo edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ fale ewule holɛ ko mɔɔ ɔbawu la lile munli.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Akee Paelɛte ziale hɔle aako nu lɔ bieko na ɔzele kɛ bɛ nee Gyisɛse ɛrɛla. Ɔbizale Gyisɛse kɛ, “Wɔmɔ a le Dwuuma Belemgbunli ne ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Gyisɛse bizale ye kɛ, “Ɛnee ɛdawɔ a ɛlɛka ɛhye, anzɛɛ awie mɔ a hanle hilele wɔ a?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Paelɛte zele ye kɛ, “Na mame mele Dwuunli ɔ? Ɛdawɔ wɔ maanlema nee bɛ azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli a ɛva wɔ ɛra ɛke a. Na duzu ɛtane a wɔyɛ a?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Akee Gyisɛse buale ye kɛ, “Me belemgbunlililɛ ɛdeɛ ɛnle azɛlɛ ye azo. Saa me belemgbunlililɛ wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo a, anrɛɛ me ɛlɔnema kɛho kɛlie me. Na kɛmɔ me belemgbunlililɛ ɛdeɛ ɛnle azɛlɛ ye azo ɛke la ati, yemɔti a Dwuuma ne mɔ holale hyele me rale a.”<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Paelɛte buale ye kɛ, “Se ɛnee ɛle belemgbunli ɛdeɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Gyisɛse buale ye kɛ, “Ɛhɛe, na ɛhye ala ati noko a bɛwole me a. Na nɔhalɛ ne a me nee ye rale ewiade a. Menli noko mɔɔ kulo nɔhalɛ ne la a le me ɛdoavolɛma a.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Paelɛte deanle nu zele kɛ, “Nɔhalɛ a le duzu?” Akee ɔvindele ɔdoale menli ne mɔ bieko na ɔhɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Mennwu ɛtane biala wɔ ɔ nwo. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Na kɛmɔ bɛlɛ adenle kɛ bɛbiza bɛmaa meye bɛ menli mɔɔ gua efiade la anu ko memaa bɛ wɔ Akpabɛnwo Ɛvoyia ne anu mekɛ biala la, ɛnee bɛkɛhulo kɛ menwɔye ‘Dwuuma Belemgbunli’ ne menwɔmaa bɛ ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Bɛdeɛdeanle nu bɛzele kɛ, “Kyɛkyɛ! Yɛngulo nrenyia ɛhye. Yɛkulo Balabase!” Na Balabase noko le kodiawu.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Akee Paelɛte maanle bɛvale Gyisɛse bɛhɔle na bɛhɔbilale ye empele. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Azogya ne mɔ nwonle mbowule abotile vale zoale ye, na bɛwulale ye kɔbenle tɛladeɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Akee bɛdeɛdeanle nu bɛzile ye amgbu bɛzele kɛ, “Akoaba, ‘Dwuuma Belemgbunli!’ ”<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Paelɛte vindele bieko na ɔhɔzele Dwuuma ne kɛ, “Mekava ye mearɛlɛ bɛ kɛkala, noko memaa bɛade bɛ nwo ɔ bo wienyi kɛ, mennwu ɛtane biala wɔ ɔ nwo.”<verse eid="JHN 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Gyisɛse zo ye mbowule abotile ne na ɔwula ye kɔbenle tɛladeɛ ne ɔvindele. Na Paelɛte zele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛnlea, nrenyia ne ɛne.”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Mɔɔ Dwuuma azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli ne mɔ nee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ anye bɔle ɔ nwo zo ala la, bɛdeɛdeanle nu bɛzele kɛ, “Bɔ ye meanubaka nu! Bɔ ye meanubaka nu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Paelɛte zele bɛ kɛ, “Ɛnee bɛdabɛ bɛva ye bɛhɔbɔ ye meanubaka nu ɛ, na mame ɛdeɛ mennwu ɛtane wɔ ɔ nwo.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Bɛbuale ye kɛ, “Yɛlɛ mɛla bie, na mɛla ne kile kɛ ɔwɔ kɛ ɔwu, ɔluakɛ ɔfɛlɛ ɔ nwo Nyamenle Ra.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Mɔɔ Paelɛte dele ɛhye la, akee ye ahonle dule kpole dɛlale dɛba ne bɔbɔ. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Bɛ nee Gyisɛse ziale hɔle aako nu lɔ bieko, na ɔbizale ye kɛ, “Ɛvi nienwu?” Noko Gyisɛse ambua ye.<verse eid="JHN 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Paelɛte deanle ye nu zele kɛ, “Ɛnrɛdɛne me zo ɔ? Ɛnze kɛ melɛ tumi kɛ megyakyi wɔ anzɛɛ mebɔ wɔ meanubaka nu ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Saa bɛanva tumi ne bɛanvi anwuma bɛammaa wɔ a, ɛnrɛhola ɛnrɛnyia me nwo zo tumi biala. Ɔti bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛyele me bɛmaanle wɔ la, bɛ gyakɔ!”<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Paelɛte dele ɛhye la, ɔhulole kɛ ɔkɛgyakyi ye, na Dwuuma ne deɛdeanle nu zele ye kɛ, “Saa ɛgyakyi nrenyia ɛhye a, ɛnee tɛ ɛ gɔnwo a le Siza! Ɔluakɛ awie biala mɔɔ yɛ ɔ nwo belemgbunli la, ɛnee ɔtia Siza.”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Paelɛte dele ɛhye la, ɔvale Gyisɛse ɔrale bɛ nwo ɛkɛ ne bieko, na ɔvole ɔdɛnlanle ndɛnebualɛ ebia ne mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Gabata wɔ Hibulu aneɛ nu la azo. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Ɛnee akee bɛbɔ kɛyɛ ewiazo bulu nee nwiɔ, wɔ kenle ne mɔɔ li Akpabɛnwo ne anyunlu la anu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:14">Na Paelɛte zele Dwuuma ne mɔ kɛ, “Bɛnlea, bɛ Belemgbunli ne ɛne!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Bɛdeanle nu bɛzele kɛ, “Fa ye kɔ! Fa ye kɔ! Bɔ ye meanubaka nu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Paelɛte zele bɛ kɛ, “Kɛ Duzu? Membɔ bɛ Belemgbunli ne meanubaka nu ɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli ne mɔ buale ye zele kɛ, “Yɛmɛ yɛnlɛ belemgbunli biala kɛ Siza angome.”<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Akee Paelɛte vale Gyisɛse maanle bɛ kɛ bɛhɔbɔ ye meanubaka nu.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Meanubaka nu ɛbɔlɛ ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Ɔti akee bɛ sa hanle ye amozii; na bɛvale ye meanubaka ne bɛzoale ye, na bɛ nee ye vile sua ne azo hɔle ɛleka ne mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Hibulu nu “Gɔlogɔta”, mɔɔ ɔ bo a le kɛ “Etile Kanrɛlɛ” la. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Ɛkɛ ne a bɛbɔle ye nee menli nwiɔ bie noko meanubaka nu a, na Gyisɛse wɔ bɛ avinli. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Paelɛte hɛlɛle bɔle Gyisɛse meanubaka ne ati avinli kɛ, “<char style="sc">Gyisɛse mɔɔ vi nazalɛte, Dwuuma belemgbunli ne ɛne.</char>” <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Ɛleka ne mɔɔ bɛbɔle gyisɛse meanubaka nu la bikye sua ne azo; na bɛhɛlɛle ɛhye noko wɔ Hibulu, Laten, nee Giliki aneɛ ne mɔ anu, ɔti menli dɔɔnwo holale gengale.<verse eid="JHN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Akee azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli ne mɔ zele Paelɛte kɛ, “Kakyi ‘Dwuuma Belemgbunli’ ne mɔɔ wɔhɛlɛ la, yɛ ye kɛ, ‘Ɔse, mame a mele Dwuuma Belemgbunli’ ne a.”<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Paelɛte buale bɛ kɛ, “Mɔɔ mehɛlɛ la, mehɛlɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23-24" />Mekɛ mɔɔ azogya ne mɔ bɔle Gyisɛse meanubaka nu wiele la, bɛyɛle bɛ adwenle kɛ bɛkyɛ ye tɛladeɛ ne anu nna bɛamaa bɛ nuhua ko biala anyia bie. Noko bɛzele kɛ, “Bɛmmamaa yɛtete ye tɛladeɛ ne anu,” ɔluakɛ ɔle woladapi. “Bɛmaa yɛhwe nwolɛ adunyi yɛnlea kɛ ɔkɛyɛ nwane deɛ.” Ɛhye maanle mɔɔ bɛha ye Ngɛlɛlera ne anu dɛba la lile munli kɛ, “Bɛhyɛle me nwo ninyɛne ne mɔ, na eza bɛhwenle me tɛladeɛ ne noko anwo adunyi.” <verse eid="JHN 19:23-24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Na ɛhye noko a bɛyɛle a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:25">Ɛnee Gyisɛse ɔ nli, Male, yɛɛ ɔ nli adiema raalɛ ne, mɔɔ ɔ hu a le Kulopase la, yɛɛ Male mɔɔ vi Magedala la gyigyi meanubaka ne anwo ɛkɛ ne. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse nwunle kɛ ɔ nli gyi ɛdoavolɛ ne mɔɔ ɔkulo ye la anwo ɛkɛ ne la, ɔzele ye kɛ, “Raalɛ ye, ɛra ne ɛne.”<verse eid="JHN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Akee ɔhanle ɔhilele ɛdoavolɛ ne noko kɛ, “Nea, ɛ nli ɛne.” Ɔvi zɔhane mekɛ ne, Dwɔn vale Male hɔle ɔdaye ye sua nu.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Na mɔɔ Gyisɛse nwunle kɛ debie biala ɛra awieleɛ la, amaa Ngɛlɛlera ne ali munli la, ɔzele kɛ, “Nzuhɔne ku me.” <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Ɛnee nwanye bie mɔɔ yɛ ɛnwonle kɛ bɔnyema la wɔ kɔpo nu gyi ɛkɛ, ɔti bɛvale emiane bɛkyekyele baka ti na bɛvale bɛbɔle nu bɛmaanle ye kɛ ɔnlo.<verse eid="JHN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse vale ɔ nloa hanle ye la, ɔdeanle nu ɔzele kɛ, “<char style="sc">Yewie</char>,” akee ɔbɔle ɔ ti aze na ɔwule.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ angulo kɛ menli mɔɔ bɛbɔ bɛ meanubaka nu la kɛhenda mbaka ne azo kɛmaa alehyenlɛ ne mɔɔ le Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne la kɛrado bɛ. Ɛhye noko le kenle kpole, ɔlua Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia ne ati. Ɔti bɛzɛlɛle Paelɛte kɛ ɔmaa bɛbubu bɛ gyakɛ na bɛawu ndɛndɛ; amaa bɛahola bɛayeye bɛ avunli ne mɔ bɛavi mbaka ne mɔ azo. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Ɔti azogya ne mɔ rabubule menli nwiɔ ne mɔɔ bɛbɔle bɛ meanubaka nu bɛbokale Gyisɛse anwo la agyakɛ, <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />na mɔɔ bɛdwule Gyisɛse anwo ɛkɛ ne la, bɛnwunle kɛ yewu dɛbadɛba, ɔti bɛambubu ɔ gyakɛ ɛdeɛ ne. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Emomu, azogya ne mɔ anu ko vale ye atwɛ ne wɔle ɔ nvenle foa, na mogya nee nzule vi ɛkɛ ne vindele. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Na sonla ne mɔɔ ɛlɛdi nwolɛ daselɛ la nwunle ɛhye mɔ ɔdaye ɔ nye zo, ɛhye ati ye daselɛlilɛ ne le nɔhalɛ bɔkɔɔ, amaa ɛdawɔ noko wɔalie wɔali. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36-37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36-37" />Azogya ne mɔ yɛle ɛhye amaa Ngɛlɛlera ne mɔɔ se, “Bɛnrɛbu ye bowule ko bɔbɔ anu” la ali munli. Yɛɛ eza Ngɛlɛlera ne bieko se, “Bɛbakpogya bɛ nye zo bɛanlea sonla ne mɔɔ bɛwɔle ye atwɛ ne la.” Ɛhye maanle ɔdaye noko ɔlile munli.<verse eid="JHN 19:36-37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Nzinlii, Dwosefi mɔɔ vi Arelematia, mɔɔ ɛnee ɔdaye noko ɔle Gyisɛse ye ɛdoavolɛma ne anu ko wɔ azule bo ɔlua kɛ ɔsulo Dwuuma ne mɔ la ati la, zile ye ahonle razɛlɛle Paelɛte adenle kɛ ɔmaa ye Gyisɛse funli ne ɔvi meanubaka ne azo. Paelɛte noko maanle ye adenle.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:38">Ɔti ɔrale na ɔravale ye funli ne ɔhɔle. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nekɔdimɛse, mɔɔ ɔdaye noko ɔrale Gyisɛse anwo ɛkɛ ne mekɛ bie wɔ nɔɔzo la, vale alufuanlɛ nee kolɔbo mɔɔ bɛfa bɛkyengye funli la tone nu ɛya ko rale. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Na bɛ mu nwiɔ, bɛvale ɛhye mɔ bɛguguale ɛdanlɛ tendenle bie anu na bɛvale bɛkyekyele Gyisɛse funli ne, kɛmɔ Dwuuma sonla ɛziele amaamuo ne de la. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Ɛleka ne mɔɔ bɛbɔle Gyisɛse meanubaka nu la bikye tola bie, mɔɔ sɛka bie mɔɔ bɛtɛsiele funli nu ɛlɛ la wɔ ɛkɛ a. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Ye zɔhane ati, amaa bɛ nwo ayɛ ndɛ, kolaa na ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne adwu, na eza sɛka ne bikye bɛ la ati, bɛziele ye wɔ ɛkɛ ne ala.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse ɛra ngoane nu bieko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Molɛ aleɛbahye ne, anzɛɛ wɔ kenle ne mɔɔ lumua wɔ dapɛne ne anu, mɔɔ ɛnee maanle nu ɛtɛtetele bɔbɔ la, Male mɔɔ vi Magedala hɔle sɛka ne azo na ɔnwunle kɛ bɛhundo bolɛ ne bɛvi sɛka ne anloa.<verse eid="JHN 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Ɔnriandinle ɔranwunle Saemɔn Pita, ɔ nee ɛdoavolɛ ne mɔɔ Gyisɛse kulo ye edwɛkɛ la, na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛye Awulae funli ne bɛvi sɛka ne anu, na mennwu ɛleka ko mɔɔ bɛ nee ye ɛhɔ a!”<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3-4" />Pita nee ɛdoavolɛ ne nriandinle hɔle sɛka ne azo kɛ bɛkanlea. Ɛdoavolɛ ko ne zenle Pita anwo lumuale ɛkɛ ne, <verse eid="JHN 20:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />na ɔhotole ɔnleanle sɛka ne anu la, ɔnwunle kɛ ɛdanlɛ ne mɔɔ bɛvale bɛkyekyele ye la gua ɛkɛ, noko sɛka ne anu. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Akee Saemɔn Pita noko ɔdaye ɔrale ɛkɛ na yemɔ ɔhɔle nu. Ɔnwunle kɛ ɛdanlɛ ne gua ɛkɛ, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />yɛɛ ɔnwunle kɛ bɛbubu ɛdanlɛ ne mɔɔ bɛvale bɛkyekyele Gyisɛse ati la kɛnlɛma bie gua sɛka ne anu. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Na ɛdoavolɛ ko ne hɔle sɛka ne anu bie, na ɔnwunle mɔɔ ɛzi la, na ɔliele ɔlile, <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />ɔluakɛ ɛnee bɛtɛdiele bɛtɛdile kɛ Ngɛlɛlera ne kile kɛ ɔbazia yeara ngoane nu bieko.<verse eid="JHN 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Ɛdoavolɛma nwiɔ ne hɔle sua nu, <verse eid="JHN 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />na mekɛ zɔhane, ɛnee eza Male ɛzia ɛhɔ sɛka ne azo, na ɔgyi ahanle ɔlɛsu. Na mɔɔ ɔsu la, ɔbutule na ɔnleanle sɛka ne anu, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />na ɔnwunle anwumabɔvolɛma nwiɔ mɔɔ bɛwulowula adɛladeɛ fufule nwohyee, na ko de ɛleka mɔɔ bɛdole Gyisɛse la ati sɔlɔ, yɛɛ ko noko de ɔ gyakɛ anu.<verse eid="JHN 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Duzu ati a ɛlɛsu a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Ɔbuale bɛ kɛ, “Ɔboalekɛ, bɛye Awulae bɛvi ɛkɛ, yɛɛ mennwu ɛleka noko mɔɔ bɛdo ye a.”<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Ɔdole ɔ nye ɔ nzi la, ɔnwunle kɛ awie gyi ɔ nzi ɛkɛ ne. Gyisɛse ɔ, noko yeannwu ye sonla holɛ! <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Ɔbizale ye kɛ, “Raalɛ ye, duzu ati a ɛlɛsu a? Nwane a ɛkpondɛ ye a?” Male dwenlenle kɛ tola ne amenle ɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Ɔti ɔzele ye kɛ, “Yɛmenle, saa ɛdawɔ a wɔye ye wɔvi ɛke a, ɛnee kile me ɛleka mɔɔ ɛvale ye ɛdole la maa mengɔnva ye.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Akee Gyisɛse vɛlɛle ye kɛ, “Male!” Na Male hakyile ɔ nye ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne, na ɔdeanle nu wɔ Hibulu aneɛ ne anu kɛ, “Labonae,” mɔɔ ɔ bo a le kɛ “Kilehilevolɛ!”<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Mmafa ɛ sa ɛka me, ɔluakɛ metɛnyianle metɛkɔle Egya anwo lɔ. Emomu kɔ mediema ne mɔ ɛke na kɔze bɛ kɛ, melɛkɔ me ze nee be ze, yɛɛ me Nyamenle ɔ nee bɛ Nyamenle ne anwo lɔ.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Male mɔɔ vi Magedala la amgba noko hɔle ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anwo ɛkɛ na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Menwu Awulae!” Akee ɔhanle nrɛlaleɛ ne ɔhilele bɛ.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Kenle ko ne nɔsolɛ nu, wɔ kenle ne mɔɔ lumua dapɛne ne anu, mɔɔ ɛnee ɔlua Dwuuma ne mɔ anwo ɛzulole ti, ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ɛtoto bɛ nwo nlenkɛ nu la, Gyisɛse ragyinlanle bɛ avinli ɛkɛ na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Anzondwolɛ ɛha bɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Ɔvale ɔ sa akunlu nee ɔ nvenle foa ne ɔhilele bɛ. Na mɔɔ bɛnwunle kɛ amgba Awulae la, ɔyɛle bɛ fɛ totohyia!<verse eid="JHN 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Gyisɛse zele bɛ bieko kɛ, “Anzondwolɛ ɛha bɛ! Kɛmɔ Egya ne zoanle me la, zɔhane ala a medame melɛsoa bɛ a.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Akee ɔgule ɛnwomenle ɔguale bɛ nwo zo na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛlie Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Mɔɔ bɛkɛva ye ɛtane bɛkɛhyɛ ye la, ɛnee bɛva bɛhyɛ ye. Yɛɛ mɔɔ bɛanva ye ɛtane bɛangyɛ ye la, ɛnee ye ɛtane ne ɛha ɔ nwo.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tɔmase, kpolerasuvolɛ ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Ɛnee Tɔmase, mɔɔ le ɛdoavolɛma bulu nee nwiɔ ne anu ko, na eza bɛfɛlɛ ye “Ndabia” la, ɛnle ɛkɛ ne wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ Gyisɛse rale la. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Na mɔɔ bɛhanle bɛhilele ye kɛ, “Yɛnwu Awulae” la, yemɔ ɔbuale bɛ kɛ, “Saa metɛnwunle pɛlɛgo kapenle ne wɔ ɔ sa akunlu, nee ɔ nvenle foa, na metɛfale me sa metɛwulale nu a, menrɛlie menrɛli.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Kenle mɔtwɛ pɛle nu zenle la, ɛnee eza ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ɛyia nu bieko, na mekɛ ɛhye anu ɛnee Tɔmase boka bɛ nwo. Ɛnee bɛtoto nlenkɛ ne mɔ anu, na arɛlevilɛ nu ala, eza Gyisɛse ragyinlanle bɛ avinli na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Anzondwolɛ ɛha bɛ!” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Akee ɔzele Tɔmase kɛ, “Fa ɛ sa bɛla ɛke. Nea, me sa akunlu ɛne; fa ɛ sa bɛla. Fa wula me nvenle foa ko. Mmasu kpolera bieko, na die di!”<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tɔmase buale kɛ, “Me Awulae nee me Nyamenle!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Wɔlie wɔli, ɔboalekɛ wɔnwu me. Na emomu nyilalɛ ɛha bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛtɛnwunle me, noko bɛdie bɛdi la.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30-31" />Gyisɛse yɛle nwanwanendeɛ dɔɔnwo hilele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛangɛlɛ be wɔ buluku ɛhye anu a. Emomu bɛhɛlɛ ɛhye mɔ amaa bɛalie bɛali kɛ amgba Gyisɛse a le Kelaese ne, Nyamenle Ra ne a. Na bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkɛlie ɛhye mɔ bɛkɛli la bɛbanyia ngoane wɔ ye duma nu.<verse eid="JHN 20:30-31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Amozi ye, Gyisɛse yele ɔ nwo hilele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ wɔ Galeli Tandane ne anloa. Kɛ ɔzile ɔyele ɔ nwo ɔhilele bɛ la ɛne:<verse eid="JHN 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Ɛnee ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anu bie, Saemɔn Pita, Tɔmase, mɔɔ eza bɛfɛlɛ ye “Daedimɔso” anzɛɛ kɛ “Ndabia”, Natanayɛle, mɔɔ vi Kana mɔɔ wɔ Galeli, ɔ nee Zɛbɛdi amra mrenyia nwiɔ ne, Gyemise nee Dwɔn ɔ nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anu nwiɔ noko wɔ ɛkɛ.<verse eid="JHN 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Saemɔn Pita zele bɛ kɛ, “Mekɔ adwɛne.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Bɛzele ye kɛ, “Yɛ nee wɔ bahɔ.” Ɔti bɛvile sua nu na bɛ muala bɛhɔle ɛlɛne ne anu, na emomu bɛangye fɛlɛ biala wɔ nɔe ne amuala. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Aleɛbahye ne, bɛnwunle kɛ nrenyia bie ɛragyinla ɛnwea ne anloa, na ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ, annwu ye sonla holɛ.<verse eid="JHN 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Ɛnee Gyisɛse ɔ. Ɔti ɔvɛlɛle bɛ ɔzele bɛ, “Ngakula, anzɛɛ bɛnyia fɛlɛ bie ɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Bɛbuale ye kɛ, “Kyɛkyɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Akee ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛdo bɛ avonle ne wɔ ɛlɛne ne foa ko wɔ fema zo, na bɛbahye edwɛne dɔɔnwo!” Ɔti bɛdole avonle ne, na ɔlua fɛlɛ somaa ne ala mɔɔ bɛnyianle ye la ɛnlomboɛ ti, bɛangola bɛandwe avonle ne bɔbɔ.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Na ɛdoavolɛ ne mɔɔ Gyisɛse kulo ye edwɛkɛ la zele Pita kɛ, “Awulae ɔ!” Saemɔn Pita dele kɛ Awulae ɔ la, ɔyele ye anwuma tɛladeɛ ne ɔkyekyele ɔ nwo, ɔluakɛ ɛnee ɔ kɛnra amuala gua zo, na ɔwulule ɔdɔle azule ne anu ɔweɛle ɔrale ɛnweazo. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ mɔɔ hale la vole ɛlɛne ne anu; na bɛhwenle avonle ne mɔɔ fɛlɛ ngome ɛyi ye la bɛrale file zo; na ɔ nee file zo anwa biala, ɔbaye kɛyɛ abɛsamu ɛya nsa ala. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Mɔɔ bɛvile ɛlɛne ne anu bɛdwule aze la, bɛnwunle kɛ bɛlɛtondo fɛlɛ wɔ senle bie mɔɔ bɛwuda la azo wɔ ɛkɛ, ɔ nee kpanwo noko.<verse eid="JHN 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛva fɛlɛ ne mɔɔ bɛhye ye la bie bɛrɛlɛ me kɛkala.” <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Ɔti Saemɔn Pita vindele hɔle hɔhwehwenle avonle ne rale aze. Bɛdianle la ɛnee fɛlɛ mgbole mgbole ɛya ko nee abulanlu nee nsa yɛɛ wɔ avonle ne anu a, noko akee avonle ne antete.<verse eid="JHN 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Akee bɛrɛla bɛrali debie!” Na ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anu biala angola ambiza ye kɛ “nwane a le wɔ,” ɔluakɛ ɛnee bɛdabɛ mumua ne bɛze ye wienyi kɛ ɔdaye ɔ. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Akee Gyisɛse vale kpanwo ne nee fɛlɛ ne anu nwiɔ, na ɔhyɛle ɔmaanle bɛ muala.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Ɛhye a le mɔɔ tɔ zo fane nsa, wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ Gyisɛse vi ewule nu dwazole la, ɔyele ɔ nwo ɔhilele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ a.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Mɔɔ bɛlile aleɛ bɛwiele la, Gyisɛse zele Saemɔn Pita kɛ, “Saemɔn, Dwɔn ara, asoo ɛlɛ me nwo ɛhulolɛ ɛtɛla ɛhye mɔ amuala ɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Pita buale ye kɛ, “Ɛhɛe, Awulae, ɛdawɔ mumua ne ɛze kɛ mekulo wɔ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Maa me mboane mralɛ ne mɔ aleɛ.”<verse eid="JHN 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Gyisɛse bizale ye kpuyia ne bieko kɛ, “Saemɔn, Dwɔn ara, amgba ala ɛlɛ me nwo ɛhulolɛ ɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Pita zele ye kɛ, “Ɛhɛe, Awulae, ɛdawɔ mumua ne ɛze kɛ mekulo wɔ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Gyisɛse eza zele ye kɛ, “Ɛnee nea me mboane ne mɔ maa me.”<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Gyisɛse bizale ye mɔɔ tɔ zo fane nsa kɛ, “Saemɔn, Dwɔn ara, asoo ɛkulo me ɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Ɔyɛle Pita nyane somaa ne ala kɛ Gyisɛse bizale ye fane nsa kɛ saa ɔlɛ ɔ nwo ɛhulolɛ a la. Ɔti Pita zele ye kɛ, “Awulae, ɛdawɔ mumua ne ɛze me ahonle nu; ɛze kɛ melɛ ɛ nwo ɛhulolɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Gyisɛse eza zele ye kɛ, “Ɛnee maa me mboane mralɛ ne mɔ aleɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Akee mese wɔ nɔhalɛ nu kɛ, “Mekɛ mɔɔ ɛle kpavolɛ la ɛdawɔ a ɛfa wɔ ɛdanlɛ ɛpɛ ɛ bo a, na ɛkɔ ɛleka mɔɔ ɛkulo la, na saa ɛyɛ kpanyinli a, awie a bava wɔ ɛdanlɛ apɛ ɛ bo amaa wɔ a, na bɛ nee wɔ ahɔ ɛleka mɔɔ ɛngulo la.”<verse eid="JHN 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Gyisɛse hanle ɛhye vale hilele ewule holɛ ko mɔɔ Pita bawu ava awula Nana Nyamenle anyunlunyia la. Akee Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ “Toa me.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Pita hakyile ɔ nye ala la, ɔnwunle ɛdoavolɛ ne mɔɔ Gyisɛse kulo ye la kɛ ɔdoa bɛ, na yemɔ noko a vale ɔ ti dole Gyisɛse akɛnra zo wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ bɛde aleɛ nwo bɛdi la na ɔbizale Gyisɛse kɛ, “Awulae, yɛ nuhua ne boni yɛɛ baye wɔ amaa a?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Pita nwunle ye la ɔzele Gyisɛse kɛ, “Awulae, na nrenyia ɛhye noko ɛ?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Gyisɛse buale kɛ, “Saa mekulo kɛ ɔtɛnla ngoane nu kɔkpula melɛ mɔɔ menwɔzia menwɔra la a, ɔfale ɛ nwo ɔ? Wɔmɔ bɛla badoa me.”<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Edwɛkɛ ɛhye yɛle huhuhuhu wɔ ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anwo ɛkɛ, kɛ ɛdoavolɛ ko ne ɛnrɛwu; na Gyisɛse noko anze Pita kɛ zɔhane ɛdoavolɛ ne ɛnrɛwu. Mɔɔ ɔhanle la a le kɛ, “Saa mekulo kɛ ɔtɛnla ngoane nu kɔkpula kɛ menwɔra la a, ɛhye fale ɛ nwo ɔ?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Mame a le ɛdoavolɛ zɔhane a! Menwunle ɛhye mɔ amuala kɛ bɛlɛsisi; medi nwolɛ daselɛ, ɔti mehɛlɛ nwolɛ edwɛkɛ noko medo ɛkɛ. Yɛ muala noko yɛze kɛ, ye daselɛlilɛ ne amuala le nɔhalɛ tagyee bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Na medie medi noko kɛ, saa bɛhɛlɛle edwɛkɛ mɔɔ sisile kosooti wɔ Gyisɛse ɛbɛlabɔlɛ nu la a, anrɛɛ ewiade amuala ɛnrɛnyia ɛleka bɔbɔ ɛnrɛva mbuluku zɔhane mɔ ɛnrɛzie!<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>